export const carbonFootprintTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"የካርቦን የእግር አሻራ ሁኔታ ማስያ","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"የካርቦን አሻራ ማስያ - የልቀት ሁኔታዎችን ያወዳድሩ","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"አመታዊ CO2e ከኤሌትሪክ እና ከምንጩ የእንቅስቃሴ ምክንያቶችን ለማሞቅ ፣ ለማጓጓዝ እና ለበረራ ይገምቱ። በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ሁለት ሁኔታዎችን በግል ያወዳድሩ።","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"በኤሌክትሪክ፣ በሙቀት፣ በመሬት ትራንስፖርት እና በበረራዎች ውስጥ ያለውን ዓመታዊ እንቅስቃሴ ያወዳድሩ። ኤሌክትሪክ ቀኑ ያለፈበት ስዊዘርላንድ ወይም ኖርዌይ ትውልድ ምክንያት አለው። ለሌሎች ተግባራት ፋክተር አስገባ እና ምንጩን ጥቀስ።","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"ምሳሌ፡ የስዊዘርላንድን 2025 Ember gene factorን በመጠቀም 3,500 እና 2,800 kWh ያወዳድሩ። ውጤቱ የኤሌክትሪክ-ማመንጨት ግምት ብቻ ነው; ለሌሎች እንቅስቃሴዎች መነሻ ምክንያቶችን ያክሉ።","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"እያንዳንዱ ሴክተር እንደ አመታዊ እንቅስቃሴ በፋክቱ ተባዝቶ ይሰላል። መነሻ መስመርን ከተግባር ሁኔታ ጋር ለማነፃፀር የእንቅስቃሴ እሴቶቹን ይቀይሩ። ተመሳሳይ ምክንያቶች በሁለቱም ሁኔታዎች ላይ ይሠራሉ, ስለዚህ ልዩነቱ የእንቅስቃሴ ለውጦችን ያሳያል.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"ይህ የሁኔታ ግምት እንጂ የተሟላ የግል አሻራ፣ ይፋዊ ክምችት፣ ኦዲት ወይም የማካካሻ ሰርተፍኬት አይደለም። ኤሌክትሪክ የሚጠቀመው በፍጆታ ላይ የተመሰረተ ወይም የህይወት ዑደት ምክንያት ሳይሆን የትውልድ ጥንካሬን ነው። ማሞቂያ፣ ማጓጓዣ፣ በረራዎች እና ሌሎች ነገሮች በእርስዎ የቀረቡ ናቸው እና እንደ ምንጫቸው እና ተዛማጅ ክፍሎቹ ብቻ አስተማማኝ ናቸው።","Example":"ለምሳሌ","How the estimate works":"ግምቱ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Carbon estimate questions":"የካርቦን ግምት ጥያቄዎች","Scope and data sources":"ወሰን እና የውሂብ ምንጮች","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"ይህ የእኔን ሙሉ የካርበን አሻራ ያሰላል?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"ቁ. በአጠቃላይ የሚያስገቧቸውን እንቅስቃሴዎች ብቻ ያጠቃልላል። ምግብን፣ ግዢን፣ የህዝብ አገልግሎቶችን፣ ግንባታን ወይም ማንኛውንም የተተወ እንቅስቃሴን አያካትትም።","What does the electricity factor measure?":"የኤሌክትሪክ ፋክተር ምን ይለካል?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember የ CO2 የኤሌክትሪክ ኃይል በሀገር እና በዓመት ያለውን ጥንካሬ ዘግቧል። ይህ ግምት ከውጭ ለሚገቡ ምርቶች፣ የፍርግርግ ኪሳራዎች፣ የአቅራቢ ኮንትራቶች ወይም ወደ ላይ ለሚለቀቁት የህይወት ኡደት ልቀቶች አይስተካከልም።","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"ማሞቂያ፣ጉዞ እና የበረራ ምክንያቶች ከየት ይመጣሉ?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"እነዚህን ምክንያቶች አስገብተህ ምንጭ፣ ቀን፣ አሃድ እና ወሰን ጠቅሰሃል። ካልኩሌተሩ ከሌላ ሀገር የመጣ ነገርን በዝምታ አይተካም።","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"ተሽከርካሪ-ኪሜ እና ተሳፋሪ-ኪሜ ምክንያቶችን መጠቀም እችላለሁን?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"አዎ፣ ግን በትክክል ከምክንያቱ ጋር የሚዛመደውን መሠረት ይምረጡ። ለተሳፋሪ-ኪሜ ለአንድ መንገደኛ እና ተሽከርካሪ-ኪሜ ለአንድ ተሽከርካሪ አስገባ።","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"እነዚህ የተረጋገጡ ውጤቶች ናቸው ወይስ የካርቦን ማካካሻዎች?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"ቁ. ይህ በአሳሽ ላይ የተመሰረተ ንፅፅር ይፋዊ ቆጠራ፣ የምስክር ወረቀት ወይም የማካካሻ ግዢ አይደለም።","Electricity generation country":"የኤሌክትሪክ ኃይል ማመንጫ ሀገር","Switzerland":"ስዊዘርላንድ","Norway":"ኖርዌይ","Factor year":"የምክንያት ዓመት","Baseline":"መሰረታዊ","Action scenario":"የድርጊት ሁኔታ","Electricity use · kWh/year":"የኤሌክትሪክ አጠቃቀም · kWh/ዓመት","Heating use · kWh/year":"የሙቀት አጠቃቀም · kWh/ዓመት","Ground transport distance · km/year":"የመሬት ትራንስፖርት ርቀት · ኪሜ/ዓመት","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"የበረራ ርቀት · መንገደኛ-ኪሜ/ዓመት","Other activity · amount/year":"ሌላ እንቅስቃሴ · መጠን/ዓመት","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"የማሞቂያ ምክንያት · ኪግ CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"የሙቀት ምንጭ፣ ቀን እና ወሰን","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"የመሬት ትራንስፖርት ምክንያት · ኪግ CO2e/ ኪሜ","Factor basis":"የምክንያት መሠረት","Per vehicle-km":"በተሽከርካሪ-ኪሜ","Per passenger-km":"በተሳፋሪ-ኪሜ","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"የመሬት ትራንስፖርት ምክንያት ምንጭ፣ ቀን እና ወሰን","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"የበረራ ምክንያት · ኪግ CO2e/ተሳፋሪ-ኪሜ","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"የበረራ ምክንያት ምንጭ፣ ቀን እና ወሰን","Other factor unit name":"ሌላ አሃድ ስም","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"ሌላ ምክንያት · ኪግ CO2e/ ክፍል","Other factor source, date and boundary":"ሌላ ምክንያት ምንጭ፣ ቀን እና ወሰን","Compare scenarios":"ሁኔታዎችን አወዳድር","Load example":"የጭነት ምሳሌ","Clear values":"ዋጋዎችን አጽዳ","Download CSV":"CSV አውርድ","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"አመታዊ እንቅስቃሴ አስገባ። ለእያንዳንዱ ዜሮ ያልሆነ ምድብ ከኤሌክትሪክ ሌላ ተዛማጅ ሁኔታ እና ምንጭ ይጨምሩ።","Annual estimate by sector":"ዓመታዊ ግምት በዘርፍ","Baseline total":"የመነሻ ጠቅላላ","Action scenario total":"የተግባር ሁኔታ አጠቃላይ","Change":"ለውጥ","Change from baseline":"ከመነሻ መስመር ለውጥ","Factor source":"የምክንያት ምንጭ","Activity":"እንቅስቃሴ","Factor":"ምክንያት።","Baseline kg CO2e":"ቤዝላይን ኪሎ CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"ሁኔታ ኪ.ግ CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"ሁሉም እሴቶች በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ። ምንም አልተሰቀለም።","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · ዓመታዊ የኤሌክትሪክ መረጃ · CC BY 4.0 · ወደ ስዊዘርላንድ እና ኖርዌይ ተጣርቶ; 2000–2025. እሴቶች በ gCO2/kWh ውስጥ የማመንጨት ጥንካሬ ናቸው፣ ወደ kgCO2/kWh ይቀየራል። ይህ የፍጆታ ወይም የህይወት ዑደት ምክንያት አይደለም.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"ኤሌክትሪክ ላልሆኑ ምክንያቶች ከአገርዎ፣ እንቅስቃሴዎ፣ ክፍልዎ እና ዓመትዎ ጋር የሚዛመድ ምንጭ ይጠቀሙ። ግምቶቹን በኋላ መገምገም እንድትችል ጥቀስ።","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"እያንዳንዱን እንቅስቃሴ አንድ ጊዜ ይቁጠሩ። ከተዘረዘሩት ዘርፎች ውስጥ አንዱን የሚያካትት ድምርን አይጨምሩ።","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"የእንቅስቃሴ መጠኖችን፣ ፋክተሮችን፣ ፋክተር አሃዶችን እና የምንጭ ማስታወሻዎችን ያረጋግጡ። አዎንታዊ የኤሌክትሪክ-አልባ እንቅስቃሴ አዎንታዊ ምክንያት እና የተጠቀሰ ምንጭ ያስፈልገዋል.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} የእንቅስቃሴ ዘርፎችን በማሳየት ላይ። ሁለቱም ሁኔታዎች ተመሳሳይ ምክንያቶችን ይጠቀማሉ።","kWh":"kWh","km":"ኪ.ሜ","passenger-km":"ተሳፋሪ-ኪሜ","user-defined unit":"በተጠቃሚ የተገለጸ ክፍል","2000–2025":"2000-2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC በ 4.0"},"ar":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"حاسبة سيناريو البصمة الكربونية","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"حاسبة البصمة الكربونية — قارن سيناريوهات الانبعاثات","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"تقدير CO2e السنوي من الكهرباء وعوامل النشاط من مصادر التدفئة والنقل والرحلات الجوية. قارن بين سيناريوهين بشكل خاص في متصفحك.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"مقارنة النشاط السنوي في مجالات الكهرباء والتدفئة والنقل البري والطيران. إن عامل توليد الكهرباء قديم في سويسرا أو النرويج؛ بالنسبة للأنشطة الأخرى، أدخل العامل واذكر مصدره.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"مثال: قارن بين 3,500 و2,800 كيلووات ساعة باستخدام عامل توليد Ember 2025 في سويسرا. والنتيجة هي تقدير لتوليد الكهرباء فقط؛ إضافة عوامل مصادر للأنشطة الأخرى.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"يتم حساب كل قطاع كنشاط سنوي مضروبًا في العامل الخاص به. قم بتغيير قيم النشاط لمقارنة خط الأساس بسيناريو الإجراء. تنطبق نفس العوامل على كلا السيناريوهين، وبالتالي فإن الفرق يعكس تغييرات النشاط.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"هذا تقدير سيناريو، وليس بصمة شخصية كاملة، أو جرد رسمي، أو تدقيق، أو شهادة إزاحة. تستخدم الكهرباء كثافة التوليد، وليس عاملاً يعتمد على الاستهلاك أو دورة الحياة. يتم توفير التدفئة والنقل ورحلات الطيران والعوامل الأخرى بواسطتك، ولا يمكن الاعتماد عليها إلا بقدر مصدرها والوحدات المطابقة.","Example":"مثال","How the estimate works":"كيفية عمل التقدير","Carbon estimate questions":"أسئلة تقدير الكربون","Scope and data sources":"النطاق ومصادر البيانات","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"هل يؤدي هذا إلى حساب البصمة الكربونية الكاملة الخاصة بي؟","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"رقم. فهو يجمع فقط الأنشطة التي تدخلها. ولا يشمل الطعام أو المشتريات أو الخدمات العامة أو البناء أو أي نشاط محذوف.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"ما الذي يقيسه عامل الكهرباء؟","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember يُبلغ عن كثافة توليد الكهرباء من CO2 حسب البلد والسنة. لا يتم تعديل هذا التقدير للواردات أو خسائر الشبكة أو عقود الموردين أو انبعاثات دورة حياة المنبع.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"من أين تأتي عوامل التدفئة والسفر والطيران؟","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"قم بإدخال تلك العوامل واستشهد بالمصدر والتاريخ والوحدة والحدود التي يظهرها هذا المصدر. الآلة الحاسبة لا تستبدل بصمت عاملاً من بلد آخر.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"هل يمكنني استخدام عوامل عدد كيلومترات المركبة وعدد كيلومترات الركاب؟","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"نعم، ولكن حدد الأساس الذي يطابق العامل تمامًا. أدخل عدد الكيلومترات للركاب لعامل لكل راكب، وكم للمركبة لعامل لكل مركبة.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"هل هذه النتائج المعتمدة أم تعويضات الكربون؟","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"رقم. هذه المقارنة المستندة إلى المتصفح ليست مخزونًا رسميًا أو شهادة أو شراء أوفست.","Electricity generation country":"بلد توليد الكهرباء","Switzerland":"سويسرا","Norway":"النرويج","Factor year":"عامل السنة","Baseline":"خط الأساس","Action scenario":"سيناريو العمل","Electricity use · kWh/year":"استخدام الكهرباء · كيلووات ساعة/السنة","Heating use · kWh/year":"استخدام التدفئة · كيلووات ساعة/السنة","Ground transport distance · km/year":"مسافة النقل البري · كم/سنة","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"مسافة الرحلة · راكب-كم/سنة","Other activity · amount/year":"نشاط آخر · المبلغ/السنة","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"عامل التسخين · كجم CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"مصدر عامل التسخين وتاريخه وحدوده","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"عامل النقل البري · كجم CO2e/كم","Factor basis":"أساس العامل","Per vehicle-km":"لكل مركبة/كم","Per passenger-km":"لكل راكب-كم","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"مصدر عامل النقل البري وتاريخه وحدوده","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"عامل الطيران · كجم CO2e/الراكب-كم","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"مصدر عامل الطيران والتاريخ والحدود","Other factor unit name":"اسم وحدة العوامل الأخرى","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"عامل آخر · كجم CO2e/وحدة","Other factor source, date and boundary":"مصدر العامل الآخر والتاريخ والحدود","Compare scenarios":"مقارنة السيناريوهات","Load example":"تحميل المثال","Clear values":"مسح القيم","Download CSV":"تنزيل ملف CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"أدخل النشاط السنوي. أضف عامل ومصدر مطابقة لكل فئة غير الصفر بخلاف الكهرباء.","Annual estimate by sector":"التقدير السنوي حسب القطاع","Baseline total":"إجمالي خط الأساس","Action scenario total":"إجمالي سيناريو العمل","Change":"تغيير","Change from baseline":"التغيير من خط الأساس","Factor source":"مصدر العامل","Activity":"النشاط","Factor":"عامل","Baseline kg CO2e":"كجم خط الأساس CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"السيناريو كجم CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"تبقى جميع القيم في هذا المتصفح. لم يتم تحميل أي شيء.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · بيانات الكهرباء السنوية · CC BY 4.0 · تمت تصفيتها إلى سويسرا والنرويج؛ 2000–2025. القيم هي كثافة التوليد بوحدة gCO2/kWh، ويتم تحويلها إلى كجمCO2/kWh. هذا ليس عامل استهلاك أو دورة حياة.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"بالنسبة للعوامل غير الكهرباء، استخدم مصدرًا يتوافق مع بلدك ونشاطك ووحدتك وعامك. استشهد به حتى تتمكن من مراجعة الافتراضات لاحقًا.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"عد كل نشاط مرة واحدة. لا تقم بإضافة إجمالي يتضمن بالفعل أحد القطاعات المدرجة.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"التحقق من كميات النشاط والعوامل ووحدات العوامل وملاحظات المصدر. النشاط الإيجابي غير الكهرباء يحتاج إلى عامل إيجابي ومصدر مذكور.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"إظهار قطاعات نشاط {count}. يستخدم كلا السيناريوهين نفس افتراضات العامل.","kWh":"كيلووات ساعة","km":"كم","passenger-km":"الركاب كم","user-defined unit":"وحدة محددة من قبل المستخدم","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC بواسطة 4.0"},"bg":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Калкулатор за сценарий за въглероден отпечатък","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Калкулатор за въглероден отпечатък — Сравнете сценарии за емисии","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Прогнозирайте годишното CO2e от електричеството и източниците на фактори на дейност за отопление, транспорт и полети. Сравнете два сценария насаме във вашия браузър.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Сравнете годишната активност в електричеството, отоплението, наземния транспорт и полетите. Електричеството има датиран производствен фактор в Швейцария или Норвегия; за други дейности, въведете фактор и цитирайте неговия източник.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Пример: сравнете 3,500 и 2,800 kWh, като използвате швейцарския коефициент на генериране на жар 2025. Резултатът е само оценка на производството на електроенергия; добавете източници на фактори за други дейности.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Всеки сектор се изчислява като годишната дейност се умножи по неговия коефициент. Променете стойностите на активността, за да сравните базова линия със сценарий за действие. Едни и същи фактори се прилагат и за двата сценария, така че разликата отразява промените в дейността.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Това е сценарийна оценка, а не пълен личен отпечатък, официална инвентаризация, одит или офсетен сертификат. Електричеството използва интензитет на генериране, а не фактор, основан на потреблението или жизнения цикъл. Отоплението, транспортът, полетите и други фактори се предоставят от вас и са толкова надеждни, колкото и техните източници и съвпадащи единици.","Example":"Пример","How the estimate works":"Как работи оценката","Carbon estimate questions":"Въпроси за оценка на въглерода","Scope and data sources":"Обхват и източници на данни","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Това изчислява ли пълния ми въглероден отпечатък?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Бр. Той събира само въведените от вас дейности. Не включва храна, покупки, обществени услуги, строителство или каквато и да е пропусната дейност.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Какво измерва коефициентът на електричество?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember отчита CO2 интензивност на производството на електроенергия по държави и години. Тази оценка не коригира вноса, загубите в мрежата, договорите с доставчици или емисиите от жизнения цикъл нагоре по веригата.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Откъде идват факторите за отопление, пътуване и полет?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Въвеждате тези фактори и цитирате източника, датата, единицата и границата, показани от този източник. Калкулаторът не замества тихо фактор от друга държава.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Мога ли да използвам факторите превозно средство-км и пътник-км?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Да, но изберете основата, която точно съответства на фактора. Въведете пътник-км за фактор на пътник и превозно средство-км за фактор на превозно средство.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Това сертифицирани резултати ли са или въглеродни компенсации?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Бр. Това сравнение, базирано на браузър, не е официална инвентаризация, сертифициране или компенсирана покупка.","Electricity generation country":"Държава за производство на електроенергия","Switzerland":"Швейцария","Norway":"Норвегия","Factor year":"Коефициент година","Baseline":"Базова линия","Action scenario":"Сценарий за действие","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Използване на електроенергия · kWh/година","Heating use · kWh/year":"Използване на отопление · kWh/година","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Разстояние за наземен транспорт · км/година","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Разстояние на полета · пътник-km/година","Other activity · amount/year":"Друга дейност · сума/год","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Отоплителен фактор · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Източник на топлинен фактор, дата и граница","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Коефициент на наземен транспорт · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Факторна основа","Per vehicle-km":"На превозно средство-км","Per passenger-km":"На пътник-км","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Източник на наземен транспортен фактор, дата и граница","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Коефициент на полет · kg CO2e/пътник-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Източник на полетния фактор, дата и граница","Other factor unit name":"Име на друга факторна единица","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Друг фактор · kg CO2e/единица","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Друг източник на фактор, дата и граница","Compare scenarios":"Сравнете сценарии","Load example":"Пример за зареждане","Clear values":"Изчистване на стойностите","Download CSV":"Изтеглете CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Въведете годишна дейност. Добавете коефициент на съвпадение и източник за всяка ненулева категория, различна от електричество.","Annual estimate by sector":"Годишна оценка по сектори","Baseline total":"Базово общо","Action scenario total":"Общ сценарий на действие","Change":"Промяна","Change from baseline":"Промяна от базовата линия","Factor source":"Източник на фактор","Activity":"Дейност","Factor":"Фактор","Baseline kg CO2e":"Базова линия kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Сценарий kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Всички стойности остават в този браузър. Нищо не е качено.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Годишни данни за електроенергията · CC BY 4.0 · филтрирани до Швейцария и Норвегия; 2000–2025. Стойностите са интензитет на генериране в gCO2/kWh, преобразувани в kgCO2/kWh. Това не е фактор за консумация или жизнен цикъл.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"За фактори, различни от електричество, използвайте източник, който съответства на вашата държава, дейност, единица и година. Цитирайте го, за да можете да прегледате предположенията по-късно.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Пребройте всяка дейност веднъж. Не добавяйте обща сума, която вече включва един от изброените сектори.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Проверете количествата на активността, факторите, факторните единици и бележките към източника. Положителната неелектрическа дейност се нуждае от положителен фактор и цитиран източник.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Показани са {count} сектори на дейност. И двата сценария използват едни и същи факторни допускания.","kWh":"kWh","km":"км","passenger-km":"пътник-км","user-defined unit":"дефинирана от потребителя единица","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC ОТ 4.0"},"bn":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"কার্বন ফুটপ্রিন্ট সিনারিও ক্যালকুলেটর","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"কার্বন ফুটপ্রিন্ট ক্যালকুলেটর — নির্গমন পরিস্থিতি তুলনা করুন","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"ইলেক্ট্রিসিটি থেকে বাৎসরিক CO2e হিটিং, পরিবহন এবং ফ্লাইটের জন্য প্রাপ্ত কার্যকলাপের কারণের অনুমান। আপনার ব্রাউজারে ব্যক্তিগতভাবে দুটি পরিস্থিতির তুলনা করুন।","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"বিদ্যুৎ, গরম, স্থল পরিবহন এবং ফ্লাইটের বার্ষিক কার্যকলাপের তুলনা করুন। বিদ্যুতের একটি তারিখযুক্ত সুইজারল্যান্ড বা নরওয়ে জেনারেশন ফ্যাক্টর আছে; অন্যান্য ক্রিয়াকলাপের জন্য, একটি ফ্যাক্টর লিখুন এবং এর উত্স উল্লেখ করুন।","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"উদাহরণ: সুইজারল্যান্ডের 2025 এমবার জেনারেশন ফ্যাক্টর ব্যবহার করে 3,500 এবং 2,800 kWh তুলনা করুন। ফলাফল শুধুমাত্র একটি বিদ্যুৎ-উৎপাদন অনুমান; অন্যান্য ক্রিয়াকলাপের জন্য উত্সযুক্ত কারণগুলি যুক্ত করুন।","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"প্রতিটি সেক্টরকে তার ফ্যাক্টর দ্বারা গুণিত বার্ষিক কার্যকলাপ হিসাবে গণনা করা হয়। একটি কর্ম দৃশ্যের সাথে একটি বেসলাইন তুলনা করতে কার্যকলাপ মান পরিবর্তন করুন. একই কারণ উভয় পরিস্থিতিতে প্রযোজ্য, তাই পার্থক্য কার্যকলাপ পরিবর্তন প্রতিফলিত.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"এটি একটি দৃশ্যের অনুমান, সম্পূর্ণ ব্যক্তিগত পদচিহ্ন, অফিসিয়াল ইনভেন্টরি, অডিট বা অফসেট শংসাপত্র নয়। বিদ্যুৎ উৎপাদনের তীব্রতা ব্যবহার করে, ব্যবহার-ভিত্তিক বা জীবনচক্র ফ্যাক্টর নয়। গরম, পরিবহন, ফ্লাইট এবং অন্যান্য কারণগুলি আপনার দ্বারা সরবরাহ করা হয় এবং শুধুমাত্র তাদের উত্স এবং মিলিত ইউনিট হিসাবে নির্ভরযোগ্য।","Example":"উদাহরণ","How the estimate works":"কিভাবে অনুমান কাজ করে","Carbon estimate questions":"কার্বন অনুমান প্রশ্ন","Scope and data sources":"স্কোপ এবং ডেটা সোর্স","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"এটি কি আমার সম্পূর্ণ কার্বন পদচিহ্ন গণনা করে?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"না। এটি শুধুমাত্র আপনার প্রবেশ করা কার্যকলাপগুলিকে মোট করে৷ এটি খাদ্য, ক্রয়, জনসেবা, নির্মাণ, বা কোনো বাদ দেওয়া কার্যকলাপ অন্তর্ভুক্ত করে না।","What does the electricity factor measure?":"বিদ্যুতের ফ্যাক্টর কি পরিমাপ করে?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember দেশ এবং বছর অনুসারে বিদ্যুৎ উৎপাদনের তীব্রতা CO2 রিপোর্ট করে৷ এই অনুমান আমদানি, গ্রিড ক্ষতি, সরবরাহকারী চুক্তি, বা আপস্ট্রিম জীবনচক্র নির্গমনের জন্য সামঞ্জস্য করে না।","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"তাপীকরণ, ভ্রমণ এবং ফ্লাইটের কারণগুলি কোথা থেকে আসে?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"আপনি সেই কারণগুলি লিখুন এবং উত্স, তারিখ, ইউনিট এবং সেই উত্স দ্বারা প্রদর্শিত সীমানা উল্লেখ করুন৷ ক্যালকুলেটর নীরবে অন্য দেশের একটি ফ্যাক্টর প্রতিস্থাপন করে না।","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"আমি কি যানবাহন-কিমি এবং যাত্রী-কিমি ফ্যাক্টর ব্যবহার করতে পারি?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"হ্যাঁ, কিন্তু ফ্যাক্টরের সাথে হুবহু মেলে এমন ভিত্তি নির্বাচন করুন। প্রতি-যাত্রী ফ্যাক্টরের জন্য যাত্রী-কিমি এবং যানবাহন-প্রতি ফ্যাক্টরের জন্য যান-কিমি লিখুন।","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"এইগুলি কি প্রত্যয়িত ফলাফল নাকি কার্বন অফসেট?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"না। এই ব্রাউজার-ভিত্তিক তুলনা একটি অফিসিয়াল ইনভেন্টরি, সার্টিফিকেশন, বা অফসেট ক্রয় নয়।","Electricity generation country":"বিদ্যুৎ উৎপাদনের দেশ","Switzerland":"সুইজারল্যান্ড","Norway":"নরওয়ে","Factor year":"ফ্যাক্টর বছর","Baseline":"বেসলাইন","Action scenario":"অ্যাকশন দৃশ্যকল্প","Electricity use · kWh/year":"বিদ্যুতের ব্যবহার · kWh/বছর","Heating use · kWh/year":"হিটিং ব্যবহার · kWh/বছর","Ground transport distance · km/year":"স্থল পরিবহন দূরত্ব · কিমি/বছর","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"ফ্লাইটের দূরত্ব · যাত্রী-কিমি/বছর","Other activity · amount/year":"অন্যান্য কার্যকলাপ · পরিমাণ/বছর","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"হিটিং ফ্যাক্টর · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"হিটিং ফ্যাক্টর উত্স, তারিখ এবং সীমানা","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"গ্রাউন্ড ট্রান্সপোর্ট ফ্যাক্টর · kg CO2e/কিমি","Factor basis":"ফ্যাক্টর বেসিস","Per vehicle-km":"প্রতি গাড়ি-কিমি","Per passenger-km":"প্রতি যাত্রী-কিমি","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"গ্রাউন্ড ট্রান্সপোর্ট ফ্যাক্টর সোর্স, তারিখ এবং সীমানা","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"ফ্লাইট ফ্যাক্টর · kg CO2e/যাত্রী-কিমি","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"ফ্লাইট ফ্যাক্টর উত্স, তারিখ এবং সীমানা","Other factor unit name":"অন্যান্য ফ্যাক্টর ইউনিটের নাম","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"অন্যান্য ফ্যাক্টর · kg CO2e/ইউনিট","Other factor source, date and boundary":"অন্যান্য ফ্যাক্টর উৎস, তারিখ এবং সীমানা","Compare scenarios":"পরিস্থিতির তুলনা করুন","Load example":"লোড উদাহরণ","Clear values":"পরিষ্কার মান","Download CSV":"CSV ডাউনলোড করুন","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"বার্ষিক কার্যকলাপ লিখুন। বিদ্যুত ব্যতীত প্রতিটি অ-শূন্য বিভাগের জন্য একটি মিলে যাওয়া ফ্যাক্টর এবং উত্স যোগ করুন।","Annual estimate by sector":"খাত অনুসারে বার্ষিক অনুমান","Baseline total":"বেসলাইন মোট","Action scenario total":"মোট অ্যাকশন দৃশ্যকল্প","Change":"পরিবর্তন","Change from baseline":"বেসলাইন থেকে পরিবর্তন","Factor source":"ফ্যাক্টর সোর্স","Activity":"ক্রিয়াকলাপ","Factor":"ফ্যাক্টর","Baseline kg CO2e":"বেসলাইন কেজি CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"দৃশ্য কেজি CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"সমস্ত মান এই ব্রাউজারে থাকে। কিছুই আপলোড করা হয় না.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · বার্ষিক বিদ্যুৎ ডেটা · CC BY 4.0 · সুইজারল্যান্ড এবং নরওয়েতে ফিল্টার করা হয়েছে; 2000–2025। মান হল gCO2/kWh-এ প্রজন্মের তীব্রতা, kgCO2/kWh-এ রূপান্তরিত। এটি একটি খরচ বা জীবনচক্র ফ্যাক্টর নয়.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"অ-বিদ্যুত কারণগুলির জন্য, আপনার দেশ, কার্যকলাপ, ইউনিট এবং বছরের সাথে মেলে এমন একটি উত্স ব্যবহার করুন৷ এটি উদ্ধৃত করুন যাতে আপনি পরে অনুমানগুলি পর্যালোচনা করতে পারেন।","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"প্রতিটি কার্যকলাপ একবার গণনা করুন। ইতিমধ্যে তালিকাভুক্ত সেক্টরগুলির মধ্যে একটি অন্তর্ভুক্ত রয়েছে এমন মোট যোগ করবেন না।","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"অ্যাক্টিভিটির পরিমাণ, ফ্যাক্টর, ফ্যাক্টর ইউনিট এবং সোর্স নোট চেক করুন। ইতিবাচক অ-বিদ্যুত কার্যকলাপের জন্য একটি ইতিবাচক ফ্যাক্টর এবং একটি উদ্ধৃত উত্স প্রয়োজন।","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} কার্যকলাপ সেক্টর দেখানো হচ্ছে। উভয় পরিস্থিতিতেই একই ফ্যাক্টর অনুমান ব্যবহার করে।","kWh":"kWh","km":"কিমি","passenger-km":"যাত্রী-কিমি","user-defined unit":"ব্যবহারকারী-সংজ্ঞায়িত ইউনিট","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"4.0 দ্বারা CC"},"ca":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora d'escenaris de petjada de carboni","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Calculadora de la petjada de carboni — Comparar escenaris d'emissions","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Estima CO2e anual a partir de l'electricitat i els factors d'activitat d'origen per a la calefacció, el transport i els vols. Compareu dos escenaris de manera privada al vostre navegador.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Compara l'activitat anual en electricitat, calefacció, transport terrestre i vols. L'electricitat té un factor de generació de Suïssa o Noruega datat; per a altres activitats, introduïu un factor i cita'n la font.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Exemple: compareu 3,500 i 2,800 kWh utilitzant el factor de generació Ember de Suïssa 2025. El resultat és només una estimació de generació d'electricitat; afegir factors d'origen per a altres activitats.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Cada sector es calcula com a activitat anual multiplicada pel seu factor. Canvieu els valors de l'activitat per comparar una línia de base amb un escenari d'acció. Els mateixos factors s'apliquen als dos escenaris, de manera que la diferència reflecteix els canvis d'activitat.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Aquesta és una estimació d'escenari, no una petjada personal completa, un inventari oficial, una auditoria o un certificat de compensació. L'electricitat utilitza la intensitat de generació, no un factor basat en el consum o el cicle de vida. La calefacció, el transport, els vols i altres factors els proporcioneu vosaltres i només són tan fiables com la seva font i les unitats coincidents.","Example":"Exemple","How the estimate works":"Com funciona el pressupost","Carbon estimate questions":"Preguntes d'estimació de carboni","Scope and data sources":"Àmbit i fonts de dades","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Això calcula la meva petjada de carboni completa?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Núm. Només suma les activitats que introduïu. No inclou menjar, compres, serveis públics, construcció o qualsevol activitat omesa.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Què mesura el factor elèctric?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember informa CO2 de la intensitat de generació d'electricitat per país i any. Aquesta estimació no s'ajusta per importacions, pèrdues de xarxa, contractes amb proveïdors o emissions del cicle de vida amunt.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"D'on provenen els factors de calefacció, viatges i vol?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Introduïu aquests factors i citeu la font, la data, la unitat i el límit que mostra aquesta font. La calculadora no substitueix en silenci un factor d'un altre país.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Puc utilitzar els factors vehicle-km i passatgers-km?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Sí, però seleccioneu la base que coincideixi exactament amb el factor. Introduïu passatgers-km per a un factor per passatger i vehicle-km per a un factor per vehicle.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Són resultats certificats o compensacions de carboni?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Núm. Aquesta comparació basada en navegador no és un inventari oficial, una certificació o una compra compensada.","Electricity generation country":"País de generació d'electricitat","Switzerland":"Suïssa","Norway":"Noruega","Factor year":"Factor any","Baseline":"Línia de base","Action scenario":"Escenari d'acció","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Consum d'electricitat · kWh/any","Heating use · kWh/year":"Utilització de calefacció · kWh/any","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Distància de transport terrestre · km/any","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Distància de vol · passatger-km/any","Other activity · amount/year":"Altra activitat · import/any","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Factor de calefacció · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Font, data i límit del factor de calefacció","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Factor de transport terrestre · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Factor base","Per vehicle-km":"Per vehicle-km","Per passenger-km":"Per passatger-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Font, data i límit del factor de transport terrestre","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Factor de vol · kg CO2e/passatger-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Font del factor de vol, data i límit","Other factor unit name":"Nom d'un altre factor","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Altre factor · kg CO2e/unitat","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Altra font, data i límit de factors","Compare scenarios":"Compara escenaris","Load example":"Exemple de càrrega","Clear values":"Esborra els valors","Download CSV":"Baixa CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Introdueix l'activitat anual. Afegiu un factor i una font coincidents per a cada categoria diferent de zero que no sigui l'electricitat.","Annual estimate by sector":"Estimació anual per sectors","Baseline total":"Total de referència","Action scenario total":"Escenari d'acció total","Change":"Canvi","Change from baseline":"Canvi des de la línia de base","Factor source":"Font del factor","Activity":"Activitat","Factor":"Factor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Línia de base kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Escenari kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Tots els valors romanen en aquest navegador. No s'ha carregat res.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Dades anuals d'electricitat · CC BY 4.0 · filtrat a Suïssa i Noruega; 2000–2025. Els valors són la intensitat de generació en gCO2/kWh, convertida en kgCO2/kWh. Aquest no és un factor de consum o cicle de vida.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Per a factors no elèctrics, utilitzeu una font que coincideixi amb el vostre país, activitat, unitat i any. Citeu-lo perquè pugueu revisar els supòsits més endavant.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Compteu cada activitat una vegada. No afegiu un total que ja inclogui un dels sectors enumerats.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Comproveu les quantitats d'activitats, factors, unitats de factors i notes font. L'activitat positiva no elèctrica necessita un factor positiu i una font citada.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Es mostren els sectors d'activitat {count}. Tots dos escenaris utilitzen els mateixos supòsits de factors.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"passatgers-km","user-defined unit":"unitat definida per l'usuari","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"de":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Carbon Footprint-Szenario-Rechner","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Carbon-Fußabdruck-Rechner – Emissionsszenarien vergleichen","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Schätzung der jährlichen CO2e aus Strom und bezogenen Aktivitätsfaktoren für Heizung, Transport und Flüge. Vergleichen Sie zwei Szenarien privat in Ihrem Browser.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Vergleichen Sie die jährliche Aktivität in den Bereichen Strom, Heizung, Bodentransport und Flüge. Strom hat einen veralteten Erzeugungsfaktor in der Schweiz oder Norwegen; Geben Sie für andere Aktivitäten einen Faktor ein und geben Sie seine Quelle an.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Beispiel: Vergleichen Sie 3,500 und 2,800 kWh unter Verwendung des Schweizer Gluterzeugungsfaktors 2025. Das Ergebnis ist lediglich eine Schätzung der Stromerzeugung; Fügen Sie Quellenfaktoren für andere Aktivitäten hinzu.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Jeder Sektor wird als jährliche Aktivität multipliziert mit seinem Faktor berechnet. Ändern Sie die Aktivitätswerte, um eine Baseline mit einem Aktionsszenario zu vergleichen. Für beide Szenarien gelten die gleichen Faktoren, sodass der Unterschied Aktivitätsänderungen widerspiegelt.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Dies ist eine Szenarioschätzung, kein vollständiger persönlicher Fußabdruck, keine offizielle Bestandsaufnahme, Prüfung oder Ausgleichsbescheinigung. Bei Strom wird die Erzeugungsintensität genutzt, kein verbrauchs- oder lebenszyklusbezogener Faktor. Heizung, Transport, Flüge und andere Faktoren werden von Ihnen bereitgestellt und sind nur so zuverlässig wie ihre Quelle und die passenden Einheiten.","Example":"Beispiel","How the estimate works":"So funktioniert die Schätzung","Carbon estimate questions":"Fragen zur CO2-Schätzung","Scope and data sources":"Umfang und Datenquellen","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Wird dadurch mein vollständiger CO2-Fußabdruck berechnet?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Nr. Es werden nur die von Ihnen eingegebenen Aktivitäten summiert. Es umfasst nicht Lebensmittel, Einkäufe, öffentliche Dienstleistungen, Bauarbeiten oder unterlassene Aktivitäten.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Was misst der Stromfaktor?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember meldet CO2 Intensität der Stromerzeugung nach Land und Jahr. Diese Schätzung berücksichtigt keine Importe, Netzverluste, Lieferantenverträge oder vorgelagerte Lebenszyklusemissionen.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Woher kommen die Faktoren Heizung, Reisen und Flug?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Sie geben diese Faktoren ein und geben die von dieser Quelle angezeigte Quelle, das Datum, die Einheit und die Grenze an. Der Rechner ersetzt nicht stillschweigend einen Faktor aus einem anderen Land.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Kann ich Fahrzeug-km- und Passagier-km-Faktoren verwenden?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ja, aber wählen Sie die Basis aus, die genau zum Faktor passt. Geben Sie Passagier-km für einen Pro-Passagier-Faktor und Fahrzeug-km für einen Pro-Fahrzeug-Faktor ein.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Sind das zertifizierte Ergebnisse oder CO2-Ausgleich?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Nr. Bei diesem browserbasierten Vergleich handelt es sich nicht um eine offizielle Bestandsaufnahme, Zertifizierung oder einen Offset-Kauf.","Electricity generation country":"Stromerzeugungsland","Switzerland":"Schweiz","Norway":"Norwegen","Factor year":"Faktorjahr","Baseline":"Grundlinie","Action scenario":"Aktionsszenario","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Stromverbrauch · kWh/Jahr","Heating use · kWh/year":"Heizverbrauch · kWh/Jahr","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Bodentransportentfernung · km/Jahr","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Flugdistanz · Passagier-km/Jahr","Other activity · amount/year":"Sonstige Aktivität · Betrag/Jahr","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Heizfaktor · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Quelle, Datum und Grenze des Heizfaktors","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Bodentransportfaktor · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Faktorbasis","Per vehicle-km":"Pro Fahrzeug-km","Per passenger-km":"Pro Passagierkilometer","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Quelle, Datum und Grenze des Bodentransportfaktors","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Flugfaktor · kg CO2e/Passagier-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Flugfaktorquelle, Datum und Grenze","Other factor unit name":"Name einer anderen Faktoreinheit","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Anderer Faktor · kg CO2e/Einheit","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Andere Faktorquelle, Datum und Grenze","Compare scenarios":"Szenarien vergleichen","Load example":"Beispiel laden","Clear values":"Werte löschen","Download CSV":"CSV herunterladen","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Geben Sie die jährliche Aktivität ein. Fügen Sie für jede Nicht-Null-Kategorie außer Strom einen passenden Faktor und eine passende Quelle hinzu.","Annual estimate by sector":"Jährliche Schätzung nach Sektor","Baseline total":"Basissumme","Action scenario total":"Aktionsszenario insgesamt","Change":"Ändern","Change from baseline":"Änderung gegenüber dem Ausgangswert","Factor source":"Faktorquelle","Activity":"Aktivität","Factor":"Faktor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Grundlinie kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Szenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Alle Werte bleiben in diesem Browser. Es wird nichts hochgeladen.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Jährliche Stromdaten · CC BY 4.0 · gefiltert nach Schweiz und Norwegen; 2000–2025. Die Werte sind die Erzeugungsintensität in gCO2/kWh, umgerechnet in kgCO2/kWh. Dies ist kein Verbrauchs- oder Lebenszyklusfaktor.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Verwenden Sie für nicht-elektrische Faktoren eine Quelle, die Ihrem Land, Ihrer Aktivität, Ihrer Einheit und Ihrem Jahr entspricht. Zitieren Sie es, damit Sie die Annahmen später überprüfen können.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Jede Aktivität einmal zählen. Addieren Sie keine Summe, die bereits einen der aufgeführten Sektoren enthält.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Überprüfen Sie die Aktivitätsbeträge, Faktoren, Faktoreinheiten und Quellenhinweise. Für eine positive nichtelektrische Aktivität sind ein positiver Faktor und eine angegebene Quelle erforderlich.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Zeigt {count} Aktivitätssektoren. Beide Szenarien verwenden die gleichen Faktorannahmen.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"Passagier-km","user-defined unit":"benutzerdefinierte Einheit","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC VON 4.0"},"el":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Carbon Footprint","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Υπολογιστής αποτυπώματος άνθρακα — Σύγκριση σεναρίων εκπομπής","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Υπολογίστε το ετήσιο CO2e από την ηλεκτρική ενέργεια και τους παράγοντες δραστηριότητας προέλευσης για θέρμανση, μεταφορά και πτήσεις. Συγκρίνετε δύο σενάρια ιδιωτικά στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Συγκρίνετε την ετήσια δραστηριότητα στον ηλεκτρισμό, τη θέρμανση, τις επίγειες μεταφορές και τις πτήσεις. Η ηλεκτρική ενέργεια έχει χρονολογημένο συντελεστή παραγωγής Ελβετίας ή Νορβηγίας. για άλλες δραστηριότητες, εισαγάγετε έναν παράγοντα και αναφέρετε την πηγή του.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Παράδειγμα: συγκρίνετε τα 3,500 και 2,800 kWh χρησιμοποιώντας τον συντελεστή παραγωγής χόβολης 2025 της Ελβετίας. Το αποτέλεσμα είναι μόνο μια εκτίμηση παραγωγής ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας. προσθέστε παράγοντες προέλευσης για άλλες δραστηριότητες.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Κάθε τομέας υπολογίζεται ως ετήσια δραστηριότητα πολλαπλασιαζόμενη με τον συντελεστή του. Αλλάξτε τις τιμές δραστηριότητας για να συγκρίνετε μια γραμμή βάσης με ένα σενάριο δράσης. Οι ίδιοι παράγοντες ισχύουν και για τα δύο σενάρια, επομένως η διαφορά αντανακλά τις αλλαγές δραστηριότητας.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Αυτή είναι μια εκτίμηση σεναρίου, όχι ένα πλήρες προσωπικό αποτύπωμα, επίσημο απόθεμα, έλεγχος ή πιστοποιητικό αντιστάθμισης. Η ηλεκτρική ενέργεια χρησιμοποιεί την ένταση παραγωγής, όχι έναν παράγοντα που βασίζεται στην κατανάλωση ή τον κύκλο ζωής. Η θέρμανση, η μεταφορά, οι πτήσεις και άλλοι παράγοντες παρέχονται από εσάς και είναι τόσο αξιόπιστα όσο η πηγή τους και οι αντίστοιχες μονάδες.","Example":"Παράδειγμα","How the estimate works":"Πώς λειτουργεί η εκτίμηση","Carbon estimate questions":"Ερωτήσεις εκτίμησης άνθρακα","Scope and data sources":"Εύρος και πηγές δεδομένων","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Υπολογίζει αυτό το πλήρες αποτύπωμα άνθρακα μου;","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Αρ. Αριθμεί μόνο τις δραστηριότητες που εισάγετε. Δεν περιλαμβάνει τρόφιμα, αγορές, δημόσιες υπηρεσίες, κατασκευές ή οποιαδήποτε παραλειπόμενη δραστηριότητα.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Τι μετράει ο συντελεστής ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας;\nΤο","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Η Ember αναφέρει CO2 ένταση παραγωγής ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας ανά χώρα και έτος. Αυτή η εκτίμηση δεν προσαρμόζεται για εισαγωγές, απώλειες δικτύου, συμβάσεις προμηθευτών ή εκπομπές ανάντη κύκλου ζωής.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Από πού προέρχονται οι παράγοντες θέρμανσης, ταξιδιού και πτήσης;","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Εισαγάγετε αυτούς τους παράγοντες και αναφέρετε την πηγή, την ημερομηνία, τη μονάδα και τα όρια που εμφανίζονται από αυτήν την πηγή. Η αριθμομηχανή δεν υποκαθιστά σιωπηλά έναν παράγοντα από άλλη χώρα.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Μπορώ να χρησιμοποιήσω συντελεστές οχήματος-χλμ και επιβατών χιλιομέτρων;","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ναι, αλλά επιλέξτε τη βάση που ταιριάζει ακριβώς με τον παράγοντα. Εισαγάγετε επιβάτη-χλμ για συντελεστή ανά επιβάτη και όχημα-χλμ για συντελεστή ανά όχημα.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Είναι πιστοποιημένα αποτελέσματα ή αντισταθμίσεις άνθρακα;","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Αρ. Αυτή η σύγκριση που βασίζεται σε πρόγραμμα περιήγησης δεν αποτελεί επίσημο απόθεμα, πιστοποίηση ή αγορά αντιστάθμισης.","Electricity generation country":"Χώρα παραγωγής ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας","Switzerland":"Ελβετία","Norway":"Νορβηγία","Factor year":"Συντελεστής χρονιάς","Baseline":"Βασική γραμμή","Action scenario":"Σενάριο δράσης","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Χρήση ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας · kWh/έτος","Heating use · kWh/year":"Χρήση θέρμανσης · kWh/έτος","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Απόσταση επίγειας μεταφοράς · km/έτος","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Απόσταση πτήσης · επιβάτες-χλμ/έτος","Other activity · amount/year":"Άλλη δραστηριότητα · ποσό/έτος","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Συντελεστής θέρμανσης · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Πηγή, ημερομηνία και όριο συντελεστή θέρμανσης","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Συντελεστής μεταφοράς εδάφους · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Βάση συντελεστών","Per vehicle-km":"Ανά όχημα-χλμ","Per passenger-km":"Ανά επιβάτη-χλμ","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Πηγή, ημερομηνία και όριο συντελεστή μεταφοράς εδάφους","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Συντελεστής πτήσης · kg CO2e/επιβάτης-χλμ","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Πηγή, ημερομηνία και όριο συντελεστή πτήσης","Other factor unit name":"Όνομα άλλης μονάδας παράγοντα","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Άλλος παράγοντας · kg CO2e/μονάδα","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Άλλος παράγοντας πηγή, ημερομηνία και όριο","Compare scenarios":"Σύγκριση σεναρίων","Load example":"Παράδειγμα φόρτωσης","Clear values":"Διαγραφή τιμών","Download CSV":"Λήψη CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Εισαγάγετε την ετήσια δραστηριότητα. Προσθέστε έναν συντελεστή και πηγή αντιστοίχισης για κάθε μη μηδενική κατηγορία εκτός από την ηλεκτρική ενέργεια.","Annual estimate by sector":"Ετήσια εκτίμηση ανά τομέα","Baseline total":"Σύνολο βασικής γραμμής","Action scenario total":"Σύνολο σεναρίου δράσης","Change":"Αλλαγή","Change from baseline":"Αλλαγή από τη γραμμή βάσης","Factor source":"Πηγή παράγοντα","Activity":"Δραστηριότητα","Factor":"Συντελεστής","Baseline kg CO2e":"Βασικό kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Σενάριο kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Όλες οι τιμές παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Δεν έχει ανέβει τίποτα.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Ετήσια δεδομένα ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας · CC BY 4.0 · φιλτράρεται στην Ελβετία και τη Νορβηγία. 2000–2025. Οι τιμές είναι η ένταση παραγωγής σε gCO2/kWh, μετατρέπονται σε kgCO2/kWh. Αυτό δεν είναι παράγοντας κατανάλωσης ή κύκλου ζωής.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Για παράγοντες που δεν αφορούν την ηλεκτρική ενέργεια, χρησιμοποιήστε μια πηγή που ταιριάζει με τη χώρα, τη δραστηριότητα, τη μονάδα και το έτος σας. Αναφέρετέ το για να μπορείτε να αναθεωρήσετε τις υποθέσεις αργότερα.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Μετρήστε κάθε δραστηριότητα μία φορά. Μην προσθέσετε ένα σύνολο που περιλαμβάνει ήδη έναν από τους τομείς που αναφέρονται.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Ελέγξτε τα ποσά δραστηριότητας, τους παράγοντες, τις μονάδες συντελεστών και τις σημειώσεις πηγής. Η θετική δραστηριότητα εκτός της ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας χρειάζεται έναν θετικό παράγοντα και μια αναφερόμενη πηγή.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Εμφάνιση τομέων δραστηριότητας {count}. Και τα δύο σενάρια χρησιμοποιούν τις ίδιες παραδοχές παραγόντων.","kWh":"kWh","km":"χλμ","passenger-km":"επιβατικό-χλμ","user-defined unit":"μονάδα που ορίζεται από το χρήστη","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"es":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de escenarios de huella de carbono","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Calculadora de huella de carbono: comparación de escenarios de emisiones","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Estimación CO2e anual a partir de electricidad y factores de actividad obtenidos para calefacción, transporte y vuelos. Compare dos escenarios de forma privada en su navegador.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Comparar la actividad anual en electricidad, calefacción, transporte terrestre y vuelos. La electricidad tiene un factor de generación anticuado en Suiza o Noruega; para otras actividades, ingrese un factor y cite su fuente.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Ejemplo: compare 3,500 y 2,800 kWh utilizando el factor de generación de ascuas 2025 de Suiza. El resultado es únicamente una estimación de la generación de electricidad; agregar factores de origen para otras actividades.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Cada sector se calcula como la actividad anual multiplicada por su factor. Cambie los valores de la actividad para comparar una línea de base con un escenario de acción. Los mismos factores se aplican a ambos escenarios, por lo que la diferencia refleja cambios en la actividad.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Esta es una estimación de escenario, no una huella personal completa, un inventario oficial, una auditoría o un certificado de compensación. La electricidad utiliza la intensidad de generación, no un factor basado en el consumo o el ciclo de vida. La calefacción, el transporte, los vuelos y otros factores los suministra usted y son tan fiables como su fuente y sus unidades correspondientes.","Example":"Ejemplo","How the estimate works":"Cómo funciona el presupuesto","Carbon estimate questions":"Preguntas sobre estimación de carbono","Scope and data sources":"Alcance y fuentes de datos","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"¿Esto calcula mi huella de carbono completa?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"No. Totaliza sólo las actividades que usted ingresa. No incluye alimentos, compras, servicios públicos, construcción o cualquier actividad omitida.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"¿Qué mide el factor eléctrico?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember informa CO2 intensidad de generación eléctrica por país y año. Esta estimación no se ajusta a las importaciones, pérdidas de la red, contratos con proveedores o emisiones del ciclo de vida upstream.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"¿De dónde vienen los factores de calefacción, viajes y vuelos?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Ingresa esos factores y cita la fuente, fecha, unidad y límite mostrados por esa fuente. La calculadora no sustituye silenciosamente un factor de otro país.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"¿Puedo utilizar factores vehículo-km y pasajero-km?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Sí, pero seleccione la base que coincida exactamente con el factor. Ingrese pasajeros-km para un factor por pasajero y vehículo-km para un factor por vehículo.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"¿Son estos resultados certificados o compensaciones de carbono?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"No. Esta comparación basada en navegador no es un inventario, una certificación ni una compra de compensación oficial.","Electricity generation country":"País de generación de electricidad","Switzerland":"Suiza","Norway":"Noruega","Factor year":"Factor año","Baseline":"Línea base","Action scenario":"Escenario de acción","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Consumo de electricidad · kWh/año","Heating use · kWh/year":"Consumo de calefacción · kWh/año","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Distancia de transporte terrestre · km/año","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Distancia de vuelo · pasajero-km/año","Other activity · amount/year":"Otra actividad · importe/año","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Factor de calentamiento · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Fuente, fecha y límite del factor de calefacción","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Factor de transporte terrestre · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Base del factor","Per vehicle-km":"Por vehículo-km","Per passenger-km":"Por pasajero-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Fuente, fecha y límite del factor de transporte terrestre","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Factor de vuelo · kg CO2e/pasajero-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Fuente, fecha y límite del factor de vuelo","Other factor unit name":"Otro nombre de unidad de factor","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Otro factor · kg CO2e/unidad","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Otro factor fuente, fecha y límite","Compare scenarios":"Comparar escenarios","Load example":"Cargar ejemplo","Clear values":"Borrar valores","Download CSV":"Descargar CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Ingrese la actividad anual. Agregue un factor de coincidencia y una fuente para cada categoría distinta de cero que no sea electricidad.","Annual estimate by sector":"Estimación anual por sector","Baseline total":"Total de referencia","Action scenario total":"Total de escenarios de acción","Change":"Cambiar","Change from baseline":"Cambio desde el valor inicial","Factor source":"Fuente del factor","Activity":"Actividad","Factor":"Factor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Línea base kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Escenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Todos los valores permanecen en este navegador. No se carga nada.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Datos anuales de electricidad · CC BY 4.0 · filtrado a Suiza y Noruega; 2000–2025. Los valores son intensidad de generación en gCO2/kWh, convertida a kgCO2/kWh. Este no es un factor de consumo o ciclo de vida.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Para factores no eléctricos, utilice una fuente que coincida con su país, actividad, unidad y año. Cítalo para que puedas revisar los supuestos más adelante.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Cuente cada actividad una vez. No agregue un total que ya incluya uno de los sectores enumerados.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Verifique los montos de actividad, factores, unidades de factor y notas de fuente. La actividad no eléctrica positiva necesita un factor positivo y una fuente citada.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Mostrando {count} sectores de actividad. Ambos escenarios utilizan los mismos supuestos factoriales.","kWh":"kWh","km":"kilómetros","passenger-km":"pasajero-km","user-defined unit":"unidad definida por el usuario","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC POR 4.0"},"fa":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"ماشین حساب سناریوی ردپای کربن","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"ماشین حساب ردپای کربن - سناریوهای انتشار را مقایسه کنید","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"CO2e سالانه را از برق و عوامل فعالیت منبع برای گرمایش، حمل و نقل و پروازها برآورد کنید. دو سناریو را به صورت خصوصی در مرورگر خود مقایسه کنید.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"فعالیت سالانه در برق، گرمایش، حمل و نقل زمینی و پرواز را مقایسه کنید. برق دارای ضریب تولید تاریخ سوئیس یا نروژ است. برای سایر فعالیت ها، فاکتوری را وارد کنید و منبع آن را ذکر کنید.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"مثال: 3,500 و 2,800 کیلووات ساعت را با استفاده از ضریب تولید Ember 2025 سوئیس مقایسه کنید. نتیجه فقط تخمین تولید برق است. عوامل منبع را برای فعالیت های دیگر اضافه کنید.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"هر بخش به عنوان فعالیت سالانه ضرب در ضریب آن محاسبه می شود. برای مقایسه یک خط پایه با یک سناریو اقدام، مقادیر فعالیت را تغییر دهید. عوامل یکسان برای هر دو سناریو اعمال می شود، بنابراین تفاوت نشان دهنده تغییرات فعالیت است.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"این یک تخمین سناریویی است، نه یک ردپای شخصی کامل، موجودی رسمی، ممیزی یا گواهی افست. الکتریسیته از شدت تولید استفاده می کند، نه یک عامل مبتنی بر مصرف یا چرخه عمر. گرمایش، حمل و نقل، پروازها و سایر عوامل توسط شما تامین می شود و فقط به اندازه منبع و واحدهای مطابق آنها قابل اعتماد هستند.","Example":"مثال","How the estimate works":"تخمین چگونه کار می کند","Carbon estimate questions":"سوالات تخمین کربن","Scope and data sources":"دامنه و منابع داده","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"آیا این ردپای کربن کامل من را محاسبه می کند؟","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"شماره. مجموع فقط فعالیت هایی است که شما وارد می کنید. این شامل غذا، خرید، خدمات عمومی، ساخت و ساز یا هر فعالیت حذف شده نمی شود.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"ضریب برق چه چیزی را اندازه گیری می کند؟","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember شدت تولید برق CO2 را بر اساس کشور و سال گزارش می‌کند. این تخمین برای واردات، تلفات شبکه، قراردادهای تامین کننده، یا انتشار چرخه حیات بالادستی تنظیم نمی شود.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"عوامل گرمایش، سفر و پرواز از کجا می آیند؟","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"شما آن عوامل را وارد کرده و منبع، تاریخ، واحد و مرز نشان داده شده توسط آن منبع را ذکر می‌کنید. ماشین حساب بی سر و صدا عاملی از کشور دیگر را جایگزین نمی کند.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"آیا می توانم از فاکتورهای کیلومتر خودرو و کیلومتر مسافر استفاده کنم؟","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"بله، اما مبنایی را انتخاب کنید که دقیقاً با فاکتور مطابقت داشته باشد. مسافر-km را برای ضریب هر سرنشین و خودرو-km را برای ضریب هر خودرو وارد کنید.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"آیا این نتایج تایید شده هستند یا جبران کربن؟","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"شماره این مقایسه مبتنی بر مرورگر یک موجودی رسمی، گواهینامه یا خرید افست نیست.","Electricity generation country":"کشور تولید برق","Switzerland":"سوئیس","Norway":"نروژ","Factor year":"فکتور سال","Baseline":"پایه","Action scenario":"سناریوی اکشن","Electricity use · kWh/year":"مصرف برق · کیلووات ساعت در سال","Heating use · kWh/year":"استفاده از گرمایش · کیلووات ساعت در سال","Ground transport distance · km/year":"فاصله حمل و نقل زمینی · کیلومتر در سال","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"مسافت پرواز · مسافر-کیلومتر/سال","Other activity · amount/year":"سایر فعالیت · مبلغ/سال","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"ضریب گرمایش · کیلوگرم CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"منبع ضریب گرمایش، تاریخ و مرز","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"ضریب حمل و نقل زمینی · کیلوگرم CO2e/km","Factor basis":"بر اساس فاکتور","Per vehicle-km":"در هر وسیله نقلیه-کیلومتر","Per passenger-km":"به ازای هر مسافر-کیلومتر","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"منبع، تاریخ و مرز فاکتور حمل و نقل زمینی","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"ضریب پرواز · کیلوگرم CO2e/مسافر-کیلومتر","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"منبع، تاریخ و مرز ضریب پرواز","Other factor unit name":"نام واحد عامل دیگر","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"عامل دیگر · کیلوگرم CO2e/واحد","Other factor source, date and boundary":"منبع عوامل دیگر، تاریخ و مرز","Compare scenarios":"مقایسه سناریوها","Load example":"نمونه بارگذاری","Clear values":"مقادیر را پاک کنید","Download CSV":"دانلود CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"فعالیت سالانه را وارد کنید. برای هر دسته غیر صفر به غیر از برق یک فاکتور و منبع تطبیق اضافه کنید.","Annual estimate by sector":"برآورد سالانه بر اساس بخش","Baseline total":"کل پایه","Action scenario total":"کل سناریو اکشن","Change":"تغییر","Change from baseline":"تغییر از پایه","Factor source":"منبع فاکتور","Activity":"فعالیت","Factor":"فاکتور","Baseline kg CO2e":"کیلوگرم پایه CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"سناریو کیلوگرم CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"همه مقادیر در این مرورگر باقی می مانند. چیزی آپلود نمیشه","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · داده های برق سالانه · CC BY 4.0 · فیلتر شده به سوییس و نروژ. 2000–2025. مقادیر شدت تولید بر حسب gCO2/kWh هستند که به kgCO2/kWh تبدیل می‌شوند. این یک عامل مصرف یا چرخه عمر نیست.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"برای فاکتورهای غیر برق، از منبعی استفاده کنید که با کشور، فعالیت، واحد و سال شما مطابقت داشته باشد. آن را ذکر کنید تا بتوانید بعداً مفروضات را مرور کنید.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"هر فعالیت را یک بار بشمارید. مجموعی را که قبلاً شامل یکی از بخش های فهرست شده است اضافه نکنید.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"مقدار فعالیت، عوامل، واحدهای عامل و یادداشت های منبع را بررسی کنید. فعالیت مثبت غیر برقی نیاز به عامل مثبت و منبع ذکر شده دارد.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"نمایش بخش‌های فعالیت {count}. هر دو سناریو از مفروضات عامل یکسانی استفاده می کنند.","kWh":"کیلووات ساعت","km":"کیلومتر","passenger-km":"مسافر-کیلومتر","user-defined unit":"واحد تعریف شده توسط کاربر","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"fr":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Calculateur de scénario d'empreinte carbone","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Calculateur d'empreinte carbone — Comparez les scénarios d'émission","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Estimation annuelle du CO2e à partir de l'électricité et des facteurs d'activité sourcés pour le chauffage, les transports et les vols. Comparez deux scénarios en privé dans votre navigateur.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Comparez l'activité annuelle en électricité, chauffage, transports terrestres et aériens. L'électricité a un facteur de production daté en Suisse ou en Norvège ; pour les autres activités, inscrivez un facteur et citez sa source.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Exemple : comparez les kWh 3,500 et 2,800 en utilisant le facteur de génération de braises suisse 2025. Le résultat est uniquement une estimation de la production d’électricité ; ajouter des facteurs sourcés pour d’autres activités.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Chaque secteur est calculé comme l'activité annuelle multipliée par son facteur. Modifiez les valeurs d'activité pour comparer une référence avec un scénario d'action. Les mêmes facteurs s’appliquent aux deux scénarios, la différence reflète donc les changements d’activité.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Il s'agit d'une estimation de scénario, et non d'une empreinte personnelle complète, d'un inventaire officiel, d'un audit ou d'un certificat de compensation. L’électricité utilise l’intensité de production, et non un facteur basé sur la consommation ou le cycle de vie. Le chauffage, le transport, les vols et autres facteurs sont fournis par vous et sont aussi fiables que leur source et les unités correspondantes.","Example":"Exemple","How the estimate works":"Fonctionnement du devis","Carbon estimate questions":"Questions sur l'estimation du carbone","Scope and data sources":"Portée et sources de données","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Est-ce que cela calcule mon empreinte carbone complète ?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Non. Il totalise uniquement les activités que vous saisissez. Cela n'inclut pas la nourriture, les achats, les services publics, la construction ou toute activité omise.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Que mesure le facteur électrique ?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember rapporte CO2 l'intensité de la production d'électricité par pays et par année. Cette estimation ne prend pas en compte les importations, les pertes du réseau, les contrats avec les fournisseurs ou les émissions en amont du cycle de vie.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"D'où viennent les facteurs de chauffage, de déplacement et de vol ?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Vous entrez ces facteurs et citez la source, la date, l'unité et la limite indiquées par cette source. Le calculateur ne substitue pas silencieusement un facteur provenant d’un autre pays.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Puis-je utiliser les facteurs véhicule-km et passager-km ?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Oui, mais sélectionnez la base qui correspond exactement au facteur. Entrez les passagers-km pour un facteur par passager et les véhicules-km pour un facteur par véhicule.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"S'agit-il de résultats certifiés ou de compensations carbone ?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Non. Cette comparaison basée sur un navigateur ne constitue pas un inventaire officiel, une certification ou un achat compensatoire.","Electricity generation country":"Pays de production d'électricité","Switzerland":"Suisse","Norway":"Norvège","Factor year":"Facteur année","Baseline":"Référence","Action scenario":"Scénario d'action","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Consommation d'électricité · kWh/an","Heating use · kWh/year":"Consommation de chauffage · kWh/an","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Distance de transport terrestre · km/an","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Distance de vol · passager-km/an","Other activity · amount/year":"Autre activité · montant/an","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Facteur de chauffe · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Source du facteur de chauffage, date et limite","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Facteur de transport terrestre · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Base factorielle","Per vehicle-km":"Par véhicule-km","Per passenger-km":"Par passager-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Source du facteur de transport terrestre, date et limite","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Facteur de vol · kg CO2e/passager-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Source du facteur de vol, date et limite","Other factor unit name":"Autre nom de l'unité de facteur","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Autre facteur · kg CO2e/unité","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Autre source de facteur, date et limite","Compare scenarios":"Comparer les scénarios","Load example":"Exemple de chargement","Clear values":"Effacer les valeurs","Download CSV":"Télécharger le fichier CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Saisissez l'activité annuelle. Ajoutez un facteur de correspondance et une source pour chaque catégorie non nulle autre que l'électricité.","Annual estimate by sector":"Estimation annuelle par secteur","Baseline total":"Total de référence","Action scenario total":"Total du scénario d'action","Change":"Modifier","Change from baseline":"Modification par rapport à la ligne de base","Factor source":"Source du facteur","Activity":"Activité","Factor":"Facteur","Baseline kg CO2e":"Référence kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Scénario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Toutes les valeurs restent dans ce navigateur. Rien n'est téléchargé.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Données annuelles sur l'électricité · CC BY 4.0 · filtré vers la Suisse et la Norvège ; 2000–2025. Les valeurs correspondent à l'intensité de production en gCO2/kWh, convertie en kgCO2/kWh. Il ne s’agit pas d’un facteur de consommation ou de cycle de vie.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Pour les facteurs non liés à l'électricité, utilisez une source qui correspond à votre pays, activité, unité et année. Citez-le afin de pouvoir revoir les hypothèses plus tard.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Comptez chaque activité une fois. N'ajoutez pas un total qui inclut déjà l'un des secteurs répertoriés.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Vérifiez les montants d'activité, les facteurs, les unités de facteurs et les notes d'origine. Une activité positive non électrique nécessite un facteur positif et une source citée.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Affichage des secteurs d'activité {count}. Les deux scénarios utilisent les mêmes hypothèses factorielles.","kWh":"kWh","km":"kilomètres","passenger-km":"passager-km","user-defined unit":"unité définie par l'utilisateur","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC PAR 4.0"},"gu":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"કાર્બન ફૂટપ્રિન્ટ દૃશ્ય કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"કાર્બન ફૂટપ્રિન્ટ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર — ઉત્સર્જનના દૃશ્યોની તુલના કરો","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"હીટિંગ, ટ્રાન્સપોર્ટ અને ફ્લાઇટ માટે વીજળી અને સ્ત્રોત પ્રવૃત્તિના પરિબળોમાંથી વાર્ષિક CO2eનો અંદાજ કાઢો. તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ખાનગી રીતે બે દૃશ્યોની તુલના કરો.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"વીજળી, હીટિંગ, ગ્રાઉન્ડ ટ્રાન્સપોર્ટ અને ફ્લાઈટ્સમાં વાર્ષિક પ્રવૃત્તિની તુલના કરો. વીજળીમાં ડેટેડ સ્વિટ્ઝર્લેન્ડ અથવા નોર્વે જનરેશન ફેક્ટર હોય છે; અન્ય પ્રવૃત્તિઓ માટે, એક પરિબળ દાખલ કરો અને તેનો સ્ત્રોત ટાંકો.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"ઉદાહરણ: સ્વિટ્ઝર્લૅન્ડના 2025 એમ્બર જનરેશન ફેક્ટરનો ઉપયોગ કરીને 3,500 અને 2,800 kWh ની તુલના કરો. પરિણામ માત્ર વીજળી-ઉત્પાદન અંદાજ છે; અન્ય પ્રવૃત્તિઓ માટે સ્ત્રોત પરિબળો ઉમેરો.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"દરેક સેક્ટરની ગણતરી વાર્ષિક પ્રવૃત્તિ તરીકે તેના પરિબળ દ્વારા ગુણાકાર કરવામાં આવે છે. ક્રિયા દૃશ્ય સાથે બેઝલાઇનની સરખામણી કરવા માટે પ્રવૃત્તિ મૂલ્યો બદલો. સમાન પરિબળો બંને દૃશ્યો પર લાગુ થાય છે, તેથી તફાવત પ્રવૃત્તિ ફેરફારોને પ્રતિબિંબિત કરે છે.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"આ એક દૃશ્ય અંદાજ છે, સંપૂર્ણ વ્યક્તિગત પદચિહ્ન, સત્તાવાર ઇન્વેન્ટરી, ઑડિટ અથવા ઑફસેટ પ્રમાણપત્ર નથી. વીજળી ઉત્પાદનની તીવ્રતા વાપરે છે, વપરાશ આધારિત અથવા જીવનચક્ર પરિબળ નથી. હીટિંગ, ટ્રાન્સપોર્ટ, ફ્લાઈટ્સ અને અન્ય પરિબળો તમારા દ્વારા પૂરા પાડવામાં આવે છે અને તે તેમના સ્ત્રોત અને મેળ ખાતા એકમો જેટલા જ વિશ્વસનીય છે.","Example":"ઉદાહરણ","How the estimate works":"અંદાજ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","Carbon estimate questions":"કાર્બન અંદાજ પ્રશ્નો","Scope and data sources":"સ્કોપ અને ડેટા સ્ત્રોતો","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"શું આ મારા સંપૂર્ણ કાર્બન ફૂટપ્રિન્ટની ગણતરી કરે છે?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"નં. તે ફક્ત તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે પ્રવૃત્તિઓનો કુલ સમાવેશ થાય છે. તેમાં ખોરાક, ખરીદી, જાહેર સેવાઓ, બાંધકામ અથવા કોઈપણ અવગણવામાં આવેલી પ્રવૃત્તિનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"વીજળી પરિબળ શું માપે છે?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember દેશ અને વર્ષ પ્રમાણે વીજળી ઉત્પાદનની CO2 તીવ્રતાનો અહેવાલ આપે છે. આ અંદાજ આયાત, ગ્રીડની ખોટ, સપ્લાયર કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ અથવા અપસ્ટ્રીમ જીવનચક્ર ઉત્સર્જન માટે સમાયોજિત થતો નથી.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"હીટિંગ, મુસાફરી અને ફ્લાઇટના પરિબળો ક્યાંથી આવે છે?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"તમે તે પરિબળો દાખલ કરો અને તે સ્ત્રોત દ્વારા દર્શાવેલ સ્ત્રોત, તારીખ, એકમ અને સીમા ટાંકો. કેલ્ક્યુલેટર ચુપચાપ બીજા દેશના પરિબળને બદલે નથી.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"શું હું વાહન-કિમી અને પેસેન્જર-કિમી પરિબળોનો ઉપયોગ કરી શકું?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"હા, પરંતુ પરિબળ સાથે બરાબર મેળ ખાતો આધાર પસંદ કરો. પ્રતિ-પેસેન્જર પરિબળ માટે પેસેન્જર-કિમી અને પ્રતિ-વાહન પરિબળ માટે વાહન-કિમી દાખલ કરો.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"શું આ પ્રમાણિત પરિણામો છે કે કાર્બન ઓફસેટ્સ?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"નં. આ બ્રાઉઝર-આધારિત સરખામણી એ સત્તાવાર ઇન્વેન્ટરી, પ્રમાણપત્ર અથવા ઑફસેટ ખરીદી નથી.","Electricity generation country":"વીજળી ઉત્પાદન દેશ","Switzerland":"સ્વિટ્ઝર્લેન્ડ","Norway":"નોર્વે","Factor year":"પરિબળ વર્ષ","Baseline":"બેઝલાઇન","Action scenario":"ક્રિયા દૃશ્ય","Electricity use · kWh/year":"વીજળીનો ઉપયોગ · kWh/વર્ષ","Heating use · kWh/year":"હીટિંગનો ઉપયોગ · kWh/વર્ષ","Ground transport distance · km/year":"ગ્રાઉન્ડ ટ્રાન્સપોર્ટ અંતર · કિમી/વર્ષ","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"ફ્લાઇટનું અંતર · પેસેન્જર-કિમી/વર્ષ","Other activity · amount/year":"અન્ય પ્રવૃત્તિ · રકમ/વર્ષ","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"હીટિંગ ફેક્ટર · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"હીટિંગ ફેક્ટર સ્ત્રોત, તારીખ અને સીમા","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"ગ્રાઉન્ડ ટ્રાન્સપોર્ટ ફેક્ટર · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"પરિબળ આધાર","Per vehicle-km":"પ્રતિ વાહન-કિ.મી","Per passenger-km":"પ્રતિ પેસેન્જર-કિમી","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"ગ્રાઉન્ડ ટ્રાન્સપોર્ટ ફેક્ટર સ્ત્રોત, તારીખ અને સીમા","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"ફ્લાઇટ ફેક્ટર · kg CO2e/પેસેન્જર-કિમી","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"ફ્લાઇટ ફેક્ટર સ્ત્રોત, તારીખ અને સીમા","Other factor unit name":"અન્ય પરિબળ એકમનું નામ","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"અન્ય પરિબળ · kg CO2e/યુનિટ","Other factor source, date and boundary":"અન્ય પરિબળ સ્ત્રોત, તારીખ અને સીમા","Compare scenarios":"પરિદ્રશ્યોની સરખામણી કરો","Load example":"લોડ ઉદાહરણ","Clear values":"મૂલ્યો સાફ કરો","Download CSV":"CSV ડાઉનલોડ કરો","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"વાર્ષિક પ્રવૃત્તિ દાખલ કરો. વીજળી સિવાયની દરેક બિન-શૂન્ય શ્રેણી માટે મેળ ખાતા પરિબળ અને સ્ત્રોત ઉમેરો.","Annual estimate by sector":"સેક્ટર દ્વારા વાર્ષિક અંદાજ","Baseline total":"બેઝલાઇન કુલ","Action scenario total":"એક્શન સિનારિયો કુલ","Change":"બદલો","Change from baseline":"બેઝલાઇનમાંથી બદલો","Factor source":"પરિબળ સ્ત્રોત","Activity":"પ્રવૃત્તિ","Factor":"પરિબળ","Baseline kg CO2e":"બેઝલાઇન kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"દૃશ્ય kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"તમામ મૂલ્યો આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે. કંઈ અપલોડ નથી.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · વાર્ષિક વીજળી ડેટા · CC BY 4.0 · સ્વિટ્ઝર્લેન્ડ અને નોર્વેમાં ફિલ્ટર કરેલ; 2000–2025. મૂલ્યો એ gCO2/kWh માં પેઢીની તીવ્રતા છે, જે kgCO2/kWh માં રૂપાંતરિત થાય છે. આ એક વપરાશ અથવા જીવનચક્ર પરિબળ નથી.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"વિદ્યુત સિવાયના પરિબળો માટે, તમારા દેશ, પ્રવૃત્તિ, એકમ અને વર્ષ સાથે મેળ ખાતા સ્ત્રોતનો ઉપયોગ કરો. તેને ટાંકો જેથી તમે પછીથી ધારણાઓની સમીક્ષા કરી શકો.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"દરેક પ્રવૃત્તિને એકવાર ગણો. કુલ ઉમેરશો નહીં કે જેમાં પહેલાથી સૂચિબદ્ધ ક્ષેત્રોમાંથી એક શામેલ હોય.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"પ્રવૃત્તિની માત્રા, પરિબળો, પરિબળ એકમો અને સ્ત્રોત નોંધો તપાસો. સકારાત્મક બિન-વીજળી પ્રવૃત્તિને હકારાત્મક પરિબળ અને ટાંકેલા સ્ત્રોતની જરૂર છે.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} પ્રવૃત્તિ ક્ષેત્રો બતાવી રહ્યું છે. બંને દૃશ્યો સમાન પરિબળ ધારણાઓનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે.","kWh":"kWh","km":"કિમી","passenger-km":"પેસેન્જર-કિ.મી","user-defined unit":"વપરાશકર્તા-વ્યાખ્યાયિત એકમ","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"ha":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Ƙwallon Kafar Carbon Kalkuleta","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Ƙwallon Ƙwallon Carbon - Kwatanta Yanayin Fitowa","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Kididdigar shekara-shekara CO2e daga wutar lantarki da abubuwan da aka samo asali na ayyuka don dumama, sufuri da jiragen sama. Kwatanta al'amura biyu a keɓance a cikin burauzar ku.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Kwatanta ayyukan shekara-shekara a cikin wutar lantarki, dumama, jigilar ƙasa da jiragen sama. Wutar Lantarki yana da kwanan watan Switzerland ko Norway. don sauran ayyukan, shigar da factor kuma buga tushensa.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Misali: kwatanta 3,500 da 2,800 kWh ta amfani da 2025 Ember factor factor na Switzerland. Sakamakon shine kiyasin samar da wutar lantarki kawai; ƙara abubuwan da aka samo asali don wasu ayyuka.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Canja ƙimar ayyuka don kwatanta tushe tare da yanayin aiki. Abubuwan iri ɗaya sun shafi duka al'amuran biyu, don haka bambancin yana nuna canje-canjen ayyuka.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Wannan kiyasin yanayi ne, ba cikakken sawun mutum ba, ƙididdiga na hukuma, dubawa, ko takardar shedar biya. Wutar lantarki yana amfani da ƙarfin tsara, ba tushen amfani ko yanayin rayuwa ba. Dumama, sufuri, jirage da sauran abubuwan ana ba da su ta hanyar ku kuma abin dogaro ne kawai kamar tushen su da raka'o'in da suka dace.","Example":"Misali","How the estimate works":"Yadda kimantawa ke aiki","Carbon estimate questions":"Tambayoyin kimanta carbon","Scope and data sources":"Mai girma da tushen bayanai","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Shin wannan yana lissafin cikakken sawun carbon dina?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"No. Yana cika ayyukan da kuka shigar kawai. Ba ya haɗa da abinci, sayayya, sabis na jama'a, gini, ko duk wani aiki da aka tsallake.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Menene ma'aunin wutar lantarki?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember ya ba da rahoton CO2 ƙarfin wutar lantarki ta ƙasa da shekara. Wannan ƙiyasin baya daidaitawa don shigo da kaya, asarar grid, kwangilolin masu kaya, ko hayaƙin rayuwa.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"A ina ake dumama, tafiye-tafiye, da abubuwan tashin tashi?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Ka shigar da waɗannan abubuwan kuma ka kawo tushen, kwanan wata, raka'a, da iyaka da aka nuna ta wannan tushe. Kalkuleta ba ya yin shiru ya musanya wani abu daga wata ƙasa.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Zan iya amfani da abin hawa-km da abubuwan fasinja-km?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Eh, amma zaɓi tushen da yayi daidai da ma'aunin. Shigar da fasinja-km don ma'aunin fasinja kowane fasinja da abin hawa-km don ma'aunin abin hawa.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Shin waɗannan ƙwararrun sakamako ne ko abubuwan kashe carbon?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"No. Wannan kwatancen tushen burauza ba ƙira ba ne na hukuma, takaddun shaida, ko siyan kashewa.","Electricity generation country":"Ƙasar samar da wutar lantarki","Switzerland":"Switzerland","Norway":"Norway","Factor year":"Shekara mai mahimmanci","Baseline":"Baseline","Action scenario":"Yanayin Aiki","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Amfani da wutar lantarki · kWh/shekara","Heating use · kWh/year":"Yin amfani da dumama · kWh/shekara","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Nisan jigilar ƙasa · km/shekara","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Nisan jirgi · fasinja-km/ shekara","Other activity · amount/year":"Sauran ayyuka · adadin/shekara","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Matsalar dumama · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Madogararsa mai zafi, kwanan wata da iyaka","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Tsarin jigilar ƙasa · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Tsarin dalilai","Per vehicle-km":"Kowace abin hawa-km","Per passenger-km":"Kowane fasinja-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Tsarin abubuwan jigilar ƙasa, kwanan wata da iyaka","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Tsarin jirgin · kg CO2e/ fasinja-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Tsarin tushen jirgin sama, kwanan wata da iyaka","Other factor unit name":"Sauran sunan naúrar","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Sauran factor · kg CO2e/raka'a","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Sauran tushen dalili, kwanan wata da iyaka","Compare scenarios":"Kwatanta yanayi","Load example":"Misalin kaya","Clear values":"Tare da ƙima","Download CSV":"Zazzagewar CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Shigar da ayyukan shekara-shekara. Ƙara ma'auni mai dacewa da tushe don kowane nau'in mara sifili ban da wutar lantarki.","Annual estimate by sector":"Kimanin shekara ta fannin","Baseline total":"Jimlar tushe","Action scenario total":"Jimlar yanayin aikin","Change":"Canji","Change from baseline":"Canji daga tushe","Factor source":"Madogararsa","Activity":"Ayyukan","Factor":"Asalin","Baseline kg CO2e":"Baseline kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Scenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Dukkan darajoji sun tsaya a cikin wannan mazuruf. Babu wani abu da aka loda.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Bayanan Lantarki na Shekara-shekara · CC BY 4.0 · tace zuwa Switzerland da Norway; 2000–2025. Dabi'u sune ƙarfin tsarawa a gCO2/kWh, wanda aka canza zuwa kgCO2/kWh. Wannan ba abin amfani bane ko yanayin rayuwa.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Don abubuwan da ba na wutar lantarki ba, yi amfani da tushen da ya dace da ƙasarku, ayyuka, naúrar da shekara. Rubuta shi don ku iya bitar zato daga baya.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Kidaya kowane aiki sau ɗaya. Kar a ƙara jimillar wanda ya riga ya ƙunshi ɗaya daga cikin sassan da aka lissafa.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Duba adadin ayyuka, dalilai, raka'a ƙididdiga da bayanin kula. Ayyukan rashin wutar lantarki mai kyau yana buƙatar ingantaccen abu da tushe da aka ambata.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Nuna sassan ayyuka na {count}. Dukansu al'amuran suna amfani da zato iri ɗaya.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"fasinja-km","user-defined unit":"naúrar da aka ayyana mai amfani","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"hi":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"कार्बन पदचिह्न परिदृश्य कैलकुलेटर","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"कार्बन पदचिह्न कैलकुलेटर — उत्सर्जन परिदृश्यों की तुलना करें","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"हीटिंग, परिवहन और उड़ानों के लिए बिजली और स्रोत गतिविधि कारकों से वार्षिक CO2e का अनुमान लगाएं। अपने ब्राउज़र में निजी तौर पर दो परिदृश्यों की तुलना करें।","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"बिजली, हीटिंग, जमीनी परिवहन और उड़ानों में वार्षिक गतिविधि की तुलना करें। बिजली का दिनांकित स्विट्ज़रलैंड या नॉर्वे उत्पादन कारक है; अन्य गतिविधियों के लिए, एक कारक दर्ज करें और उसका स्रोत उद्धृत करें।","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"उदाहरण: स्विट्जरलैंड के 2025 एम्बर जेनरेशन फैक्टर का उपयोग करके 3,500 और 2,800 kWh की तुलना करें। परिणाम केवल बिजली-उत्पादन का अनुमान है; अन्य गतिविधियों के लिए स्रोतित कारक जोड़ें।","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"प्रत्येक क्षेत्र की गणना वार्षिक गतिविधि को उसके कारक से गुणा करके की जाती है। किसी क्रिया परिदृश्य के साथ आधार रेखा की तुलना करने के लिए गतिविधि मान बदलें। दोनों परिदृश्यों पर समान कारक लागू होते हैं, इसलिए अंतर गतिविधि में बदलाव को दर्शाता है।","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"यह एक परिदृश्य अनुमान है, पूर्ण व्यक्तिगत पदचिह्न, आधिकारिक सूची, ऑडिट या ऑफसेट प्रमाणपत्र नहीं। बिजली उत्पादन की तीव्रता का उपयोग करती है, उपभोग-आधारित या जीवनचक्र कारक का नहीं। हीटिंग, परिवहन, उड़ानें और अन्य कारक आपके द्वारा आपूर्ति किए जाते हैं और केवल उनके स्रोत और मिलान इकाइयों के समान ही विश्वसनीय होते हैं।","Example":"उदाहरण","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कैसे काम करता है","Carbon estimate questions":"कार्बन अनुमान प्रश्न","Scope and data sources":"स्कोप और डेटा स्रोत","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"क्या यह मेरे संपूर्ण कार्बन फ़ुटप्रिंट की गणना करता है?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"नहीं। यह केवल आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई गतिविधियों का योग है। इसमें भोजन, खरीदारी, सार्वजनिक सेवाएँ, निर्माण, या कोई छोड़ी गई गतिविधि शामिल नहीं है।","What does the electricity factor measure?":"विद्युत कारक क्या मापता है?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"एम्बर देश और वर्ष के अनुसार बिजली उत्पादन की CO2 तीव्रता की रिपोर्ट करता है। यह अनुमान आयात, ग्रिड घाटे, आपूर्तिकर्ता अनुबंध, या अपस्ट्रीम जीवनचक्र उत्सर्जन के लिए समायोजित नहीं होता है।","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"हीटिंग, यात्रा और उड़ान कारक कहां से आते हैं?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"आप उन कारकों को दर्ज करते हैं और उस स्रोत द्वारा दिखाए गए स्रोत, दिनांक, इकाई और सीमा का हवाला देते हैं। कैलकुलेटर किसी अन्य देश के कारक को चुपचाप प्रतिस्थापित नहीं करता है।","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"क्या मैं वाहन-किमी और यात्री-किमी कारकों का उपयोग कर सकता हूँ?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"हां, लेकिन उस आधार का चयन करें जो कारक से बिल्कुल मेल खाता हो। प्रति-यात्री कारक के लिए यात्री-किमी और प्रति-वाहन कारक के लिए वाहन-किमी दर्ज करें।","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"क्या ये प्रमाणित परिणाम हैं या कार्बन ऑफसेट हैं?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"नहीं। यह ब्राउज़र-आधारित तुलना कोई आधिकारिक सूची, प्रमाणन या ऑफ़सेट खरीदारी नहीं है।","Electricity generation country":"बिजली उत्पादन देश","Switzerland":"स्विट्जरलैंड","Norway":"नॉर्वे","Factor year":"कारक वर्ष","Baseline":"बेसलाइन","Action scenario":"कार्य परिदृश्य","Electricity use · kWh/year":"बिजली का उपयोग · kWh/वर्ष","Heating use · kWh/year":"हीटिंग उपयोग · kWh/वर्ष","Ground transport distance · km/year":"जमीनी परिवहन दूरी · किमी/वर्ष","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"उड़ान दूरी · यात्री-किमी/वर्ष","Other activity · amount/year":"अन्य गतिविधि · राशि/वर्ष","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"हीटिंग फ़ैक्टर · किग्रा CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"हीटिंग फैक्टर स्रोत, तिथि और सीमा","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"ग्राउंड ट्रांसपोर्ट फैक्टर · किग्रा CO2e/किमी","Factor basis":"कारक आधार","Per vehicle-km":"प्रति वाहन-किमी","Per passenger-km":"प्रति यात्री-किमी","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"ग्राउंड ट्रांसपोर्ट फैक्टर स्रोत, तिथि और सीमा","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"उड़ान कारक · किग्रा CO2e/यात्री-किमी","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"उड़ान कारक स्रोत, तिथि और सीमा","Other factor unit name":"अन्य कारक इकाई का नाम","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"अन्य कारक · किग्रा CO2e/यूनिट","Other factor source, date and boundary":"अन्य कारक स्रोत, दिनांक और सीमा","Compare scenarios":"परिदृश्यों की तुलना करें","Load example":"लोड उदाहरण","Clear values":"मान साफ़ करें","Download CSV":"सीएसवी डाउनलोड करें","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"वार्षिक गतिविधि दर्ज करें। बिजली के अलावा प्रत्येक गैर-शून्य श्रेणी के लिए एक मिलान कारक और स्रोत जोड़ें।","Annual estimate by sector":"सेक्टर द्वारा वार्षिक अनुमान","Baseline total":"बेसलाइन कुल","Action scenario total":"कार्य परिदृश्य कुल","Change":"बदलें","Change from baseline":"बेसलाइन से बदलें","Factor source":"कारक स्रोत","Activity":"गतिविधि","Factor":"फैक्टर","Baseline kg CO2e":"बेसलाइन किग्रा CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"परिदृश्य kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"सभी मान इस ब्राउज़र में रहते हैं। कुछ भी अपलोड नहीं किया गया है.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"एम्बर · वार्षिक बिजली डेटा · CC BY 4.0 · स्विट्जरलैंड और नॉर्वे के लिए फ़िल्टर किया गया; 2000-2025। मान gCO2/kWh में पीढ़ी की तीव्रता है, जिसे kgCO2/kWh में परिवर्तित किया जाता है। यह उपभोग या जीवनचक्र कारक नहीं है।","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"गैर-बिजली कारकों के लिए, ऐसे स्रोत का उपयोग करें जो आपके देश, गतिविधि, इकाई और वर्ष से मेल खाता हो। इसे उद्धृत करें ताकि आप बाद में मान्यताओं की समीक्षा कर सकें।","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"प्रत्येक गतिविधि को एक बार गिनें। ऐसा कुल योग न जोड़ें जिसमें पहले से ही सूचीबद्ध क्षेत्रों में से एक शामिल हो।","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"गतिविधि मात्रा, कारक, कारक इकाइयाँ और स्रोत नोट्स की जाँच करें। सकारात्मक गैर-विद्युत गतिविधि के लिए एक सकारात्मक कारक और एक उद्धृत स्रोत की आवश्यकता होती है।","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} गतिविधि क्षेत्र दिखा रहा है। दोनों परिदृश्य समान कारक मान्यताओं का उपयोग करते हैं।","kWh":"किलोवाट","km":"किमी","passenger-km":"यात्री किलोमीटर","user-defined unit":"उपयोगकर्ता-परिभाषित इकाई","2000–2025":"2000-2025","CC BY 4.0":"4.0 द्वारा सीसी"},"id":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Skenario Jejak Karbon","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Kalkulator Jejak Karbon — Bandingkan Skenario Emisi","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Perkirakan CO2e tahunan dari listrik dan faktor aktivitas yang bersumber untuk pemanas, transportasi, dan penerbangan. Bandingkan dua skenario secara pribadi di browser Anda.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Bandingkan aktivitas tahunan di bidang listrik, pemanas, transportasi darat, dan penerbangan. Listrik mempunyai faktor pembangkitan Swiss atau Norwegia; untuk kegiatan lain, masukkan faktor dan sebutkan sumbernya.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Contoh: bandingkan 3,500 dan 2,800 kWh menggunakan faktor pembangkitan Ember 2025 Swiss. Hasilnya hanyalah perkiraan produksi listrik saja; menambahkan faktor sumber untuk aktivitas lain.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Setiap sektor dihitung sebagai aktivitas tahunan dikalikan dengan faktornya. Ubah nilai aktivitas untuk membandingkan garis dasar dengan skenario tindakan. Faktor yang sama berlaku untuk kedua skenario, sehingga perbedaannya mencerminkan perubahan aktivitas.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Ini adalah perkiraan skenario, bukan jejak pribadi lengkap, inventaris resmi, audit, atau sertifikat penggantian kerugian. Listrik menggunakan intensitas pembangkitan, bukan faktor berbasis konsumsi atau siklus hidup. Pemanas ruangan, transportasi, penerbangan, dan faktor lainnya disediakan oleh Anda dan hanya dapat diandalkan jika sumbernya serta unit yang cocok.","Example":"Contoh","How the estimate works":"Cara kerja perkiraan","Carbon estimate questions":"Pertanyaan estimasi karbon","Scope and data sources":"Cakupan dan sumber data","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Apakah ini menghitung jejak karbon saya secara lengkap?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Tidak. Ini hanya menjumlahkan aktivitas yang Anda masukkan. Ini tidak termasuk makanan, pembelian, layanan publik, konstruksi, atau aktivitas apa pun yang dihilangkan.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Apa yang diukur oleh faktor listrik?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember melaporkan intensitas pembangkitan listrik CO2 menurut negara dan tahun. Perkiraan ini tidak disesuaikan dengan impor, kerugian jaringan listrik, kontrak pemasok, atau emisi siklus hidup hulu.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Dari mana faktor pemanasan, perjalanan, dan penerbangan berasal?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Anda memasukkan faktor-faktor tersebut dan mengutip sumber, tanggal, satuan, dan batas yang ditunjukkan oleh sumber tersebut. Kalkulator tidak secara diam-diam mengganti faktor dari negara lain.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Dapatkah saya menggunakan faktor km kendaraan dan km penumpang?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ya, tapi pilih basis yang sama persis dengan faktornya. Masukkan km penumpang untuk faktor per penumpang dan km kendaraan untuk faktor per kendaraan.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Apakah ini hasil bersertifikat atau penyeimbangan karbon?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Tidak. Perbandingan berbasis browser ini bukan merupakan inventaris resmi, sertifikasi, atau pembelian offset.","Electricity generation country":"Negara pembangkit listrik","Switzerland":"Swiss","Norway":"Norwegia","Factor year":"Faktor tahun","Baseline":"Dasar","Action scenario":"Skenario aksi","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Penggunaan listrik · kWh/tahun","Heating use · kWh/year":"Penggunaan pemanas · kWh/tahun","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Jarak transportasi darat · km/tahun","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Jarak penerbangan · penumpang-km/tahun","Other activity · amount/year":"Aktivitas lainnya · jumlah/tahun","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Faktor pemanasan · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Sumber faktor pemanas, tanggal dan batas","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Faktor transportasi darat · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Faktor dasar","Per vehicle-km":"Per kendaraan-km","Per passenger-km":"Per penumpang-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Faktor transportasi darat sumber, tanggal dan batas","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Faktor penerbangan · kg CO2e/penumpang-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Sumber faktor penerbangan, tanggal dan batas","Other factor unit name":"Nama satuan faktor lainnya","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Faktor lainnya · kg CO2e/unit","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Sumber faktor lain, tanggal dan batasan","Compare scenarios":"Bandingkan skenario","Load example":"Muat contoh","Clear values":"Nilai yang jelas","Download CSV":"Unduh CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Masukkan aktivitas tahunan. Tambahkan faktor pencocokan dan sumber untuk setiap kategori bukan nol selain listrik.","Annual estimate by sector":"Estimasi tahunan berdasarkan sektor","Baseline total":"Total dasar","Action scenario total":"Total skenario aksi","Change":"Ubah","Change from baseline":"Perubahan dari baseline","Factor source":"Sumber faktor","Activity":"Aktivitas","Factor":"Faktor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Basis kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Skenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Semua nilai tetap ada di browser ini. Tidak ada yang diunggah.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Data Listrik Tahunan · CC BY 4.0 · disaring ke Swiss dan Norwegia; 2000–2025. Nilai adalah intensitas pembangkitan dalam gCO2/kWh, dikonversi ke kgCO2/kWh. Ini bukan faktor konsumsi atau siklus hidup.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Untuk faktor non-listrik, gunakan sumber yang sesuai dengan negara, aktivitas, unit, dan tahun Anda. Kutiplah agar Anda dapat meninjau asumsinya nanti.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Hitung setiap aktivitas satu kali. Jangan menambahkan total yang sudah mencakup salah satu sektor yang terdaftar.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Periksa jumlah aktivitas, faktor, unit faktor, dan catatan sumber. Kegiatan nonlistrik yang positif memerlukan faktor positif dan sumber yang dikutip.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Menampilkan sektor aktivitas {count}. Kedua skenario menggunakan asumsi faktor yang sama.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"penumpang-km","user-defined unit":"satuan yang ditentukan pengguna","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC OLEH 4.0"},"it":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Calcola lo scenario dell'impronta di carbonio","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Calcolatore dell'impronta di carbonio: confronta gli scenari di emissione","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Stima del CO2e annuale dall'elettricità e dai fattori di attività di approvvigionamento per riscaldamento, trasporti e voli. Confronta due scenari in privato nel tuo browser.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Confronta l'attività annuale di elettricità, riscaldamento, trasporti terrestri e voli. L'elettricità ha un fattore di generazione svizzero o norvegese datato; per le altre attività, inserire un fattore e citarne la fonte.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Esempio: confrontare 3,500 e 2,800 kWh utilizzando il fattore di generazione della brace svizzero 2025. Il risultato è solo una stima della produzione di elettricità; aggiungere fattori di provenienza per altre attività.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Ogni settore viene calcolato come l'attività annuale moltiplicata per il suo fattore. Modificare i valori dell'attività per confrontare una previsione con uno scenario di azione. Gli stessi fattori si applicano a entrambi gli scenari, quindi la differenza riflette i cambiamenti di attività.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Questa è una stima di scenario, non un'impronta personale completa, un inventario ufficiale, un audit o un certificato di compensazione. L’elettricità utilizza l’intensità di generazione, non un fattore basato sul consumo o sul ciclo di vita. Riscaldamento, trasporti, voli e altri fattori sono forniti da te e sono affidabili solo quanto la loro fonte e le unità corrispondenti.","Example":"Esempio","How the estimate works":"Come funziona il preventivo","Carbon estimate questions":"Domande sulla stima del carbonio","Scope and data sources":"Ambito e origini dati","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Calcola la mia impronta di carbonio completa?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"N. Totalizza solo le attività inserite. Non include cibo, acquisti, servizi pubblici, costruzioni o qualsiasi attività omessa.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Cosa misura il fattore elettricità?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember riporta CO2 l'intensità della produzione di elettricità per paese e anno. Questa stima non tiene conto delle importazioni, delle perdite di rete, dei contratti con i fornitori o delle emissioni del ciclo di vita a monte.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Da dove provengono i fattori di riscaldamento, viaggio e volo?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Inserisci questi fattori e citi la fonte, la data, l'unità e il confine mostrati da quella fonte. Il calcolatore non sostituisce silenziosamente un fattore di un altro paese.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Posso utilizzare i fattori veicolo-km e passeggeri-km?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Sì, ma seleziona la base che corrisponde esattamente al fattore. Inserisci passeggeri-km per un fattore per passeggero e veicolo-km per un fattore per veicolo.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Si tratta di risultati certificati o di compensazione delle emissioni di carbonio?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"N. Questo confronto basato su browser non costituisce un inventario ufficiale, una certificazione o un acquisto compensativo.","Electricity generation country":"Paese di produzione di elettricità","Switzerland":"Svizzera","Norway":"Norvegia","Factor year":"Anno del fattore","Baseline":"Baseline","Action scenario":"Scenario di azione","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Uso di elettricità · kWh/anno","Heating use · kWh/year":"Utilizzo riscaldamento · kWh/anno","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Distanza di trasporto via terra · km/anno","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Distanza del volo · passeggeri-km/anno","Other activity · amount/year":"Altra attività · importo/anno","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Fattore di riscaldamento · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Sorgente, data e limite del fattore di riscaldamento","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Fattore di trasporto terrestre · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Base fattoriale","Per vehicle-km":"Per veicolo-km","Per passenger-km":"Per passeggero-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Sorgente, data e confine del fattore di trasporto terrestre","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Fattore volo · kg CO2e/passeggeri-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Sorgente, data e confine del fattore di volo","Other factor unit name":"Altro nome dell'unità fattore","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Altro fattore · kg CO2e/unità","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Altra origine del fattore, data e confine","Compare scenarios":"Confronta gli scenari","Load example":"Esempio di caricamento","Clear values":"Cancella valori","Download CSV":"Scarica CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Inserisci l'attività annuale. Aggiungi un fattore di corrispondenza e una fonte per ogni categoria diversa da zero diversa dall'elettricità.","Annual estimate by sector":"Stima annuale per settore","Baseline total":"Totale previsto","Action scenario total":"Totale scenario di azione","Change":"Cambia","Change from baseline":"Modifica rispetto al riferimento","Factor source":"Sorgente fattore","Activity":"Attività","Factor":"Fattore","Baseline kg CO2e":"Baseline kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Scenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Tutti i valori rimangono in questo browser. Non viene caricato nulla.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Dati annuali sull'elettricità · CC BY 4.0 · filtrati per Svizzera e Norvegia; 2000–2025. I valori sono l'intensità di generazione in gCO2/kWh, convertita in kgCO2/kWh. Questo non è un fattore di consumo o di ciclo di vita.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Per i fattori non elettrici, utilizza una fonte che corrisponda al tuo paese, attività, unità e anno. Citarlo in modo da poter rivedere le ipotesi in seguito.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Conta ciascuna attività una volta. Non aggiungere un totale che includa già uno dei settori elencati.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Controlla gli importi delle attività, i fattori, le unità dei fattori e le note della fonte. L'attività positiva non elettrica necessita di un fattore positivo e di una fonte citata.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Visualizzazione dei settori di attività {count}. Entrambi gli scenari utilizzano le stesse ipotesi fattoriali.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"passeggeri-km","user-defined unit":"unità definita dall'utente","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC DI 4.0"},"ja":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"二酸化炭素排出量シナリオ計算機","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"二酸化炭素排出量計算ツール — 排出シナリオの比較","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"電力と、暖房、輸送、航空に関する資源活動係数から年間 CO2e を推定します。ブラウザーで 2 つのシナリオを非公開で比較してください。","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"電力、暖房、地上輸送、航空の年間活動を比較します。電力には、スイスまたはノルウェーの古い発電係数があります。他のアクティビティの場合は、要因を入力し、その出典を引用します。","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"例: スイスの 2025 残り火生成係数を使用して、3,500 と 2,800 kWh を比較します。結果は発電量の推定値にすぎません。他のアクティビティのためにソース要素を追加します。","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"各セクターは、年間活動にその係数を乗じて計算されます。アクティビティ値を変更して、ベースラインとアクション シナリオを比較します。同じ要因が両方のシナリオに適用されるため、その違いはアクティビティの変化を反映しています。","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"これはシナリオの推定であり、完全な個人のフットプリント、公式の目録、監査、または相殺証明書ではありません。電気は、消費量ベースやライフサイクル要因ではなく、発電原単位を使用します。暖房、輸送、航空便、その他の要素はお客様によって提供されますが、その信頼性はその供給元および対応するユニットと同じ程度に限られます。","Example":"例","How the estimate works":"見積もりの仕組み","Carbon estimate questions":"炭素見積りに関する質問","Scope and data sources":"スコープとデータ ソース","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"これは私の完全な二酸化炭素排出量を計算しますか?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"いいえ。入力したアクティビティのみが合計されます。これには、食料、購入、公共サービス、建設、または省略された活動は含まれません。","What does the electricity factor measure?":"電気係数は何を測定しますか?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember は国別および年別の CO2 発電強度を報告します。この推定値には、輸入、送電網の損失、サプライヤーとの契約、または上流のライフサイクル排出量は調整されていません。","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"暖房、旅行、飛行の要素はどこから来るのでしょうか?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"これらの要素を入力し、その情報源が示す情報源、日付、単位、および境界を引用します。計算機は、黙って別の国の係数を置き換えることはありません。","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"車両キロと乗客キロ係数を使用できますか?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"はい。ただし、因子と正確に一致する基底を選択してください。乗客あたりの係数には乗客キロを入力し、車両あたりの係数には車両キロを入力します。","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"これらは認定された結果ですか、それともカーボン オフセットですか?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"いいえ。このブラウザベースの比較は、正式な在庫、認定、または相殺購入ではありません。","Electricity generation country":"発電国","Switzerland":"スイス","Norway":"ノルウェー","Factor year":"要素年","Baseline":"ベースライン","Action scenario":"アクション シナリオ","Electricity use · kWh/year":"電力使用量 · kWh/年","Heating use · kWh/year":"暖房使用量 · kWh/年","Ground transport distance · km/year":"地上輸送距離 · km/年","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"飛行距離 · 旅客キロ/年","Other activity · amount/year":"その他の活動 · 年間の金額","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"発熱係数 · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"発熱要因の発生源、日付および境界","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"陸上輸送係数 · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"因子ベース","Per vehicle-km":"車両 1 キロあたり","Per passenger-km":"乗客キロあたり","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"地上輸送係数の発生源、日付、および境界","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"フライトファクター · kg CO2e/乗客 km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"フライト要因のソース、日付および境界","Other factor unit name":"その他の要素単位名","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"その他の係数 · kg CO2e/単位","Other factor source, date and boundary":"その他の要因ソース、日付および境界","Compare scenarios":"シナリオの比較","Load example":"負荷の例","Clear values":"値をクリア","Download CSV":"CSV をダウンロード","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"年間活動を入力してください。電力以外のゼロ以外の各カテゴリに一致する係数とソースを追加します。","Annual estimate by sector":"セクター別の年間予測","Baseline total":"ベースライン合計","Action scenario total":"アクション シナリオ合計","Change":"変更","Change from baseline":"ベースラインからの変更","Factor source":"因子ソース","Activity":"アクティビティ","Factor":"ファクター","Baseline kg CO2e":"ベースライン kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"シナリオ kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"すべての値はこのブラウザーに残ります。何もアップロードされていません。","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · 年間電力データ · CC BY 4.0 · スイスとノルウェーにフィルタリング。 2000～2025。値は、kgCO2/kWh に変換された gCO2/kWh 単位の発電強度です。これは消費量やライフサイクルの要因ではありません。","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"電力以外の要素については、国、活動、単位、年に一致する電源を使用してください。後で仮定を確認できるように引用します。","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"各アクティビティを 1 回カウントします。リストされているセクターのいずれかをすでに含む合計を加算しないでください。","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"活動量、係数、係数単位、およびソース ノートを確認します。電気を使わない積極的な活動には、肯定的な要素と引用された情報源が必要です。","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} アクティビティ セクターを表示しています。どちらのシナリオでも同じ要因の仮定が使用されます。","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"乗客キロ","user-defined unit":"ユーザー定義単位","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"4.0 によるCC"},"ko":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"탄소 발자국 시나리오 계산기","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"탄소 발자국 계산기 - 배출 시나리오 비교","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"전기 및 난방, 운송 및 비행에 대한 소스 활동 요인을 통해 연간 CO2e를 추정합니다. 브라우저에서 두 가지 시나리오를 비공개로 비교해 보세요.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"전기, 난방, 지상 운송 및 항공편의 연간 활동을 비교합니다. 전기에는 날짜가 지정된 스위스 또는 노르웨이 생성 요소가 있습니다. 기타 활동의 경우 요소를 입력하고 해당 출처를 인용하세요.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"예: 스위스의 2025 불씨 발생 계수를 사용하여 3,500 및 2,800 kWh를 비교합니다. 결과는 발전량 추정치일 뿐입니다. 다른 활동에 대한 소스 요소를 추가합니다.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"각 부문은 연간 활동에 해당 계수를 곱하여 계산됩니다. 활동 값을 변경하여 기준과 작업 시나리오를 비교합니다. 두 시나리오 모두에 동일한 요소가 적용되므로 차이점은 활동 변경을 반영합니다.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"이것은 완전한 개인 발자국, 공식 재고, 감사 또는 오프셋 인증서가 아닌 시나리오 추정입니다. 전기는 소비 기반이나 수명주기 요소가 아닌 발전 강도를 사용합니다. 난방, 운송, 항공편 및 기타 요소는 귀하가 제공하며 해당 소스와 일치하는 장치만큼만 신뢰할 수 있습니다.","Example":"예","How the estimate works":"추정 작동 방식","Carbon estimate questions":"탄소 추정 질문","Scope and data sources":"범위 및 데이터 소스","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"이것은 내 전체 탄소 발자국을 계산합니까?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"아니요. 입력한 활동만 합산됩니다. 여기에는 음식, 구매, 공공 서비스, 건설 또는 생략된 활동이 포함되지 않습니다.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"전기 계수는 무엇을 측정합니까?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember는 국가 및 연도별 CO2 발전 강도를 보고합니다. 이 추정치는 수입, 전력망 손실, 공급업체 계약 또는 업스트림 수명주기 배출을 조정하지 않습니다.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"난방, 여행 및 비행 요소는 어디에서 나오나요?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"해당 요소를 입력하고 해당 소스에 표시된 출처, 날짜, 단위 및 경계를 인용합니다. 계산기는 다른 국가의 요소를 자동으로 대체하지 않습니다.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"차량-km 및 승객-km 요소를 사용할 수 있습니까?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"예, 하지만 요인과 정확히 일치하는 기준을 선택하세요. 승객당 요소에는 승객-km를 입력하고, 차량당 요소에는 차량-km를 입력합니다.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"이러한 결과는 인증된 결과입니까, 아니면 탄소 상쇄입니까?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"아니요. 이 브라우저 기반 비교는 공식 재고, 인증 또는 오프셋 구매가 아닙니다.","Electricity generation country":"발전 국가","Switzerland":"스위스","Norway":"노르웨이","Factor year":"요소 연도","Baseline":"기준선","Action scenario":"액션 시나리오","Electricity use · kWh/year":"전기 사용량 · kWh/년","Heating use · kWh/year":"난방 사용량 · kWh/년","Ground transport distance · km/year":"지상 운송 거리 · km/년","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"비행 거리 · 승객-km/년","Other activity · amount/year":"기타 활동 · 금액/년","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"가열 계수 · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"가열 인자 소스, 날짜 및 경계","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"지상 수송 계수 · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"팩터 기준","Per vehicle-km":"차량당-km","Per passenger-km":"승객당-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"지상 수송 인자 소스, 날짜 및 경계","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"비행 계수 · kg CO2e/승객-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"비행 계수 소스, 날짜 및 경계","Other factor unit name":"기타 요소 단위 이름","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"기타 요인 · kg CO2e/단위","Other factor source, date and boundary":"기타 요인 소스, 날짜 및 경계","Compare scenarios":"시나리오 비교","Load example":"로드 예","Clear values":"값 지우기","Download CSV":"CSV 다운로드","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"연간 활동을 입력하세요. 전기 이외의 0이 아닌 각 범주에 대해 일치하는 요소와 소스를 추가합니다.","Annual estimate by sector":"부문별 연간 추정치","Baseline total":"기준선 합계","Action scenario total":"액션 시나리오 전체","Change":"변경","Change from baseline":"기준선에서 변경","Factor source":"팩터 소스","Activity":"활동","Factor":"인자","Baseline kg CO2e":"기준선 kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"시나리오 kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"모든 값은 이 브라우저에 유지됩니다. 아무것도 업로드되지 않았습니다.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · 연간 전기 데이터 · CC BY 4.0 · 스위스 및 노르웨이로 필터링됨; 2000–2025. 값은 gCO2/kWh 단위의 발전 강도이며, kgCO2/kWh로 변환됩니다. 이는 소비 또는 수명주기 요소가 아닙니다.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"비전기 요소의 경우 국가, 활동, 단위 및 연도와 일치하는 소스를 사용하십시오. 나중에 가정을 검토할 수 있도록 인용하세요.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"각 활동을 한 번 계산합니다. 나열된 부문 중 하나가 이미 포함된 합계를 추가하지 마십시오.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"활동 금액, 요소, 요소 단위 및 소스 메모를 확인하세요. 긍정적인 비전기 활동에는 긍정적인 요소와 인용된 출처가 필요합니다.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} 활동 부문을 표시합니다. 두 시나리오 모두 동일한 요인 가정을 사용합니다.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"승객-km","user-defined unit":"사용자 정의 단위","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"mr":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"कार्बन फूटप्रिंट परिदृश्य कॅल्क्युलेटर","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"कार्बन फूटप्रिंट कॅल्क्युलेटर — उत्सर्जन परिस्थितींची तुलना करा","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"उष्णता, वाहतूक आणि उड्डाणे यासाठी वीज आणि स्रोत क्रियाकलाप घटकांवरून वार्षिक CO2e चा अंदाज लावा. तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये खाजगीरित्या दोन परिस्थितींची तुलना करा.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"वीज, हीटिंग, ग्राउंड ट्रान्सपोर्ट आणि फ्लाइटमधील वार्षिक क्रियाकलापांची तुलना करा. विजेमध्ये दिनांकित स्वित्झर्लंड किंवा नॉर्वे जनरेशन घटक आहे; इतर क्रियाकलापांसाठी, एक घटक प्रविष्ट करा आणि त्याचा स्त्रोत उद्धृत करा.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"उदाहरण: स्वित्झर्लंडचा 2025 एम्बर जनरेशन फॅक्टर वापरून 3,500 आणि 2,800 kWh ची तुलना करा. परिणाम केवळ वीज-निर्मितीचा अंदाज आहे; इतर क्रियाकलापांसाठी स्त्रोत घटक जोडा.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"प्रत्येक क्षेत्राची गणना वार्षिक क्रियाकलाप त्याच्या घटकाने गुणाकार केली जाते. क्रिया परिस्थितीशी बेसलाइनची तुलना करण्यासाठी क्रियाकलाप मूल्ये बदला. समान घटक दोन्ही परिस्थितींवर लागू होतात, त्यामुळे फरक क्रियाकलाप बदल दर्शवतो.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"हा एक परिस्थिती अंदाज आहे, संपूर्ण वैयक्तिक पदचिन्ह, अधिकृत यादी, ऑडिट किंवा ऑफसेट प्रमाणपत्र नाही. वीज उत्पादन तीव्रतेचा वापर करते, उपभोग-आधारित किंवा जीवनचक्र घटक नाही. गरम, वाहतूक, उड्डाणे आणि इतर घटक तुमच्याद्वारे पुरवले जातात आणि ते फक्त त्यांचे स्रोत आणि जुळणारे युनिट्स इतकेच विश्वसनीय आहेत.","Example":"उदाहरण","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कसे कार्य करते","Carbon estimate questions":"कार्बन अंदाज प्रश्न","Scope and data sources":"व्याप्ति आणि डेटा स्रोत","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"हे माझ्या संपूर्ण कार्बन फूटप्रिंटची गणना करते का?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"नं. हे केवळ तुम्ही प्रविष्ट केलेल्या क्रियाकलापांची बेरीज करते. यामध्ये अन्न, खरेदी, सार्वजनिक सेवा, बांधकाम किंवा वगळलेल्या कोणत्याही क्रियाकलापांचा समावेश नाही.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"विद्युत घटक काय मोजतो?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember देश आणि वर्षानुसार वीज निर्मितीच्या CO2 तीव्रतेचा अहवाल देतो. हा अंदाज आयात, ग्रिड नुकसान, पुरवठादार करार किंवा अपस्ट्रीम जीवनचक्र उत्सर्जनासाठी समायोजित करत नाही.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"हीटिंग, प्रवास आणि उड्डाणाचे घटक कुठून येतात?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"तुम्ही ते घटक प्रविष्ट करा आणि स्त्रोत, तारीख, एकक आणि त्या स्त्रोताद्वारे दर्शविलेली सीमा नमूद करा. कॅल्क्युलेटर शांतपणे दुसऱ्या देशाचा घटक बदलत नाही.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"मी वाहन-किमी आणि प्रवासी-किमी घटक वापरू शकतो का?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"होय, पण घटकाशी तंतोतंत जुळणारा आधार निवडा. प्रति-प्रवासी घटकासाठी प्रवासी-किमी आणि प्रति-वाहन घटकासाठी वाहन-किमी प्रविष्ट करा.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"हे प्रमाणित परिणाम आहेत की कार्बन ऑफसेट?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"नं. ही ब्राउझर-आधारित तुलना अधिकृत यादी, प्रमाणन किंवा ऑफसेट खरेदी नाही.","Electricity generation country":"वीज निर्मिती देश","Switzerland":"स्वित्झर्लंड","Norway":"नॉर्वे","Factor year":"घटक वर्ष","Baseline":"बेसलाइन","Action scenario":"कृती परिस्थिती","Electricity use · kWh/year":"वीज वापर · kWh/वर्ष","Heating use · kWh/year":"हीटिंग वापर · kWh/वर्ष","Ground transport distance · km/year":"जमीन वाहतूक अंतर · किमी/वर्ष","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"फ्लाइट अंतर · प्रवासी-किमी/वर्ष","Other activity · amount/year":"इतर क्रियाकलाप · रक्कम/वर्ष","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"हीटिंग फॅक्टर · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"हीटिंग फॅक्टर स्त्रोत, तारीख आणि सीमा","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"ग्राउंड ट्रान्सपोर्ट फॅक्टर · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"घटक आधार","Per vehicle-km":"प्रति वाहन-किमी","Per passenger-km":"प्रति प्रवासी-किमी","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"ग्राउंड ट्रान्सपोर्ट फॅक्टर स्त्रोत, तारीख आणि सीमा","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"फ्लाइट फॅक्टर · kg CO2e/प्रवासी-किमी","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"फ्लाइट फॅक्टर स्रोत, तारीख आणि सीमा","Other factor unit name":"इतर घटक युनिटचे नाव","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"इतर घटक · kg CO2e/युनिट","Other factor source, date and boundary":"इतर घटक स्रोत, तारीख आणि सीमा","Compare scenarios":"परिदृश्यांची तुलना करा","Load example":"लोड उदाहरण","Clear values":"मूल्ये साफ करा","Download CSV":"CSV डाउनलोड करा","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"वार्षिक क्रियाकलाप प्रविष्ट करा. विजेव्यतिरिक्त शून्य नसलेल्या प्रत्येक श्रेणीसाठी जुळणारे घटक आणि स्रोत जोडा.","Annual estimate by sector":"क्षेत्रानुसार वार्षिक अंदाज","Baseline total":"बेसलाइन एकूण","Action scenario total":"कृती परिस्थिती एकूण","Change":"बदला","Change from baseline":"बेसलाइनवरून बदला","Factor source":"फॅक्टर स्रोत","Activity":"क्रियाकलाप","Factor":"फॅक्टर","Baseline kg CO2e":"बेसलाइन kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"परिदृश्य kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"सर्व मूल्ये या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतील. काहीही अपलोड केलेले नाही.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · वार्षिक विद्युत डेटा · CC BY 4.0 · स्वित्झर्लंड आणि नॉर्वेला फिल्टर केले; 2000–2025. मूल्ये ही gCO2/kWh मध्ये जनरेशनची तीव्रता आहे, जी kgCO2/kWh मध्ये रूपांतरित केली जाते. हा उपभोग किंवा जीवनचक्र घटक नाही.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"विद्युत नसलेल्या घटकांसाठी, तुमचा देश, क्रियाकलाप, युनिट आणि वर्ष यांच्याशी जुळणारा स्रोत वापरा. ते उद्धृत करा जेणेकरून तुम्ही गृहितकांचे नंतर पुनरावलोकन करू शकता.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"प्रत्येक क्रियाकलाप एकदा मोजा. आधीच सूचीबद्ध केलेल्या क्षेत्रांपैकी एक समाविष्ट असलेल्या एकूण जोडू नका.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"ॲक्टिव्हिटीचे प्रमाण, घटक, घटक युनिट्स आणि स्त्रोत नोट्स तपासा. पॉझिटिव्ह गैर-विद्युत क्रियाकलापांना सकारात्मक घटक आणि उद्धृत स्त्रोत आवश्यक आहे.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} क्रियाकलाप क्षेत्र दर्शवित आहे. दोन्ही परिस्थिती समान घटक गृहीतके वापरतात.","kWh":"kWh","km":"किमी","passenger-km":"प्रवासी-कि.मी","user-defined unit":"वापरकर्ता-परिभाषित युनिट","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC द्वारे 4.0"},"ms":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Senario Jejak Karbon","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Kalkulator Jejak Karbon — Bandingkan Senario Pelepasan","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Anggaran CO2e tahunan daripada elektrik dan faktor aktiviti bersumber untuk pemanasan, pengangkutan dan penerbangan. Bandingkan dua senario secara peribadi dalam penyemak imbas anda.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Bandingkan aktiviti tahunan dalam elektrik, pemanasan, pengangkutan darat dan penerbangan. Elektrik mempunyai faktor penjanaan Switzerland atau Norway yang bertarikh; untuk aktiviti lain, masukkan faktor dan nyatakan sumbernya.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Contoh: bandingkan 3,500 dan 2,800 kWh menggunakan faktor penjanaan Ember 2025 Switzerland. Hasilnya ialah anggaran penjanaan elektrik sahaja; menambah faktor sumber untuk aktiviti lain.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Setiap sektor dikira sebagai aktiviti tahunan didarab dengan faktornya. Tukar nilai aktiviti untuk membandingkan garis dasar dengan senario tindakan. Faktor yang sama digunakan untuk kedua-dua senario, jadi perbezaan mencerminkan perubahan aktiviti.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Ini ialah anggaran senario, bukan jejak peribadi yang lengkap, inventori rasmi, audit atau sijil mengimbangi. Elektrik menggunakan intensiti penjanaan, bukan faktor berasaskan penggunaan atau kitaran hayat. Pemanasan, pengangkutan, penerbangan dan faktor lain dibekalkan oleh anda dan hanya boleh dipercayai seperti sumber dan unit padanannya.","Example":"Contoh","How the estimate works":"Cara anggaran berfungsi","Carbon estimate questions":"Soalan anggaran karbon","Scope and data sources":"Skop dan sumber data","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Adakah ini mengira jejak karbon lengkap saya?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"No. Ia menjumlahkan hanya aktiviti yang anda masukkan. Ia tidak termasuk makanan, pembelian, perkhidmatan awam, pembinaan atau sebarang aktiviti yang ditinggalkan.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Apakah yang diukur oleh faktor elektrik?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember melaporkan CO2 intensiti penjanaan elektrik mengikut negara dan tahun. Anggaran ini tidak diselaraskan untuk import, kerugian grid, kontrak pembekal atau pelepasan kitaran hayat huluan.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Dari manakah datangnya faktor pemanasan, perjalanan dan penerbangan?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Anda memasukkan faktor tersebut dan memetik sumber, tarikh, unit dan sempadan yang ditunjukkan oleh sumber tersebut. Kalkulator tidak menggantikan faktor dari negara lain secara senyap.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Bolehkah saya menggunakan faktor km kenderaan dan km penumpang?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ya, tetapi pilih asas yang betul-betul sepadan dengan faktor. Masukkan km penumpang untuk faktor setiap penumpang dan km kenderaan untuk faktor setiap kenderaan.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Adakah keputusan yang diperakui ini atau pengimbangan karbon?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"No. Perbandingan berasaskan penyemak imbas ini bukan inventori rasmi, pensijilan atau pembelian mengimbangi.","Electricity generation country":"Negara penjanaan elektrik","Switzerland":"Switzerland","Norway":"Norway","Factor year":"Tahun faktor","Baseline":"Garis Dasar","Action scenario":"Senario tindakan","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Penggunaan elektrik · kWj/tahun","Heating use · kWh/year":"Penggunaan pemanasan · kWj/tahun","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Jarak pengangkutan darat · km/tahun","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Jarak penerbangan · penumpang-km/tahun","Other activity · amount/year":"Aktiviti lain · jumlah/tahun","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Faktor pemanasan · kg CO2e/kWj","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Sumber faktor pemanasan, tarikh dan sempadan","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Faktor pengangkutan darat · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Asas faktor","Per vehicle-km":"Setiap kenderaan-km","Per passenger-km":"Setiap penumpang-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Sumber faktor pengangkutan darat, tarikh dan sempadan","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Faktor penerbangan · kg CO2e/km penumpang","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Sumber faktor penerbangan, tarikh dan sempadan","Other factor unit name":"Nama unit faktor lain","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Faktor lain · kg CO2e/unit","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Sumber faktor lain, tarikh dan sempadan","Compare scenarios":"Bandingkan senario","Load example":"Muat contoh","Clear values":"Kosongkan nilai","Download CSV":"Muat turun CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Masukkan aktiviti tahunan. Tambahkan faktor dan punca padanan untuk setiap kategori bukan sifar selain elektrik.","Annual estimate by sector":"Anggaran tahunan mengikut sektor","Baseline total":"Jumlah garis dasar","Action scenario total":"Jumlah senario tindakan","Change":"Tukar","Change from baseline":"Tukar daripada garis dasar","Factor source":"Sumber faktor","Activity":"Aktiviti","Factor":"Faktor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Garis asas kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Senario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Semua nilai kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini. Tiada apa-apa yang dimuat naik.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Data Elektrik Tahunan · CC BY 4.0 · ditapis ke Switzerland dan Norway; 2000–2025. Nilai ialah keamatan penjanaan dalam gCO2/kWj, ditukar kepada kgCO2/kWj. Ini bukan faktor penggunaan atau kitaran hayat.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Untuk faktor bukan elektrik, gunakan sumber yang sepadan dengan negara, aktiviti, unit dan tahun anda. Petiknya supaya anda boleh menyemak andaian kemudian.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Kira setiap aktiviti sekali. Jangan tambah jumlah yang sudah termasuk salah satu sektor yang disenaraikan.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Semak jumlah aktiviti, faktor, unit faktor dan nota sumber. Aktiviti bukan elektrik yang positif memerlukan faktor positif dan sumber yang disebut.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Menunjukkan sektor aktiviti {count}. Kedua-dua senario menggunakan andaian faktor yang sama.","kWh":"kWj","km":"km","passenger-km":"penumpang-km","user-defined unit":"unit yang ditentukan pengguna","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC OLEH 4.0"},"nb":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Carbon Footprint Scenario Kalkulator","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Karbonfotavtrykkkalkulator — Sammenlign utslippsscenarier","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Beregn årlig CO2e fra elektrisitet og hentede aktivitetsfaktorer for oppvarming, transport og flyreiser. Sammenlign to scenarier privat i nettleseren din.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Sammenlign årlig aktivitet innen elektrisitet, varme, bakketransport og flyreiser. Elektrisitet har en datert Sveits eller Norge produksjonsfaktor; for andre aktiviteter, skriv inn en faktor og oppgi kilden.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Eksempel: sammenlign 3,500 og 2,800 kWh ved å bruke Sveits 2025 glødgenereringsfaktor. Resultatet er kun et estimat for elektrisitetsproduksjon; legge til hentede faktorer for andre aktiviteter.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Hver sektor beregnes som årlig aktivitet multiplisert med faktoren. Endre aktivitetsverdiene for å sammenligne en grunnlinje med et handlingsscenario. De samme faktorene gjelder for begge scenariene, så forskjellen reflekterer aktivitetsendringer.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Dette er et scenarioestimat, ikke et fullstendig personlig fotavtrykk, offisiell inventar, revisjon eller offset-sertifikat. Elektrisitet bruker generasjonsintensitet, ikke en forbruksbasert eller livssyklusfaktor. Oppvarming, transport, flyreiser og andre faktorer er levert av deg og er bare like pålitelige som kilden og matchende enheter.","Example":"Eksempel","How the estimate works":"Hvordan estimatet fungerer","Carbon estimate questions":"Karbonestimat spørsmål","Scope and data sources":"Omfang og datakilder","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Beregner dette hele karbonfotavtrykket mitt?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Nr. Det summerer bare aktivitetene du legger inn. Det inkluderer ikke mat, kjøp, offentlige tjenester, konstruksjon eller noen utelatt aktivitet.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Hva måler elektrisitetsfaktoren?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember rapporterer CO2 intensiteten av elektrisitetsproduksjon etter land og år. Dette estimatet justerer ikke for import, nettap, leverandørkontrakter eller oppstrøms livssyklusutslipp.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Hvor kommer varme-, reise- og flyfaktorer fra?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Du skriver inn disse faktorene og siterer kilden, datoen, enheten og grensen som vises av den kilden. Kalkulatoren erstatter ikke i det stille en faktor fra et annet land.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Kan jeg bruke kjøretøy-km og passasjer-km-faktorer?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ja, men velg grunnlaget som samsvarer nøyaktig med faktoren. Angi passasjer-km for en per-passasjer-faktor og kjøretøy-km for en per-kjøretøy-faktor.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Er disse sertifiserte resultatene eller karbonoffset?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Nr. Denne nettleserbaserte sammenligningen er ikke en offisiell beholdning, sertifisering eller offsetkjøp.","Electricity generation country":"Elektrisitetsproduksjonsland","Switzerland":"Sveits","Norway":"Norge","Factor year":"Faktorår","Baseline":"Utgangslinje","Action scenario":"Handlingsscenario","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Elektrisitetsbruk · kWh/år","Heating use · kWh/year":"Varmebruk · kWh/år","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Baktransportavstand · km/år","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Flyavstand · passasjer-km/år","Other activity · amount/year":"Annen aktivitet · beløp/år","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Varmefaktor · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Kilde for varmefaktor, dato og grense","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Marktransportfaktor · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Faktorgrunnlag","Per vehicle-km":"Per kjøretøy-km","Per passenger-km":"Per passasjer-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Kilde, dato og grense for grunntransportfaktor","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Flyfaktor · kg CO2e/passasjer-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Flyfaktorkilde, dato og grense","Other factor unit name":"Navn på annen faktorenhet","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Annen faktor · kg CO2e/enhet","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Annen faktorkilde, dato og grense","Compare scenarios":"Sammenlign scenarier","Load example":"Lasteksempel","Clear values":"Slett verdier","Download CSV":"Last ned CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Skriv inn årlig aktivitet. Legg til en samsvarende faktor og kilde for hver ikke-null kategori bortsett fra elektrisitet.","Annual estimate by sector":"Årlig estimat etter sektor","Baseline total":"Basislinje totalt","Action scenario total":"Handlingsscenario totalt","Change":"Endre","Change from baseline":"Endre fra grunnlinje","Factor source":"Faktorkilde","Activity":"Aktivitet","Factor":"Faktor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Utgangslinje kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Scenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Alle verdier forblir i denne nettleseren. Ingenting er lastet opp.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Årlige elektrisitetsdata · CC BY 4.0 · filtrert til Sveits og Norge; 2000–2025. Verdiene er generasjonsintensitet i gCO2/kWh, omregnet til kgCO2/kWh. Dette er ikke en forbruks- eller livssyklusfaktor.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"For ikke-elektrisitetsfaktorer, bruk en kilde som samsvarer med ditt land, aktivitet, enhet og år. Sit det slik at du kan se på forutsetningene senere.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Tell hver aktivitet én gang. Ikke legg til en totalsum som allerede inkluderer en av de oppførte sektorene.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Sjekk aktivitetsmengdene, faktorer, faktorenheter og kildenotater. Positiv ikke-elektrisitetsaktivitet trenger en positiv faktor og en sitert kilde.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Viser {count} aktivitetssektorer. Begge scenariene bruker de samme faktorforutsetningene.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"passasjer-km","user-defined unit":"brukerdefinert enhet","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"nl":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Scenariocalculator voor koolstofvoetafdruk","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Carbon Footprint Calculator — Emissiescenario's vergelijken","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Schat de jaarlijkse CO2e op basis van elektriciteit en activiteitsfactoren uit bronmateriaal voor verwarming, transport en vluchten. Vergelijk twee scenario's privé in uw browser.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Vergelijk de jaarlijkse activiteit op het gebied van elektriciteit, verwarming, grondtransport en vluchten. Elektriciteit heeft een gedateerde opwekkingsfactor uit Zwitserland of Noorwegen; voor andere activiteiten voert u een factor in en vermeldt u de bron ervan.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Voorbeeld: vergelijk 3,500 en 2,800 kWh met behulp van de Zwitserse 2025 Ember-generatiefactor. Het resultaat is alleen een schatting van de elektriciteitsopwekking; Voeg afkomstige factoren toe voor andere activiteiten.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Elke sector wordt berekend als de jaarlijkse activiteit vermenigvuldigd met de factor ervan. Wijzig de activiteitswaarden om een ​​basislijn te vergelijken met een actiescenario. Voor beide scenario's gelden dezelfde factoren, dus het verschil weerspiegelt veranderingen in de activiteit.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Dit is een scenarioschatting, geen volledige persoonlijke voetafdruk, officiële inventaris, audit of compensatiecertificaat. Elektriciteit maakt gebruik van de opwekkingsintensiteit, en niet van een consumptie- of levenscyclusfactor. Verwarming, transport, vluchten en andere factoren worden door u geleverd en zijn slechts zo betrouwbaar als hun bron en bijpassende eenheden.","Example":"Voorbeeld","How the estimate works":"Hoe de schatting werkt","Carbon estimate questions":"Vragen over koolstofschatting","Scope and data sources":"Reikwijdte en gegevensbronnen","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Berekent dit mijn volledige ecologische voetafdruk?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Nr. Het telt alleen de activiteiten op die u invoert. Het omvat niet voedsel, aankopen, openbare diensten, bouw of enige weggelaten activiteit.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Wat meet de elektriciteitsfactor?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember rapporteert CO2 intensiteit van elektriciteitsopwekking per land en jaar. Deze schatting houdt geen rekening met import, netverliezen, leverancierscontracten of upstream-emissies tijdens de levenscyclus.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Waar komen de factoren verwarming, reizen en vluchten vandaan?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Je vult deze factoren in en vermeldt de bron, de datum, de eenheid en de grens die door die bron wordt aangegeven. De rekenmachine vervangt niet stilletjes een factor uit een ander land.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Kan ik voertuig-km- en passagiers-km-factoren gebruiken?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ja, maar selecteer de grondslag die exact bij de factor past. Voer passagiers-km in voor een factor per passagier en voertuig-km voor een factor per voertuig.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Zijn dit gecertificeerde resultaten of CO2-compensaties?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Nr. Deze browsergebaseerde vergelijking is geen officiële inventaris-, certificerings- of compensatieaankoop.","Electricity generation country":"Land van elektriciteitsopwekking","Switzerland":"Zwitserland","Norway":"Noorwegen","Factor year":"Factorjaar","Baseline":"Basislijn","Action scenario":"Actiescenario","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Elektriciteitsverbruik · kWh/jaar","Heating use · kWh/year":"Verbruik verwarming · kWh/jaar","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Transportafstand over land · km/jaar","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Vluchtafstand · passagiers-km/jaar","Other activity · amount/year":"Andere activiteit · bedrag/jaar","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Verwarmingsfactor · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Bron, datum en grens van de verwarmingsfactor","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Transportfactor over land · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Factorbasis","Per vehicle-km":"Per voertuig-km","Per passenger-km":"Per passagiers-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Bron, datum en grens van transportfactor over land","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Vluchtfactor · kg CO2e/passagier-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Vluchtfactorbron, datum en grens","Other factor unit name":"Naam van andere factoreenheid","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Andere factor · kg CO2e/eenheid","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Andere factorbron, datum en grens","Compare scenarios":"Scenario's vergelijken","Load example":"Belastingvoorbeeld","Clear values":"Duidelijke waarden","Download CSV":"CSV downloaden","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Jaaractiviteit invoeren. Voeg een matchingfactor en bron toe voor elke categorie die niet nul is, met uitzondering van elektriciteit.","Annual estimate by sector":"Jaarlijkse schatting per sector","Baseline total":"Basislijntotaal","Action scenario total":"Actiescenario totaal","Change":"Wijzigen","Change from baseline":"Wijziging vanaf basislijn","Factor source":"Factorbron","Activity":"Activiteit","Factor":"Factor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Basislijn kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Scenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Alle waarden blijven in deze browser. Er wordt niets geüpload.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Jaarlijkse elektriciteitsgegevens · CC BY 4.0 · gefilterd op Zwitserland en Noorwegen; 2000–2025. Waarden zijn de opwekkingsintensiteit in gCO2/kWh, omgerekend naar kgCO2/kWh. Dit is geen consumptie- of levenscyclusfactor.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Gebruik voor niet-elektriciteitsfactoren een bron die overeenkomt met uw land, activiteit, eenheid en jaar. Citeer het zodat je de aannames later kunt herzien.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Tel elke activiteit één keer. Voeg geen totaal toe dat al een van de genoemde sectoren omvat.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Controleer de activiteitsbedragen, factoren, factoreenheden en bronnotities. Positieve niet-elektriciteitsactiviteit heeft een positieve factor en een geciteerde bron nodig.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count}-activiteitssectoren worden weergegeven. Beide scenario's maken gebruik van dezelfde factoraannames.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"passagiers-km","user-defined unit":"door de gebruiker gedefinieerde eenheid","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC DOOR 4.0"},"pl":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator scenariusza śladu węglowego","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Kalkulator śladu węglowego — porównaj scenariusze emisji","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Oszacuj roczny CO2e na podstawie energii elektrycznej i czynników aktywności źródeł dla ogrzewania, transportu i lotów. Porównaj dwa scenariusze prywatnie w przeglądarce.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Porównaj roczną aktywność w sektorze energii elektrycznej, ogrzewania, transportu naziemnego i lotów. Energia elektryczna ma przestarzały współczynnik wytwarzania w Szwajcarii lub Norwegii; w przypadku innych działań należy wpisać czynnik i podać jego źródło.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Przykład: porównaj 3,500 i 2,800 kWh przy użyciu szwajcarskiego współczynnika wytwarzania żaru 2025. Wynikiem jest jedynie szacunkowa wielkość produkcji energii elektrycznej; dodaj czynniki źródłowe dla innych działań.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Każdy sektor jest obliczany jako roczna aktywność pomnożona przez jego współczynnik. Zmień wartości działań, aby porównać linię bazową ze scenariuszem działania. Te same czynniki mają zastosowanie w obu scenariuszach, więc różnica odzwierciedla zmiany aktywności.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"To jest szacunkowy scenariusz, a nie pełny ślad osobisty, oficjalny spis, audyt lub certyfikat offsetowy. Energia elektryczna wykorzystuje intensywność wytwarzania, a nie czynnik oparty na zużyciu lub cyklu życia. Ogrzewanie, transport, loty i inne czynniki są dostarczane przez Ciebie i są tak niezawodne, jak ich źródło i odpowiednie jednostki.","Example":"Przykład","How the estimate works":"Jak działa oszacowanie","Carbon estimate questions":"Pytania dotyczące szacunków emisji dwutlenku węgla","Scope and data sources":"Zakres i źródła danych","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Czy to oblicza mój całkowity ślad węglowy?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Nie. Sumowane są tylko wprowadzone działania. Nie obejmuje żywności, zakupów, usług publicznych, budownictwa ani żadnej pominiętej działalności.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Co mierzy współczynnik energii elektrycznej?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember raportuje CO2 intensywność wytwarzania energii elektrycznej według kraju i roku. Szacunki te nie uwzględniają importu, strat w sieci, umów z dostawcami ani emisji w cyklu życia wydobycia.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Skąd biorą się czynniki ogrzewania, podróży i lotu?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Wprowadzasz te współczynniki i podajesz źródło, datę, jednostkę i granicę wskazaną przez to źródło. Kalkulator nie zastępuje po cichu czynnika z innego kraju.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Czy mogę używać współczynników pojazdokilometrów i pasażerokilometrów?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Tak, ale wybierz podstawę, która dokładnie pasuje do współczynnika. Wprowadź pasażerokilometry w przypadku współczynnika na pasażera i wozokilometry w przypadku współczynnika na pojazd.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Czy są to certyfikowane wyniki, czy kompensacja emisji dwutlenku węgla?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Nie. To porównanie w przeglądarce nie stanowi oficjalnego wykazu, certyfikatu ani zakupu offsetowego.","Electricity generation country":"Kraj wytwarzający energię elektryczną","Switzerland":"Szwajcaria","Norway":"Norwegia","Factor year":"Rok czynnika","Baseline":"Linia bazowa","Action scenario":"Scenariusz działania","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Zużycie energii elektrycznej · kWh/rok","Heating use · kWh/year":"Zużycie ogrzewania · kWh/rok","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Odległość transportu naziemnego · km/rok","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Odległość lotu · pasażerokilometr/rok","Other activity · amount/year":"Pozostała działalność · kwota/rok","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Współczynnik grzewczy · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Źródło czynnika grzewczego, data i granica","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Współczynnik transportu naziemnego · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Baza współczynników","Per vehicle-km":"Za pojazdokilometr","Per passenger-km":"Na pasażerokilometr","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Źródło, data i granica współczynnika transportu naziemnego","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Współczynnik lotu · kg CO2e/pasażer-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Źródło czynnika lotu, data i granica","Other factor unit name":"Inna nazwa jednostki czynnika","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Inny współczynnik · kg CO2e/jednostka","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Inne źródło czynników, data i granica","Compare scenarios":"Porównaj scenariusze","Load example":"Wczytaj przykład","Clear values":"Wyczyść wartości","Download CSV":"Pobierz plik CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Wprowadź roczną aktywność. Dodaj współczynnik dopasowania i źródło dla każdej niezerowej kategorii innej niż energia elektryczna.","Annual estimate by sector":"Roczne szacunki według sektora","Baseline total":"Suma bazowa","Action scenario total":"Łączny scenariusz działania","Change":"Zmień","Change from baseline":"Zmiana w stosunku do wartości bazowej","Factor source":"Źródło czynnika","Activity":"Aktywność","Factor":"Współczynnik","Baseline kg CO2e":"Linia bazowa kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Scenariusz kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Wszystkie wartości pozostają w tej przeglądarce. Nic nie zostało przesłane.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Roczne dane dotyczące energii elektrycznej · CC BY 4.0 · filtrowanie do Szwajcarii i Norwegii; 2000–2025. Wartości to intensywność wytwarzania w gCO2/kWh, przeliczona na kgCO2/kWh. Nie jest to czynnik zużycia ani cyklu życia.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"W przypadku czynników niezwiązanych z energią elektryczną użyj źródła odpowiadającego Twojemu krajowi, działalności, jednostce i rokowi. Zacytuj go, aby móc później przejrzeć założenia.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Policz każde działanie raz. Nie dodawaj sumy, która obejmuje już jeden z wymienionych sektorów.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Sprawdź kwoty aktywności, współczynniki, jednostki współczynników i uwagi źródłowe. Pozytywna aktywność niezwiązana z energią elektryczną wymaga pozytywnego czynnika i cytowanego źródła.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Wyświetlanie sektorów aktywności {count}. W obu scenariuszach zastosowano te same założenia dotyczące czynników.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"pasażerokilometr","user-defined unit":"jednostka zdefiniowana przez użytkownika","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC PRZEZ 4.0"},"pt":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de cenário de pegada de carbono","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Calculadora de pegada de carbono — Compare cenários de emissões","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Estimativa CO2e anual a partir de eletricidade e fatores de atividade de origem para aquecimento, transporte e voos. Compare dois cenários de forma privada no seu navegador.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Compare a atividade anual em eletricidade, aquecimento, transporte terrestre e voos. A eletricidade tem um fator de geração datado na Suíça ou na Noruega; para outras atividades, insira um fator e cite sua fonte.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Exemplo: compare 3,500 e 2,800 kWh usando o fator de geração de Ember 2025 da Suíça. O resultado é apenas uma estimativa de geração de eletricidade; adicionar fatores de origem para outras atividades.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Cada setor é calculado como a atividade anual multiplicada pelo seu fator. Altere os valores da atividade para comparar uma linha de base com um cenário de ação. Os mesmos factores aplicam-se a ambos os cenários, pelo que a diferença reflecte alterações na actividade.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Esta é uma estimativa de cenário, não uma pegada pessoal completa, inventário oficial, auditoria ou certificado de compensação. A eletricidade utiliza a intensidade de geração e não um fator baseado no consumo ou no ciclo de vida. Aquecimento, transporte, voos e outros fatores são fornecidos por você e são tão confiáveis ​​quanto sua fonte e unidades correspondentes.","Example":"Exemplo","How the estimate works":"Como funciona a estimativa","Carbon estimate questions":"Perguntas sobre estimativa de carbono","Scope and data sources":"Escopo e fontes de dados","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Isso calcula minha pegada de carbono completa?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Não. Totaliza apenas as atividades que você insere. Não inclui alimentos, compras, serviços públicos, construção ou qualquer atividade omitida.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"O que o fator eletricidade mede?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember relata CO2 intensidade de geração de eletricidade por país e ano. Esta estimativa não se ajusta a importações, perdas de rede, contratos de fornecedores ou emissões a montante do ciclo de vida.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"De onde vêm os fatores de aquecimento, viagens e voo?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Você insere esses fatores e cita a fonte, a data, a unidade e o limite mostrados por essa fonte. A calculadora não substitui silenciosamente um fator de outro país.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Posso usar fatores veículo-km e passageiros-km?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Sim, mas selecione a base que corresponda exatamente ao fator. Insira passageiro-km para um fator por passageiro e veículo-km para um fator por veículo.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Esses resultados são certificados ou compensações de carbono?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Não. Esta comparação baseada em navegador não é um inventário oficial, certificação ou compra de compensação.","Electricity generation country":"País de geração de eletricidade","Switzerland":"Suíça","Norway":"Noruega","Factor year":"Fator ano","Baseline":"Linha de base","Action scenario":"Cenário de ação","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Consumo de eletricidade · kWh/ano","Heating use · kWh/year":"Uso de aquecimento · kWh/ano","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Distância de transporte terrestre · km/ano","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Distância de voo · passageiro-km/ano","Other activity · amount/year":"Outra atividade · valor/ano","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Fator de aquecimento · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Fonte, data e limite do fator de aquecimento","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Fator de transporte terrestre · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Base de fator","Per vehicle-km":"Por veículo-km","Per passenger-km":"Por passageiro-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Fonte, data e limite do fator de transporte terrestre","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Fator de voo · kg CO2e/passageiro-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Fonte, data e limite do fator de voo","Other factor unit name":"Nome de outra unidade de fator","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Outro fator · kg CO2e/unidade","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Outra fonte de fator, data e limite","Compare scenarios":"Comparar cenários","Load example":"Exemplo de carregamento","Clear values":"Limpar valores","Download CSV":"Baixar CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Insira a atividade anual. Adicione um fator de correspondência e uma fonte para cada categoria diferente de zero, exceto eletricidade.","Annual estimate by sector":"Estimativa anual por setor","Baseline total":"Total da linha de base","Action scenario total":"Total do cenário de ação","Change":"Alterar","Change from baseline":"Alteração da linha de base","Factor source":"Fonte do fator","Activity":"Atividade","Factor":"Fator","Baseline kg CO2e":"Linha de base kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Cenário kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Todos os valores permanecem neste navegador. Nada é carregado.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Dados anuais de eletricidade · CC BY 4.0 · filtrados para Suíça e Noruega; 2000–2025. Os valores são intensidade de geração em gCO2/kWh, convertidos para kgCO2/kWh. Este não é um fator de consumo ou de ciclo de vida.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Para fatores não elétricos, use uma fonte que corresponda ao seu país, atividade, unidade e ano. Cite-o para que você possa revisar as suposições mais tarde.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Conte cada atividade uma vez. Não some um total que já inclua um dos setores listados.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Verifique os valores da atividade, fatores, unidades de fator e notas de origem. A actividade positiva não eléctrica necessita de um factor positivo e de uma fonte citada.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Mostrando setores de atividade {count}. Ambos os cenários usam as mesmas suposições de fatores.","kWh":"kWh","km":"quilômetros","passenger-km":"passageiro-km","user-defined unit":"unidade definida pelo usuário","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC POR 4.0"},"ru":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Калькулятор сценариев выбросов углекислого газа","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Калькулятор углеродного следа — сравнение сценариев выбросов","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Оцените годовой CO2e на основе электроэнергии и коэффициентов активности источников для отопления, транспорта и полетов. Сравните два сценария конфиденциально в своем браузере.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Сравнить годовую деятельность в сфере электроснабжения, отопления, наземного транспорта и полетов. Электричество имеет устаревший фактор производства в Швейцарии или Норвегии; для других видов деятельности введите фактор и укажите его источник.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Пример: сравните 3,500 и 2,800 кВтч, используя швейцарский коэффициент генерации Ember 2025. Результатом является только оценка выработки электроэнергии; добавить исходные факторы для других видов деятельности.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Каждый сектор рассчитывается как годовая активность, умноженная на его коэффициент. Измените значения действий, чтобы сравнить базовый план со сценарием действий. К обоим сценариям применимы одни и те же факторы, поэтому разница отражает изменения в деятельности.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Это оценка сценария, а не полный личный след, официальная инвентаризация, аудит или компенсационный сертификат. В электроэнергии используется интенсивность производства, а не фактор потребления или жизненного цикла. Отопление, транспорт, перелеты и другие факторы поставляются вами и являются настолько надежными, насколько надежны их источники и соответствующие устройства.","Example":"Пример","How the estimate works":"Как работает оценка","Carbon estimate questions":"Вопросы по оценке выбросов углерода","Scope and data sources":"Объем и источники данных","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Рассчитывает ли это мой полный углеродный след?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Нет. Он суммирует только те действия, которые вы вводите. Сюда не входят продукты питания, покупки, коммунальные услуги, строительство или любая пропущенная деятельность.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Что измеряет коэффициент электроэнергии?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember сообщает CO2 интенсивность производства электроэнергии по странам и годам. Эта оценка не учитывает импорт, потери в сети, контракты с поставщиками или выбросы в течение жизненного цикла добычи.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Откуда берутся факторы нагрева, перемещения и полета?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Вы вводите эти коэффициенты и указываете источник, дату, единицу измерения и границу, указанные этим источником. Калькулятор не подменяет молча коэффициент из другой страны.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Могу ли я использовать коэффициенты транспортного средства и пассажиро-км?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Да, но выберите основу, которая точно соответствует коэффициенту. Введите пассажиро-км для коэффициента на пассажира и транспортно-км для коэффициента на транспортное средство.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Это сертифицированные результаты или компенсация выбросов углекислого газа?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Нет. Это сравнение на основе браузера не является официальным инвентарем, сертификацией или компенсационной покупкой.","Electricity generation country":"Страна-производитель электроэнергии","Switzerland":"Швейцария","Norway":"Норвегия","Factor year":"Фактор года","Baseline":"Базовый уровень","Action scenario":"Сценарий действия","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Потребление электроэнергии · кВтч/год","Heating use · kWh/year":"Потребление тепла · кВтч/год","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Расстояние наземного транспорта · км/год","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Дальность полета · пассажиро-км/год","Other activity · amount/year":"Другая деятельность · сумма/год","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Коэффициент нагрева · кг CO2e/кВтч","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Источник коэффициента нагрева, дата и граница","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Коэффициент наземного транспорта · кг CO2e/км","Factor basis":"Факторная основа","Per vehicle-km":"За транспортно-км","Per passenger-km":"На пассажиро-км","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Источник коэффициента наземного переноса, дата и граница","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Коэффициент полета · кг CO2e/пассажир-км","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Источник коэффициента полета, дата и граница","Other factor unit name":"Имя другого коэффициента","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Другой коэффициент · кг CO2e/единица","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Другой фактор, источник, дата и граница","Compare scenarios":"Сравнить сценарии","Load example":"Пример загрузки","Clear values":"Очистить значения","Download CSV":"Загрузить CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Введите годовую деятельность. Добавьте коэффициент соответствия и источник для каждой ненулевой категории, кроме электроэнергии.","Annual estimate by sector":"Годовая оценка по секторам","Baseline total":"Базовый итог","Action scenario total":"Всего по сценарию действий","Change":"Изменить","Change from baseline":"Изменение по сравнению с базовым уровнем","Factor source":"Источник фактора","Activity":"Действие","Factor":"Фактор","Baseline kg CO2e":"Базовый уровень, кг CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Сценарий, кг CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Все значения останутся в этом браузере. Ничего не загружается.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Ежегодные данные по электроэнергии · CC BY 4.0 · отфильтрованы для Швейцарии и Норвегии; 2000–2025. Значения представляют собой интенсивность генерации в гCO2/кВтч, преобразованную в кгCO2/кВтч. Это не фактор потребления или жизненного цикла.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Для коэффициентов, не связанных с электричеством, используйте источник, соответствующий вашей стране, виду деятельности, единице измерения и году. Процитируйте его, чтобы позже можно было просмотреть предположения.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Каждое действие подсчитайте один раз. Не добавляйте сумму, которая уже включает один из перечисленных секторов.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Проверьте объемы работ, коэффициенты, единицы коэффициентов и примечания к источникам. Позитивная деятельность, не связанная с электричеством, нуждается в положительном факторе и цитируемом источнике.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Показаны сектора деятельности {count}. В обоих сценариях используются одни и те же факторные допущения.","kWh":"кВтч","km":"км","passenger-km":"пассажиро-км","user-defined unit":"определяемая пользователем единица измерения","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC ОТ 4.0"},"sv":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Carbon Footprint Calculator — Jämför utsläppsscenarier","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Uppskatta årlig CO2e från el och inköpta aktivitetsfaktorer för uppvärmning, transport och flyg. Jämför två scenarier privat i din webbläsare.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Jämför årlig verksamhet inom el, värme, marktransporter och flyg. El har en daterad Schweiz eller Norge produktionsfaktor; för andra aktiviteter, ange en faktor och ange dess källa.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Exempel: jämför 3,500 och 2,800 kWh med schweiziska 2025 Glödgenereringsfaktor. Resultatet är endast en uppskattning av elproduktionen; lägga till anskaffningsfaktorer för andra aktiviteter.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Varje sektor beräknas som årlig aktivitet multiplicerad med dess faktor. Ändra aktivitetsvärdena för att jämföra en baslinje med ett handlingsscenario. Samma faktorer gäller för båda scenarierna, så skillnaden återspeglar aktivitetsförändringar.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Detta är en scenariouppskattning, inte ett fullständigt personligt fotavtryck, officiell inventering, revision eller offsetcertifikat. El använder produktionsintensitet, inte en förbrukningsbaserad eller livscykelfaktor. Värme, transport, flyg och andra faktorer tillhandahålls av dig och är bara lika tillförlitliga som deras källa och matchande enheter.","Example":"Exempel","How the estimate works":"Hur uppskattningen fungerar","Carbon estimate questions":"Frågor om koluppskattning","Scope and data sources":"Omfattning och datakällor","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Kalkylerar detta mitt fullständiga koldioxidavtryck?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Nr. Det summerar bara de aktiviteter du anger. Det inkluderar inte mat, inköp, offentliga tjänster, konstruktion eller någon utelämnad aktivitet.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Vad mäter elfaktorn?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember rapporterar CO2 intensitet för elproduktion per land och år. Denna uppskattning justerar inte för import, nätförluster, leverantörskontrakt eller uppströms livscykelutsläpp.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Varifrån kommer uppvärmnings-, rese- och flygfaktorer?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Du anger dessa faktorer och citerar källan, datumet, enheten och gränsen som visas av den källan. Kalkylatorn ersätter inte tyst en faktor från ett annat land.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Kan jag använda faktorerna fordonskm och passagerarkilometer?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ja, men välj den bas som exakt matchar faktorn. Ange passagerar-km för en per-passagerare faktor och fordon-km för en per-fordon faktor.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Är dessa certifierade resultat eller koldioxidkompensationer?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Nr. Denna webbläsarbaserade jämförelse är inte en officiell inventering, certifiering eller offsetköp.","Electricity generation country":"Land för elproduktion","Switzerland":"Schweiz","Norway":"Norge","Factor year":"Faktorår","Baseline":"Baslinje","Action scenario":"Handlingsscenario","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Elanvändning · kWh/år","Heating use · kWh/year":"Värmeanvändning · kWh/år","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Marktransportsträcka · km/år","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Flyvsträcka · passagerar-km/år","Other activity · amount/year":"Annan aktivitet · mängd/år","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Värmefaktor · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Värmefaktorkälla, datum och gräns","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Marktransportfaktor · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Faktorbas","Per vehicle-km":"Per fordon-km","Per passenger-km":"Per passagerare-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Marktransportfaktorkälla, datum och gräns","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Flygfaktor · kg CO2e/passagerar-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Flightfaktorkälla, datum och gräns","Other factor unit name":"Annan faktorenhetsnamn","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Annan faktor · kg CO2e/enhet","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Annan faktorkälla, datum och gräns","Compare scenarios":"Jämför scenarier","Load example":"Ladda exempel","Clear values":"Rensa värden","Download CSV":"Ladda ner CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Ange årlig aktivitet. Lägg till en matchningsfaktor och källa för varje kategori som inte är noll förutom el.","Annual estimate by sector":"Årlig uppskattning per sektor","Baseline total":"Baslinje totalt","Action scenario total":"Handlingsscenario totalt","Change":"Ändra","Change from baseline":"Ändra från baslinjen","Factor source":"Faktorkälla","Activity":"Aktivitet","Factor":"Faktor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Baslinje kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Scenario kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Alla värden stannar i den här webbläsaren. Ingenting laddas upp.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Årlig eldata · CC BY 4.0 · filtrerad till Schweiz och Norge; 2000–2025. Värden är produktionsintensitet i gCO2/kWh, omräknat till kgCO2/kWh. Detta är inte en förbruknings- eller livscykelfaktor.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"För icke-elektricitetsfaktorer, använd en källa som matchar ditt land, aktivitet, enhet och år. Citera det så att du kan granska antagandena senare.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Räkna varje aktivitet en gång. Lägg inte till en summa som redan inkluderar en av de listade sektorerna.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Kontrollera aktivitetsbeloppen, faktorerna, faktorenheterna och källanteckningarna. Positiv icke-elaktivitet behöver en positiv faktor och en citerad källa.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Visar {count} aktivitetssektorer. Båda scenarierna använder samma faktorantaganden.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"passagerar-km","user-defined unit":"användardefinierad enhet","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"sw":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Hali ya Nyayo za Carbon","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Kikokotoo cha Nyayo za Carbon - Linganisha Matukio ya Uzalishaji","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Kadiria CO2e ya kila mwaka kutokana na mambo ya umeme na vyanzo vya shughuli za kupasha joto, usafiri na safari za ndege. Linganisha matukio mawili kwa faragha katika kivinjari chako.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Linganisha shughuli za kila mwaka za umeme, joto, usafiri wa ardhini na safari za ndege. Umeme ina tarehe Uswisi au Norway kizazi sababu; kwa shughuli zingine, ingiza sababu na ueleze chanzo chake.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Mfano: linganisha 3,500 na 2,800 kWh kwa kutumia kipengele cha kuzalisha Ember cha Uswizi cha 2025. Matokeo yake ni makadirio ya uzalishaji wa umeme tu; ongeza vipengele vilivyotokana na shughuli zingine.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Kila sekta huhesabiwa kama shughuli ya kila mwaka inayozidishwa na kipengele chake. Badilisha thamani za shughuli ili kulinganisha msingi na hali ya kitendo. Mambo sawa yanatumika kwa hali zote mbili, kwa hivyo tofauti inaonyesha mabadiliko ya shughuli.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Haya ni makadirio ya hali, si alama kamili ya kibinafsi, orodha rasmi, ukaguzi au cheti cha kurekebisha. Umeme hutumia nguvu ya uzalishaji, si sababu ya matumizi au mzunguko wa maisha. Vipengee vya kuongeza joto, usafiri, safari za ndege na vipengele vingine vinatolewa na wewe na vinategemewa tu kama vyanzo vyake na vitengo vinavyolingana.","Example":"Mfano","How the estimate works":"Jinsi makadirio yanavyofanya kazi","Carbon estimate questions":"Maswali ya makadirio ya kaboni","Scope and data sources":"Upeo na vyanzo vya data","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Je, hii inakokotoa alama yangu kamili ya kaboni?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Na. Inajumlisha tu shughuli unazoingiza. Haijumuishi chakula, ununuzi, huduma za umma, ujenzi, au shughuli yoyote iliyoachwa.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Je, kipengele cha umeme kinapima nini?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember anaripoti CO2 ukubwa wa uzalishaji wa umeme kwa nchi na mwaka. Kadirio hili halirekebishwi kwa uagizaji, upotevu wa gridi ya taifa, kandarasi za wasambazaji, au utoaji wa uzalishaji wa mzunguko wa maisha.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Je, vipengele vya kuongeza joto, usafiri na safari za ndege hutoka wapi?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Unaingiza vipengele hivyo na kutaja chanzo, tarehe, kitengo, na mpaka ulioonyeshwa na chanzo hicho. Kikokotoo hakibadilishi kipengele kutoka nchi nyingine kimya kimya.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Je, ninaweza kutumia vipengele vya gari-km na abiria-km?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Ndiyo, lakini chagua msingi unaolingana kabisa na kipengele hicho. Ingiza abiria-km kwa kipengele cha kila abiria na gari-km kwa kipengele cha kila gari.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Je, haya ni matokeo yaliyoidhinishwa au marekebisho ya kaboni?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Na. Ulinganisho huu wa msingi wa kivinjari sio orodha rasmi, uthibitishaji au ununuzi wa kukabiliana.","Electricity generation country":"Nchi ya kuzalisha umeme","Switzerland":"Uswizi","Norway":"Norwe","Factor year":"Mwaka wa sababu","Baseline":"Msingi","Action scenario":"Hali ya vitendo","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Matumizi ya umeme · kWh/mwaka","Heating use · kWh/year":"Matumizi ya kupasha joto · kWh/mwaka","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Umbali wa usafiri wa ardhini · km/mwaka","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Umbali wa ndege · abiria-km/mwaka","Other activity · amount/year":"Shughuli nyingine · kiasi/mwaka","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Kipengele cha kuongeza joto · kilo CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Chanzo cha kipengele cha kuongeza joto, tarehe na mpaka","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Kigezo cha usafiri wa ardhini · kilo CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Msingi wa sababu","Per vehicle-km":"Kwa kila gari-km","Per passenger-km":"Kwa kila abiria-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Chanzo cha kipengele cha usafiri wa chinichini, tarehe na mpaka","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Njia ya ndege · kilo CO2e/abiria-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Chanzo, tarehe na mpaka","Other factor unit name":"Jina la kitengo cha kipengele kingine","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Sababu nyingine · kilo CO2e/unit","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Chanzo cha sababu nyingine, tarehe na mpaka","Compare scenarios":"Linganisha hali","Load example":"Pakia mfano","Clear values":"Futa maadili","Download CSV":"Pakua CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Ingiza shughuli ya kila mwaka. Ongeza kipengele na chanzo kinacholingana kwa kila aina isiyo ya sifuri isipokuwa umeme.","Annual estimate by sector":"Makadirio ya kila mwaka kulingana na sekta","Baseline total":"Jumla ya msingi","Action scenario total":"Jumla ya hali ya vitendo","Change":"Badilisha","Change from baseline":"Badilisha kutoka msingi","Factor source":"Chanzo cha sababu","Activity":"Shughuli","Factor":"Factor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Kilo cha msingi CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Mchoro wa kilo CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Thamani zote zitasalia kwenye kivinjari hiki. Hakuna kinachopakiwa.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Data ya Umeme ya Kila Mwaka · CC BY 4.0 · imechujwa hadi Uswizi na Norwe; 2000–2025. Thamani ni ukubwa wa uzalishaji katika gCO2/kWh, iliyogeuzwa kuwa kgCO2/kWh. Hii sio sababu ya matumizi au mzunguko wa maisha.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Kwa vipengele visivyo vya umeme, tumia chanzo kinacholingana na nchi, shughuli, kitengo na mwaka wako. Taja ili uweze kukagua dhana baadaye.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Hesabu kila shughuli mara moja. Usiongeze jumla ambayo tayari inajumuisha mojawapo ya sekta zilizoorodheshwa.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Angalia kiasi cha shughuli, vipengele, vitengo vya kipengele na vidokezo vya chanzo. Shughuli chanya isiyo ya umeme inahitaji kipengele chanya na chanzo kilichotajwa.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Inaonyesha sekta za shughuli za {count}. Matukio yote mawili hutumia mawazo ya sababu sawa.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"abiria-km","user-defined unit":"kitengo kilichoainishwa na mtumiaji","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC KWA 4.0"},"ta":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"கார்பன் கால்தடம் காட்சி கால்குலேட்டர்","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"கார்பன் தடம் கால்குலேட்டர் — உமிழ்வு காட்சிகளை ஒப்பிடுக","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"மின்சாரம் மற்றும் வெப்பமூட்டும், போக்குவரத்து மற்றும் விமானங்களுக்கான ஆதார செயல்பாட்டுக் காரணிகளிலிருந்து வருடாந்திர CO2e மதிப்பிடவும். உங்கள் உலாவியில் தனிப்பட்ட முறையில் இரண்டு காட்சிகளை ஒப்பிடுக.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"மின்சாரம், வெப்பமாக்கல், தரைவழி போக்குவரத்து மற்றும் விமானங்களில் வருடாந்திர செயல்பாட்டை ஒப்பிடுக. மின்சாரம் தேதியிட்ட சுவிட்சர்லாந்து அல்லது நார்வே உற்பத்தி காரணியைக் கொண்டுள்ளது; பிற செயல்பாடுகளுக்கு, ஒரு காரணியை உள்ளிட்டு அதன் மூலத்தைக் குறிப்பிடவும்.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"எடுத்துக்காட்டு: சுவிட்சர்லாந்தின் 2025 எம்பர் தலைமுறை காரணியைப் பயன்படுத்தி 3,500 மற்றும் 2,800 kWh ஐ ஒப்பிடுக. இதன் விளைவு மின்சார உற்பத்தி மதிப்பீடு மட்டுமே; பிற செயல்பாடுகளுக்கு ஆதாரமான காரணிகளைச் சேர்க்கவும்.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"ஒவ்வொரு துறையும் அதன் காரணியால் பெருக்கப்படும் வருடாந்திர நடவடிக்கையாக கணக்கிடப்படுகிறது. செயல் காட்சியுடன் ஒரு அடிப்படையை ஒப்பிட, செயல்பாட்டு மதிப்புகளை மாற்றவும். இரண்டு காட்சிகளுக்கும் ஒரே காரணிகள் பொருந்தும், எனவே வேறுபாடு செயல்பாட்டு மாற்றங்களை பிரதிபலிக்கிறது.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"இது ஒரு காட்சி மதிப்பீடு, முழுமையான தனிப்பட்ட தடம், அதிகாரப்பூர்வ சரக்கு, தணிக்கை அல்லது ஆஃப்செட் சான்றிதழ் அல்ல. மின்சாரம் உற்பத்தித் தீவிரத்தைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது, நுகர்வு அடிப்படையிலான அல்லது வாழ்க்கைச் சுழற்சி காரணி அல்ல. வெப்பமாக்கல், போக்குவரத்து, விமானங்கள் மற்றும் பிற காரணிகள் உங்களால் வழங்கப்படுகின்றன மற்றும் அவற்றின் ஆதாரம் மற்றும் பொருந்தக்கூடிய அலகுகளைப் போலவே நம்பகமானவை.","Example":"எடுத்துக்காட்டு","How the estimate works":"மதிப்பீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","Carbon estimate questions":"கார்பன் மதிப்பீட்டு கேள்விகள்","Scope and data sources":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் தரவு மூலங்கள்","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"இது எனது முழுமையான கார்பன் தடத்தை கணக்கிடுமா?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"எண். நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் செயல்பாடுகளை மட்டுமே இது கணக்கிடுகிறது. இதில் உணவு, கொள்முதல், பொதுச் சேவைகள், கட்டுமானம் அல்லது தவிர்க்கப்பட்ட செயல்பாடு எதுவும் இல்லை.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"மின்சார காரணி எதை அளவிடுகிறது?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember நாடு மற்றும் ஆண்டு வாரியாக CO2 மின் உற்பத்தியின் தீவிரத்தை தெரிவிக்கிறது. இந்த மதிப்பீடு இறக்குமதிகள், கட்ட இழப்புகள், சப்ளையர் ஒப்பந்தங்கள் அல்லது அப்ஸ்ட்ரீம் லைஃப்சைக்கிள் உமிழ்வுகளை சரிசெய்வதில்லை.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"சூடு, பயணம் மற்றும் விமானம் காரணிகள் எங்கிருந்து வருகின்றன?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"நீங்கள் அந்தக் காரணிகளை உள்ளிட்டு, அந்த மூலத்தால் காட்டப்படும் மூல, தேதி, அலகு மற்றும் எல்லையை மேற்கோள் காட்டுகிறீர்கள். கால்குலேட்டர் மற்றொரு நாட்டிலிருந்து வரும் காரணியை அமைதியாக மாற்றாது.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"வாகனம்-கிமீ மற்றும் பயணிகள்-கிமீ காரணிகளை நான் பயன்படுத்தலாமா?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"ஆம், ஆனால் காரணியுடன் சரியாகப் பொருந்தக்கூடிய அடிப்படையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். ஒரு பயணிக்கான காரணிக்கு பயணிகள்-கிமீ மற்றும் ஒரு வாகனத்திற்கு வாகனம்-கிமீ என உள்ளிடவும்.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"இவை சான்றளிக்கப்பட்ட முடிவுகளா அல்லது கார்பன் ஆஃப்செட்களா?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"எண். இந்த உலாவி அடிப்படையிலான ஒப்பீடு அதிகாரப்பூர்வ சரக்கு, சான்றிதழ் அல்லது ஆஃப்செட் கொள்முதல் அல்ல.","Electricity generation country":"மின்சாரம் உற்பத்தி செய்யும் நாடு","Switzerland":"சுவிட்சர்லாந்து","Norway":"நோர்வே","Factor year":"காரணி ஆண்டு","Baseline":"அடிப்படை","Action scenario":"அதிரடி காட்சி","Electricity use · kWh/year":"மின்சார பயன்பாடு · kWh/வருடம்","Heating use · kWh/year":"ஹீட்டிங் பயன்பாடு · kWh/வருடம்","Ground transport distance · km/year":"தரை போக்குவரத்து தூரம் · கிமீ/ஆண்டு","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"விமான தூரம் · பயணிகள்-கிமீ/ஆண்டு","Other activity · amount/year":"பிற செயல்பாடு · தொகை/ஆண்டு","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"ஹீட்டிங் காரணி · கிலோ CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"ஹீட்டிங் காரணி மூலம், தேதி மற்றும் எல்லை","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"தரை போக்குவரத்து காரணி · கிலோ CO2e/கிமீ","Factor basis":"காரணி அடிப்படையில்","Per vehicle-km":"ஒரு வாகனத்திற்கு-கி.மீ","Per passenger-km":"ஒரு பயணிக்கு-கி.மீ","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"தரை போக்குவரத்து காரணி ஆதாரம், தேதி மற்றும் எல்லை","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"விமான காரணி · கிலோ CO2e/பயணிகள்-கிமீ","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"விமான காரணி ஆதாரம், தேதி மற்றும் எல்லை","Other factor unit name":"பிற காரணி அலகு பெயர்","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"பிற காரணி · கிலோ CO2e/அலகு","Other factor source, date and boundary":"பிற காரணி ஆதாரம், தேதி மற்றும் எல்லை","Compare scenarios":"காட்சிகளை ஒப்பிடுக","Load example":"உதாரணத்தை ஏற்றவும்","Clear values":"மதிப்புகளை அழிக்கவும்","Download CSV":"CSV ஐப் பதிவிறக்கவும்","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"ஆண்டு செயல்பாட்டை உள்ளிடவும். மின்சாரத்தைத் தவிர மற்ற பூஜ்ஜியம் அல்லாத ஒவ்வொரு வகைக்கும் பொருந்தும் காரணி மற்றும் மூலத்தைச் சேர்க்கவும்.","Annual estimate by sector":"துறை வாரியாக ஆண்டு மதிப்பீடு","Baseline total":"அடிப்படை மொத்தம்","Action scenario total":"செயல் காட்சி மொத்தம்","Change":"மாற்று","Change from baseline":"அடிப்படையில் இருந்து மாற்றம்","Factor source":"காரணி மூலம்","Activity":"செயல்பாடு","Factor":"காரணி","Baseline kg CO2e":"அடிப்படை கிலோ CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"காட்சி கிலோ CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"இந்த உலாவியில் எல்லா மதிப்புகளும் இருக்கும். எதுவும் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · வருடாந்த மின்சாரத் தரவு · CC BY 4.0 · சுவிட்சர்லாந்து மற்றும் நார்வேக்கு வடிகட்டப்பட்டது; 2000–2025. மதிப்புகள் gCO2/kWh இல் தலைமுறை தீவிரம், kgCO2/kWh ஆக மாற்றப்படும். இது நுகர்வு அல்லது வாழ்க்கைச் சுழற்சி காரணி அல்ல.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"மின்சாரம் அல்லாத காரணிகளுக்கு, உங்கள் நாடு, செயல்பாடு, அலகு மற்றும் ஆண்டு ஆகியவற்றுடன் பொருந்தக்கூடிய மூலத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். அதை மேற்கோள் காட்டவும், இதன் மூலம் நீங்கள் அனுமானங்களை பின்னர் மதிப்பாய்வு செய்யலாம்.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"ஒவ்வொரு செயலையும் ஒருமுறை எண்ணுங்கள். ஏற்கனவே பட்டியலிடப்பட்ட துறைகளில் ஒன்றை உள்ளடக்கிய மொத்தத்தைச் சேர்க்க வேண்டாம்.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"செயல்பாட்டின் அளவுகள், காரணிகள், காரணி அலகுகள் மற்றும் மூலக் குறிப்புகளைச் சரிபார்க்கவும். நேர்மறை மின்சாரம் அல்லாத செயல்பாட்டிற்கு நேர்மறையான காரணி மற்றும் மேற்கோள் காட்டப்பட்ட ஆதாரம் தேவை.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} செயல்பாட்டுப் பிரிவுகளைக் காட்டுகிறது. இரண்டு காட்சிகளும் ஒரே காரணி அனுமானங்களைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன.","kWh":"kWh","km":"கி.மீ","passenger-km":"பயணிகள்-கி.மீ","user-defined unit":"பயனர் வரையறுக்கப்பட்ட அலகு","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC ஆல் 4.0"},"te":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"కార్బన్ ఫుట్‌ప్రింట్ దృశ్య కాలిక్యులేటర్","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"కార్బన్ ఫుట్‌ప్రింట్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ — ఉద్గార దృశ్యాలను సరిపోల్చండి","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"తాపన, రవాణా మరియు విమానాల కోసం విద్యుత్ మరియు మూలాధార కార్యాచరణ కారకాల నుండి వార్షిక CO2eని అంచనా వేయండి. మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో రెండు దృశ్యాలను ప్రైవేట్‌గా సరిపోల్చండి.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"విద్యుత్, తాపన, భూ రవాణా మరియు విమానాలలో వార్షిక కార్యాచరణను సరిపోల్చండి. విద్యుత్తు స్విట్జర్లాండ్ లేదా నార్వే ఉత్పత్తి కారకాన్ని కలిగి ఉంది; ఇతర కార్యకలాపాల కోసం, ఒక కారకాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి మరియు దాని మూలాన్ని ఉదహరించండి.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"ఉదాహరణ: స్విట్జర్లాండ్ యొక్క 2025 ఎంబర్ జనరేషన్ ఫ్యాక్టర్‌ని ఉపయోగించి 3,500 మరియు 2,800 kWhని సరిపోల్చండి. ఫలితంగా విద్యుత్ ఉత్పత్తి అంచనా మాత్రమే; ఇతర కార్యకలాపాలకు మూల కారకాలను జోడించండి.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"ప్రతి సెక్టార్ దాని కారకంతో గుణించబడిన వార్షిక కార్యాచరణగా లెక్కించబడుతుంది. బేస్‌లైన్‌ను యాక్షన్ దృష్టాంతంతో పోల్చడానికి కార్యాచరణ విలువలను మార్చండి. ఒకే కారకాలు రెండు దృశ్యాలకు వర్తిస్తాయి, కాబట్టి వ్యత్యాసం కార్యాచరణ మార్పులను ప్రతిబింబిస్తుంది.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"ఇది దృష్టాంతం అంచనా, పూర్తి వ్యక్తిగత పాదముద్ర, అధికారిక జాబితా, ఆడిట్ లేదా ఆఫ్‌సెట్ సర్టిఫికేట్ కాదు. విద్యుత్తు ఉత్పత్తి తీవ్రతను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది, వినియోగం-ఆధారిత లేదా జీవితచక్ర కారకం కాదు. తాపన, రవాణా, విమానాలు మరియు ఇతర కారకాలు మీ ద్వారా సరఫరా చేయబడతాయి మరియు వాటి మూలం మరియు సరిపోలే యూనిట్‌ల వలె మాత్రమే విశ్వసనీయంగా ఉంటాయి.","Example":"ఉదాహరణ","How the estimate works":"అంచనా ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Carbon estimate questions":"కార్బన్ అంచనా ప్రశ్నలు","Scope and data sources":"స్కోప్ మరియు డేటా సోర్సెస్","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"ఇది నా పూర్తి కార్బన్ పాదముద్రను లెక్కిస్తుందా?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"నం. ఇది మీరు నమోదు చేసిన కార్యకలాపాలను మాత్రమే పూర్తి చేస్తుంది. ఇందులో ఆహారం, కొనుగోళ్లు, పబ్లిక్ సర్వీసెస్, నిర్మాణం లేదా ఏదైనా విస్మరించబడిన కార్యాచరణ ఉండదు.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"విద్యుత్ కారకం దేనిని కొలుస్తుంది?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember దేశం మరియు సంవత్సరం వారీగా విద్యుత్ ఉత్పత్తి యొక్క CO2 తీవ్రతను నివేదిస్తుంది. ఈ అంచనా దిగుమతులు, గ్రిడ్ నష్టాలు, సరఫరాదారు ఒప్పందాలు లేదా అప్‌స్ట్రీమ్ లైఫ్‌సైకిల్ ఉద్గారాల కోసం సర్దుబాటు చేయదు.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"తాపన, ప్రయాణం మరియు విమాన కారకాలు ఎక్కడ నుండి వస్తాయి?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"మీరు ఆ కారకాలను నమోదు చేసి, ఆ మూలం చూపిన మూలం, తేదీ, యూనిట్ మరియు సరిహద్దును ఉదహరించండి. కాలిక్యులేటర్ నిశ్శబ్దంగా మరొక దేశం నుండి కారకాన్ని భర్తీ చేయదు.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"నేను వాహనం-కిమీ మరియు ప్యాసింజర్-కిమీ కారకాలను ఉపయోగించవచ్చా?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"అవును, అయితే కారకంతో సరిగ్గా సరిపోలే ఆధారాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి. ఒక్కో ప్యాసింజర్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ కోసం ప్యాసింజర్-కిమీ మరియు ప్రతి వెహికల్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ కోసం వెహికల్-కిమీ అని నమోదు చేయండి.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"ఇవి ధృవీకరించబడిన ఫలితాలు లేదా కార్బన్ ఆఫ్‌సెట్‌లా?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"నం. ఈ బ్రౌజర్ ఆధారిత పోలిక అధికారిక ఇన్వెంటరీ, సర్టిఫికేషన్ లేదా ఆఫ్‌సెట్ కొనుగోలు కాదు.","Electricity generation country":"విద్యుత్ ఉత్పత్తి దేశం","Switzerland":"స్విట్జర్లాండ్","Norway":"నార్వే","Factor year":"కారకం సంవత్సరం","Baseline":"బేస్‌లైన్","Action scenario":"యాక్షన్ దృశ్యం","Electricity use · kWh/year":"విద్యుత్ వినియోగం · kWh/సంవత్సరం","Heating use · kWh/year":"తాపన వినియోగం · kWh/సంవత్సరం","Ground transport distance · km/year":"భూమి రవాణా దూరం · కిమీ/సంవత్సరం","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"విమాన దూరం · ప్రయాణీకుల-కిమీ/సంవత్సరం","Other activity · amount/year":"ఇతర కార్యాచరణ · మొత్తం/సంవత్సరం","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"హీటింగ్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"హీటింగ్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ మూలం, తేదీ మరియు సరిహద్దు","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"గ్రౌండ్ ట్రాన్స్‌పోర్ట్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ · కేజీ CO2e/కిమీ","Factor basis":"కారకం ఆధారంగా","Per vehicle-km":"వాహనానికి-కి.మీ","Per passenger-km":"ప్రయాణికుడికి-కి.మీ","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"గ్రౌండ్ ట్రాన్స్‌పోర్ట్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ మూలం, తేదీ మరియు సరిహద్దు","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"ఫ్లైట్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ · కేజీ CO2e/పాసింజర్-కిమీ","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"ఫ్లైట్ ఫ్యాక్టర్ సోర్స్, తేదీ మరియు సరిహద్దు","Other factor unit name":"ఇతర అంశం యూనిట్ పేరు","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"ఇతర అంశం · kg CO2e/యూనిట్","Other factor source, date and boundary":"ఇతర కారకం మూలం, తేదీ మరియు సరిహద్దు","Compare scenarios":"దృష్టాంతాలను సరిపోల్చండి","Load example":"ఉదాహరణను లోడ్ చేయండి","Clear values":"విలువలను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Download CSV":"CSVని డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"వార్షిక కార్యాచరణను నమోదు చేయండి. విద్యుత్ కాకుండా ప్రతి నాన్-జీరో వర్గానికి సరిపోలే కారకాన్ని మరియు మూలాన్ని జోడించండి.","Annual estimate by sector":"రంగాల వారీగా వార్షిక అంచనా","Baseline total":"బేస్‌లైన్ మొత్తం","Action scenario total":"యాక్షన్ దృశ్యం మొత్తం","Change":"మార్చు","Change from baseline":"బేస్‌లైన్ నుండి మార్చండి","Factor source":"కారకం మూలం","Activity":"కార్యాచరణ","Factor":"కారకం","Baseline kg CO2e":"బేస్‌లైన్ కేజీ CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"సినారియో కేజీ CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"అన్ని విలువలు ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి. ఏదీ అప్‌లోడ్ చేయలేదు.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · వార్షిక విద్యుత్ డేటా · CC BY 4.0 · స్విట్జర్లాండ్ మరియు నార్వేకి ఫిల్టర్ చేయబడింది; 2000–2025. విలువలు gCO2/kWhలో ఉత్పత్తి తీవ్రత, kgCO2/kWhకి మార్చబడతాయి. ఇది వినియోగం లేదా జీవితచక్ర కారకం కాదు.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"విద్యుత్ యేతర కారకాల కోసం, మీ దేశం, కార్యాచరణ, యూనిట్ మరియు సంవత్సరానికి సరిపోలే మూలాన్ని ఉపయోగించండి. దాన్ని ఉదహరించండి, తద్వారా మీరు అంచనాలను తర్వాత సమీక్షించవచ్చు.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"ప్రతి కార్యాచరణను ఒకసారి లెక్కించండి. ఇప్పటికే జాబితా చేయబడిన రంగాలలో ఒకదానిని కలిగి ఉన్న మొత్తాన్ని జోడించవద్దు.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"కార్యాచరణ మొత్తాలు, కారకాలు, ఫ్యాక్టర్ యూనిట్‌లు మరియు సోర్స్ నోట్‌లను తనిఖీ చేయండి. సానుకూల విద్యుత్-యేతర కార్యాచరణకు సానుకూల అంశం మరియు ఉదహరించబడిన మూలం అవసరం.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} కార్యాచరణ రంగాలను చూపుతోంది. రెండు దృశ్యాలు ఒకే కారకాల అంచనాలను ఉపయోగిస్తాయి.","kWh":"kWh","km":"కి.మీ","passenger-km":"ప్రయాణీకుడు-కి.మీ","user-defined unit":"వినియోగదారు నిర్వచించిన యూనిట్","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC ద్వారా 4.0"},"th":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณสถานการณ์รอยเท้าคาร์บอน","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"เครื่องคำนวณรอยเท้าคาร์บอน — เปรียบเทียบสถานการณ์การปล่อยก๊าซ","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"ประมาณการ CO2e ประจำปีจากปัจจัยด้านไฟฟ้าและกิจกรรมที่มาจากแหล่งที่มาสำหรับการทำความร้อน การขนส่ง และเที่ยวบิน เปรียบเทียบสองสถานการณ์แบบส่วนตัวในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"เปรียบเทียบกิจกรรมประจำปีในด้านไฟฟ้า เครื่องทำความร้อน การขนส่งทางบก และเที่ยวบิน ไฟฟ้ามีปัจจัยการผลิตที่ลงวันที่ในสวิตเซอร์แลนด์หรือนอร์เวย์ สำหรับกิจกรรมอื่นๆ ให้ป้อนปัจจัยและอ้างอิงแหล่งที่มา","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"ตัวอย่าง: เปรียบเทียบ 3,500 และ 2,800 kWh โดยใช้ปัจจัยการสร้าง 2025 Ember ของสวิตเซอร์แลนด์ ผลลัพธ์ที่ได้คือการประมาณการการผลิตไฟฟ้าเท่านั้น เพิ่มปัจจัยที่มาจากกิจกรรมอื่น ๆ","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"แต่ละภาคส่วนจะคำนวณเป็นกิจกรรมประจำปีคูณด้วยปัจจัยของมัน เปลี่ยนค่ากิจกรรมเพื่อเปรียบเทียบพื้นฐานกับสถานการณ์การดำเนินการ ปัจจัยเดียวกันนี้ใช้กับทั้งสองสถานการณ์ ดังนั้นความแตกต่างจึงสะท้อนถึงการเปลี่ยนแปลงของกิจกรรม","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"นี่คือการประมาณการสถานการณ์ ไม่ใช่ใบรับรองส่วนบุคคล สินค้าคงคลังอย่างเป็นทางการ การตรวจสอบ หรือใบรับรองออฟเซ็ตที่สมบูรณ์ ไฟฟ้าใช้ความเข้มข้นของการผลิต ไม่ใช่ปัจจัยการบริโภคหรือวงจรชีวิต คุณเป็นผู้จัดหาเครื่องทำความร้อน การขนส่ง เที่ยวบิน และปัจจัยอื่นๆ และเชื่อถือได้พอๆ กับแหล่งที่มาและหน่วยที่ตรงกันเท่านั้น","Example":"ตัวอย่าง","How the estimate works":"วิธีการทำงานของการประมาณการ","Carbon estimate questions":"คำถามเกี่ยวกับการประมาณค่าคาร์บอน","Scope and data sources":"ขอบเขตและแหล่งข้อมูล","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"สิ่งนี้คำนวณปริมาณการปล่อยก๊าซคาร์บอนทั้งหมดของฉันหรือไม่","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"No. รวมเฉพาะกิจกรรมที่คุณเข้าร่วมเท่านั้น ไม่รวมถึงอาหาร การซื้อ บริการสาธารณะ การก่อสร้าง หรือกิจกรรมใดๆ ที่ละเว้น","What does the electricity factor measure?":"ตัวประกอบไฟฟ้าใช้วัดอะไร?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember รายงานความเข้มข้นของการผลิตไฟฟ้า CO2 แยกตามประเทศและปี การประมาณการนี้ไม่ได้ปรับสำหรับการนำเข้า การสูญเสียกริด สัญญาซัพพลายเออร์ หรือการปล่อยก๊าซในช่วงต้นน้ำ","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"ปัจจัยด้านความร้อน การเดินทาง และการบินมาจากไหน?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"คุณป้อนปัจจัยเหล่านั้นและอ้างอิงแหล่งที่มา วันที่ หน่วย และขอบเขตที่แสดงโดยแหล่งที่มานั้น เครื่องคิดเลขไม่ได้ทดแทนปัจจัยจากประเทศอื่นอย่างเงียบๆ","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"ฉันสามารถใช้ปัจจัยระหว่างยานพาหนะ-กม. และผู้โดยสาร-กม. ได้หรือไม่","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"ใช่ แต่เลือกพื้นฐานที่ตรงกับปัจจัยทุกประการ ป้อน Passenger-km สำหรับปัจจัยต่อผู้โดยสาร และ Vehicle-km สำหรับปัจจัยต่อคัน","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"ผลลัพธ์เหล่านี้ได้รับการรับรองหรือการชดเชยคาร์บอนหรือไม่","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"No. การเปรียบเทียบโดยใช้เบราว์เซอร์นี้ไม่ใช่สินค้าคงคลัง การรับรอง หรือการซื้อชดเชยอย่างเป็นทางการ","Electricity generation country":"ประเทศผู้ผลิตไฟฟ้า","Switzerland":"สวิตเซอร์แลนด์","Norway":"นอร์เวย์","Factor year":"ปีแฟกเตอร์","Baseline":"พื้นฐาน","Action scenario":"สถานการณ์จำลองแอ็กชัน","Electricity use · kWh/year":"การใช้ไฟฟ้า · kWh/ปี","Heating use · kWh/year":"การใช้ความร้อน · kWh/ปี","Ground transport distance · km/year":"ระยะการขนส่งภาคพื้นดิน · กม./ปี","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"ระยะทางบิน · ผู้โดยสาร-กม./ปี","Other activity · amount/year":"กิจกรรมอื่นๆ · จำนวน/ปี","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"ตัวประกอบความร้อน · กก CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"แหล่งที่มาของปัจจัยความร้อน วันที่ และขอบเขต","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"ปัจจัยการขนส่งภาคพื้นดิน · กก CO2e/km","Factor basis":"พื้นฐานแฟคเตอร์","Per vehicle-km":"ต่อคัน-กม","Per passenger-km":"ต่อผู้โดยสาร-กม","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"แหล่งที่มา วันที่ และขอบเขตของปัจจัยการขนส่งภาคพื้นดิน","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"ปัจจัยการบิน · กก CO2e/ผู้โดยสาร-กม.","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"แหล่งที่มาของปัจจัยการบิน วันที่ และขอบเขต","Other factor unit name":"ชื่อหน่วยปัจจัยอื่น","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"ปัจจัยอื่นๆ · กก CO2e/หน่วย","Other factor source, date and boundary":"ปัจจัยอื่นๆ แหล่งที่มา วันที่ และขอบเขต","Compare scenarios":"เปรียบเทียบสถานการณ์","Load example":"ตัวอย่างโหลด","Clear values":"ล้างค่า","Download CSV":"ดาวน์โหลด CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"เข้ากิจกรรมประจำปี เพิ่มแฟกเตอร์และแหล่งที่มาที่ตรงกันสำหรับหมวดหมู่ที่ไม่เป็นศูนย์แต่ละหมวดหมู่ ยกเว้นไฟฟ้า","Annual estimate by sector":"ประมาณการรายปีตามภาคส่วน","Baseline total":"ผลรวมพื้นฐาน","Action scenario total":"ผลรวมสถานการณ์การดำเนินการ","Change":"เปลี่ยน","Change from baseline":"เปลี่ยนจากพื้นฐาน","Factor source":"แหล่งที่มาของแฟกเตอร์","Activity":"กิจกรรม","Factor":"ปัจจัย","Baseline kg CO2e":"พื้นฐาน กก. CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"สถานการณ์จำลอง กก CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"ค่าทั้งหมดจะยังคงอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ไม่มีอะไรถูกอัปโหลด","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · ข้อมูลไฟฟ้ารายปี · CC BY 4.0 · กรองไปยังสวิตเซอร์แลนด์และนอร์เวย์ 2000–2025 ค่าคือความเข้มข้นในการสร้างในหน่วย gCO2/kWh ซึ่งแปลงเป็น kgCO2/kWh นี่ไม่ใช่ปัจจัยการบริโภคหรือวงจรชีวิต","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"สำหรับปัจจัยที่ไม่ใช่ไฟฟ้า ให้ใช้แหล่งจ่ายไฟที่ตรงกับประเทศ กิจกรรม หน่วย และปีของคุณ อ้างอิงข้อมูลดังกล่าวเพื่อให้คุณสามารถตรวจสอบสมมติฐานในภายหลังได้","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"นับแต่ละกิจกรรมหนึ่งครั้ง อย่าเพิ่มผลรวมที่มีภาคส่วนใดส่วนหนึ่งที่ระบุไว้อยู่แล้ว","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"ตรวจสอบจำนวนกิจกรรม ปัจจัย หน่วยปัจจัย และบันทึกแหล่งที่มา กิจกรรมที่ไม่ใช้ไฟฟ้าเชิงบวกจำเป็นต้องมีปัจจัยบวกและแหล่งที่มาที่อ้างอิง","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"กำลังแสดงเซกเตอร์กิจกรรม {count} ทั้งสองสถานการณ์ใช้สมมติฐานปัจจัยเดียวกัน","kWh":"กิโลวัตต์ชั่วโมง","km":"กม","passenger-km":"ผู้โดยสาร-กม","user-defined unit":"หน่วยที่ผู้ใช้กำหนด","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC โดย 4.0"},"tl":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Carbon Footprint Calculator — Paghambingin ang Mga Sitwasyon ng Emisyon","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Tantyahin ang taunang CO2e mula sa elektrisidad at sourced activity factor para sa heating, transport at flight. Paghambingin ang dalawang senaryo nang pribado sa iyong browser.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Ihambing ang taunang aktibidad sa kuryente, heating, ground transport at flight. Ang kuryente ay may petsang Switzerland o Norway generation factor; para sa iba pang aktibidad, maglagay ng salik at banggitin ang pinagmulan nito.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Halimbawa: ihambing ang 3,500 at 2,800 kWh gamit ang 2025 Ember generation factor ng Switzerland. Ang resulta ay isang pagtatantya ng pagbuo ng kuryente lamang; magdagdag ng pinagmulang mga kadahilanan para sa iba pang mga aktibidad.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Ang bawat sektor ay kinakalkula bilang taunang aktibidad na pinarami ng salik nito. Baguhin ang mga halaga ng aktibidad upang ihambing ang isang baseline sa isang senaryo ng pagkilos. Ang parehong mga kadahilanan ay nalalapat sa parehong mga sitwasyon, kaya ang pagkakaiba ay nagpapakita ng mga pagbabago sa aktibidad.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Ito ay isang pagtatantya ng senaryo, hindi isang kumpletong personal na footprint, opisyal na imbentaryo, audit, o offset na sertipiko. Gumagamit ang kuryente ng generation intensity, hindi isang consumption-based o lifecycle factor. Ang pag-init, transportasyon, paglipad, at iba pang mga salik ay ibinibigay mo at kasing maaasahan lamang ng kanilang pinagmulan at mga katugmang unit.","Example":"Halimbawa","How the estimate works":"Paano gumagana ang pagtatantya","Carbon estimate questions":"Mga tanong sa pagtatantya ng carbon","Scope and data sources":"Saklaw at data source","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Kinakalkula ba nito ang aking kumpletong carbon footprint?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Hindi. Binubuo lamang nito ang mga aktibidad na iyong pinasok. Hindi kasama dito ang pagkain, mga pagbili, serbisyong pampubliko, konstruksyon, o anumang inalis na aktibidad.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Ano ang sinusukat ng salik ng kuryente?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Inuulat ng Ember ang CO2 intensity ng pagbuo ng kuryente ayon sa bansa at taon. Ang pagtatantya na ito ay hindi nagsasaayos para sa mga pag-import, pagkawala ng grid, mga kontrata ng supplier, o mga upstream na paglabas ng lifecycle.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Saan nagmumula ang heating, travel, at flight factor?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Ilalagay mo ang mga salik na iyon at banggitin ang pinagmulan, petsa, yunit, at hangganan na ipinakita ng pinagmulang iyon. Hindi tahimik na pinapalitan ng calculator ang isang salik mula sa ibang bansa.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Maaari ko bang gamitin ang vehicle-km at passenger-km factor?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Oo, ngunit piliin ang batayan na eksaktong tumutugma sa salik. Ipasok ang passenger-km para sa per-passenger factor at sasakyan-km para sa per-vehicle factor.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Mga sertipikadong resulta ba ito o mga carbon offset?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Hindi. Ang paghahambing na ito na nakabatay sa browser ay hindi isang opisyal na imbentaryo, certification, o offset na pagbili.","Electricity generation country":"Bansa na bumubuo ng kuryente","Switzerland":"Switzerland","Norway":"Norway","Factor year":"Taon ng salik","Baseline":"Baseline","Action scenario":"Senaryo ng pagkilos","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Paggamit ng kuryente · kWh/taon","Heating use · kWh/year":"Paggamit ng pampainit · kWh/taon","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Distansya ng transportasyon sa lupa · km/taon","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Distansya ng flight · pasahero-km/taon","Other activity · amount/year":"Iba pang aktibidad · halaga/taon","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Salik ng pag-init · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Pinagmulan, petsa at hangganan ng heating factor","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Batayan ng salik","Per vehicle-km":"Bawat sasakyan-km","Per passenger-km":"Kada pasahero-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Ground transport factor pinagmulan, petsa at hangganan","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Flight factor · kg CO2e/pasahero-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Pinagmulan, petsa at hangganan ng flight factor","Other factor unit name":"Iba pang pangalan ng unit ng salik","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Ibang salik · kg CO2e/unit","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Iba pang kadahilanan na pinagmulan, petsa at hangganan","Compare scenarios":"Ihambing ang mga senaryo","Load example":"Mag-load ng halimbawa","Clear values":"I-clear ang mga value","Download CSV":"I-download ang CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Ipasok ang taunang aktibidad. Magdagdag ng tumutugmang salik at pinagmulan para sa bawat hindi zero na kategorya maliban sa kuryente.","Annual estimate by sector":"Taunang pagtatantya ayon sa sektor","Baseline total":"Kabuuan ng baseline","Action scenario total":"Kabuuan ng senaryo ng pagkilos","Change":"Baguhin","Change from baseline":"Baguhin mula sa baseline","Factor source":"Factor source","Activity":"Aktibidad","Factor":"Factor","Baseline kg CO2e":"Baseline kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Sitwasyon kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Nananatili ang lahat ng value sa browser na ito. Walang na-upload.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Taunang Data ng Elektrisidad · CC BY 4.0 · na-filter sa Switzerland at Norway; 2000–2025. Ang mga value ay generation intensity sa gCO2/kWh, na na-convert sa kgCO2/kWh. Ito ay hindi isang kadahilanan sa pagkonsumo o lifecycle.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Para sa non-electricity factor, gumamit ng source na tumutugma sa iyong bansa, aktibidad, unit at taon. Sipiin ito upang masuri mo ang mga pagpapalagay sa ibang pagkakataon.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Bilangin ang bawat aktibidad nang isang beses. Huwag magdagdag ng kabuuan na kasama na ang isa sa mga nakalistang sektor.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Suriin ang mga halaga ng aktibidad, mga kadahilanan, mga yunit ng kadahilanan at mga tala ng pinagmulan. Ang positibong aktibidad na hindi kuryente ay nangangailangan ng positibong salik at isang binanggit na pinagmulan.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Ipinapakita ang {count} mga sektor ng aktibidad. Ang parehong mga sitwasyon ay gumagamit ng parehong mga pagpapalagay ng salik.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"pasahero-km","user-defined unit":"unit na tinukoy ng gumagamit","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC NG 4.0"},"tr":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Karbon Ayak İzi Senaryosu Hesaplayıcı","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Karbon Ayak İzi Hesaplayıcı — Emisyon Senaryolarını Karşılaştırın","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Isıtma, ulaşım ve uçuşlara yönelik elektrik ve kaynaklı aktivite faktörlerinden yıllık CO2e tahmini. İki senaryoyu tarayıcınızda özel olarak karşılaştırın.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Elektrik, ısıtma, kara taşımacılığı ve uçuşlardaki yıllık faaliyetleri karşılaştırın. Elektriğin eski bir İsviçre veya Norveç üretim faktörü vardır; diğer faaliyetler için bir faktör girin ve kaynağını belirtin.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Örnek: İsviçre'nin 2025 Kor üretim faktörünü kullanarak 3,500 ve 2,800 kWh'yi karşılaştırın. Sonuç yalnızca bir elektrik üretimi tahminidir; diğer faaliyetler için kaynaklı faktörler ekleyin.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Her sektör, yıllık faaliyetin kendi faktörüyle çarpılmasıyla hesaplanır. Bir temel çizgiyi bir eylem senaryosuyla karşılaştırmak için etkinlik değerlerini değiştirin. Aynı faktörler her iki senaryo için de geçerlidir; dolayısıyla fark, aktivite değişikliklerini yansıtır.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Bu bir senaryo tahminidir; tam bir kişisel ayak izi, resmi envanter, denetim veya denkleştirme sertifikası değildir. Elektrik, tüketime dayalı veya yaşam döngüsü faktörünü değil, üretim yoğunluğunu kullanır. Isınma, ulaşım, uçuşlar ve diğer faktörler tarafınızca karşılanır ve ancak kaynağı ve eşleşen üniteleri kadar güvenilirdir.","Example":"Örnek","How the estimate works":"Tahmin nasıl işliyor?","Carbon estimate questions":"Karbon tahmini soruları","Scope and data sources":"Kapsam ve veri kaynakları","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Bu, karbon ayak izinin tamamını hesaplıyor mu?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Hayır. Yalnızca girdiğiniz etkinliklerin toplamı alınır. Yiyecek, satın alımlar, kamu hizmetleri, inşaat veya ihmal edilen herhangi bir faaliyet buna dahil değildir.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Elektrik faktörü neyi ölçer?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember, ülkeye ve yıla göre CO2 elektrik üretim yoğunluğunu rapor ediyor. Bu tahmin, ithalat, şebeke kayıpları, tedarikçi sözleşmeleri veya üretime yönelik yaşam döngüsü emisyonları için ayarlanmaz.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Isınma, seyahat ve uçuş faktörleri nereden geliyor?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Bu faktörleri girip o kaynağın gösterdiği kaynağı, tarihi, birimi ve sınırı belirtirsiniz. Hesap makinesi başka bir ülkeden bir faktörü sessizce değiştirmez.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Araç-km ve yolcu-km faktörlerini kullanabilir miyim?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Evet, ancak faktörle tam olarak eşleşen temeli seçin. Yolcu başına faktör için yolcu-km'yi ve araç başına faktör için araç-km'yi girin.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Bunlar sertifikalı sonuçlar mı, yoksa karbon denkleştirmeleri mi?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Hayır. Bu tarayıcı tabanlı karşılaştırma, resmi bir envanter, sertifikasyon veya mahsup satın alma değildir.","Electricity generation country":"Elektrik üretimi ülkesi","Switzerland":"İsviçre","Norway":"Norveç","Factor year":"Faktör yılı","Baseline":"Temel Değer","Action scenario":"Eylem senaryosu","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Elektrik kullanımı · kWh/yıl","Heating use · kWh/year":"Isıtma kullanımı · kWh/yıl","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Karayolu taşıma mesafesi · km/yıl","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Uçuş mesafesi · yolcu-km/yıl","Other activity · amount/year":"Diğer faaliyet · tutar/yıl","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Isıtma faktörü · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Isıtma faktörü kaynağı, tarih ve sınır","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Kara taşıma faktörü · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Faktör bazında","Per vehicle-km":"Araç-km başına","Per passenger-km":"Yolcu-km başına","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Yer taşıma faktörü kaynağı, tarih ve sınır","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Uçuş faktörü · kg CO2e/yolcu-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Uçuş faktörü kaynağı, tarih ve sınır","Other factor unit name":"Diğer faktör birimi adı","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Diğer faktör · kg CO2e/birim","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Diğer faktör kaynağı, tarih ve sınır","Compare scenarios":"Senaryoları karşılaştır","Load example":"Yükleme örneği","Clear values":"Değerleri temizle","Download CSV":"CSV'yi İndir","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Yıllık aktiviteyi girin. Elektrik dışındaki sıfır olmayan her kategori için bir eşleştirme faktörü ve kaynağı ekleyin.","Annual estimate by sector":"Sektöre göre yıllık tahmin","Baseline total":"Temel toplam","Action scenario total":"Eylem senaryosu toplamı","Change":"Değiştir","Change from baseline":"Başlangıca göre değişiklik","Factor source":"Faktör kaynağı","Activity":"Aktivite","Factor":"Faktör","Baseline kg CO2e":"Temel kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Senaryo kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Tüm değerler bu tarayıcıda kalır. Hiçbir şey yüklenmedi.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Yıllık Elektrik Verileri · CC BY 4.0 · İsviçre ve Norveç'e göre filtrelenmiştir; 2000–2025. Değerler gCO2/kWh cinsinden üretim yoğunluğu olup, kgCO2/kWh'ye dönüştürülmüştür. Bu bir tüketim veya yaşam döngüsü faktörü değildir.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Elektrik dışı faktörler için ülkenize, faaliyetinize, biriminize ve yılınıza uygun bir kaynak kullanın. Varsayımları daha sonra gözden geçirebilmeniz için alıntı yapın.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Her etkinliği bir kez sayın. Listelenen sektörlerden birini zaten içeren bir toplam eklemeyin.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Aktivite miktarlarını, faktörleri, faktör birimlerini ve kaynak notlarını kontrol edin. Pozitif elektrik dışı aktivite, pozitif bir faktöre ve alıntı yapılan bir kaynağa ihtiyaç duyar.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} faaliyet sektörleri gösteriliyor. Her iki senaryo da aynı faktör varsayımlarını kullanır.","kWh":"kWh","km":"kilometre","passenger-km":"yolcu-km","user-defined unit":"kullanıcı tanımlı birim","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"uk":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Калькулятор сценарію викидів вуглецю","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Калькулятор вуглецевого сліду — порівняйте сценарії викидів","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Оцінка річного CO2e на основі електроенергії та джерел активності для опалення, транспорту та польотів. Порівняйте два сценарії приватно у вашому браузері.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"Порівняйте річну активність у сфері електроенергії, опалення, наземного транспорту та польотів. Електроенергія має датований фактор виробництва Швейцарії чи Норвегії; для інших видів діяльності введіть фактор і вкажіть його джерело.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Приклад: порівняйте 3,500 і 2,800 кВт-год, використовуючи швейцарський коефіцієнт генерації Ember 2025. Результатом є лише оцінка виробництва електроенергії; додати джерельні фактори для інших видів діяльності.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Кожен сектор розраховується як річна активність, помножена на його коефіцієнт. Змініть значення активності, щоб порівняти базову лінію зі сценарієм дії. Ті самі фактори застосовуються до обох сценаріїв, тому різниця відображає зміни активності.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Це оцінка сценарію, а не повний особистий відбиток, офіційна інвентаризація, аудит або сертифікат компенсації. Електроенергія використовує інтенсивність виробництва, а не фактор споживання чи життєвого циклу. Опалення, транспорт, перельоти та інші фактори надаєте ви і є настільки ж надійними, як і їх джерело та відповідні одиниці.","Example":"Приклад","How the estimate works":"Як працює кошторис","Carbon estimate questions":"Питання щодо оцінки вуглецю","Scope and data sources":"Обсяг і джерела даних","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Чи розраховується мій повний вуглецевий слід?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"№ Це підсумовує лише введені вами дії. Це не включає їжу, покупки, громадські послуги, будівництво або будь-яку пропущену діяльність.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Що вимірює коефіцієнт електроенергії?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember повідомляє CO2 інтенсивність виробництва електроенергії за країнами та роками. Ця оцінка не враховує імпорт, втрати в мережі, контракти з постачальниками або викиди протягом життєвого циклу.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Звідки беруться фактори опалення, подорожі та польоту?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Ви вводите ці фактори та посилаєтеся на джерело, дату, одиницю та межі, показані цим джерелом. Калькулятор мовчки не замінює коефіцієнт з іншої країни.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Чи можу я використовувати коефіцієнти транспортних кілометрів і пасажирських кілометрів?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Так, але виберіть основу, яка точно відповідає фактору. Введіть пасажиро-км для коефіцієнта на пасажира та транспортно-кілометрів для коефіцієнта на автомобіль.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Це сертифіковані результати чи компенсація вуглецю?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"№ Це порівняння на основі веб-переглядача не є офіційною інвентаризацією, сертифікацією чи офсетною покупкою.","Electricity generation country":"Країна виробництва електроенергії","Switzerland":"Швейцарія","Norway":"Норвегія","Factor year":"Фактор рік","Baseline":"Базова лінія","Action scenario":"Сценарій дій","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Використання електроенергії · кВт·год/рік","Heating use · kWh/year":"Використання опалення · кВт·год/рік","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Відстань наземного транспорту · км/рік","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Дальність польоту · пас.-км/рік","Other activity · amount/year":"Інша діяльність · сума/рік","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Коефіцієнт нагрівання · кг CO2e/кВт·год","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Джерело коефіцієнта опалення, дата та межа","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Наземний транспортний фактор · кг CO2e/км","Factor basis":"Факторний базис","Per vehicle-km":"За автомобіль-км","Per passenger-km":"На пасажиро-км","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Джерело фактора наземного транспорту, дата та межа","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Коефіцієнт польоту · кг CO2e/пасажир.-км","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Flight factor source, date and boundary","Other factor unit name":"Інша назва одиниці фактора","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Other factor · kg CO2e/unit","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Other factor source, date and boundary","Compare scenarios":"Порівняти сценарії","Load example":"Приклад завантаження","Clear values":"Очистити значення","Download CSV":"Завантажити CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Введіть річну діяльність. Додайте коефіцієнт відповідності та джерело для кожної ненульової категорії, крім електроенергії.","Annual estimate by sector":"Річний кошторис по галузях","Baseline total":"Базовий підсумок","Action scenario total":"Усього сценарію дій","Change":"Змін","Change from baseline":"Зміна від вихідного рівня","Factor source":"Джерело фактора","Activity":"Діяльність","Factor":"Коефіцієнт","Baseline kg CO2e":"Базова лінія кг CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Сценарій кг CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Усі значення залишаються в цьому браузері. Нічого не завантажується.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Річні дані про електроенергію · CC BY 4.0 · відфільтровано до Швейцарії та Норвегії; 2000–2025. Значення – це інтенсивність генерації в gCO2/кВт-год, перетворена в кгCO2/кВт-год. Це не фактор споживання чи життєвого циклу.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Для факторів, не пов’язаних з електроенергією, використовуйте джерело, яке відповідає вашій країні, діяльності, одиниці та року. Процитуйте його, щоб пізніше переглянути припущення.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Порахуйте кожну дію один раз. Не додавайте загальну суму, яка вже включає один із перелічених секторів.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Перевірте обсяги діяльності, фактори, одиниці факторів і примітки до джерела. Позитивна діяльність, не пов’язана з електроенергією, потребує позитивного чинника та посилання на джерело.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Показано сектори діяльності {count}. Обидва сценарії використовують однакові факторні припущення.","kWh":"кВт/год","km":"км","passenger-km":"пасажиро-км","user-defined unit":"одиниця, визначена користувачем","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"ur":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"کاربن فوٹ پرنٹ سیناریو کیلکولیٹر","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"کاربن فوٹ پرنٹ کیلکولیٹر - اخراج کے منظرناموں کا موازنہ کریں۔","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"حرارتی، نقل و حمل اور پروازوں کے لیے بجلی اور حاصل کردہ سرگرمی کے عوامل سے سالانہ CO2e کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ اپنے براؤزر میں نجی طور پر دو منظرناموں کا موازنہ کریں۔","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"بجلی، حرارتی، زمینی نقل و حمل اور پروازوں میں سالانہ سرگرمی کا موازنہ کریں۔ بجلی میں سوئٹزرلینڈ یا ناروے کا جنریشن فیکٹر ہے۔ دیگر سرگرمیوں کے لیے، ایک عنصر درج کریں اور اس کے ماخذ کا حوالہ دیں۔","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"مثال: سوئٹزرلینڈ کے 2025 ایمبر جنریشن فیکٹر کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے 3,500 اور 2,800 kWh کا موازنہ کریں۔ نتیجہ صرف بجلی کی پیداوار کا تخمینہ ہے۔ دیگر سرگرمیوں کے لیے حاصل شدہ عوامل شامل کریں۔","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"ہر شعبے کو اس کے عنصر سے ضرب دینے والی سالانہ سرگرمی کے حساب سے شمار کیا جاتا ہے۔ کارروائی کے منظر نامے کے ساتھ بیس لائن کا موازنہ کرنے کے لیے سرگرمی کی اقدار کو تبدیل کریں۔ ایک جیسے عوامل دونوں منظرناموں پر لاگو ہوتے ہیں، اس لیے فرق سرگرمی کی تبدیلیوں کی عکاسی کرتا ہے۔","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"یہ منظر نامے کا تخمینہ ہے، مکمل ذاتی نقش، سرکاری انوینٹری، آڈٹ، یا آفسیٹ سرٹیفکیٹ نہیں۔ بجلی پیداوار کی شدت کا استعمال کرتی ہے، نہ کہ کھپت پر مبنی یا لائف سائیکل عنصر۔ حرارتی، نقل و حمل، پروازیں اور دیگر عوامل آپ کے ذریعہ فراہم کیے جاتے ہیں اور صرف ان کے ذریعہ اور مماثل یونٹس کی طرح قابل اعتماد ہیں۔","Example":"مثال","How the estimate works":"تخمینہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Carbon estimate questions":"کاربن تخمینہ سوالات","Scope and data sources":"دائرہ کار اور ڈیٹا کے ذرائع","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"کیا یہ میرے مکمل کاربن فوٹ پرنٹ کا حساب لگاتا ہے؟","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"No یہ صرف ان سرگرمیوں کا مجموعہ ہے جو آپ داخل کرتے ہیں۔ اس میں کھانا، خریداریاں، عوامی خدمات، تعمیرات، یا کوئی چھوڑی ہوئی سرگرمی شامل نہیں ہے۔","What does the electricity factor measure?":"بجلی کا عنصر کیا پیمائش کرتا ہے؟","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember ملک اور سال کے لحاظ سے بجلی کی پیداوار کی CO2 شدت کی رپورٹ کرتا ہے۔ یہ تخمینہ درآمدات، گرڈ کے نقصانات، سپلائر کے معاہدوں، یا اپ اسٹریم لائف سائیکل کے اخراج کے لیے ایڈجسٹ نہیں ہوتا ہے۔","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"حرارتی، سفر، اور پرواز کے عوامل کہاں سے آتے ہیں؟","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"آپ ان عوامل کو درج کرتے ہیں اور ماخذ، تاریخ، اکائی، اور اس ماخذ کی طرف سے دکھائی جانے والی حد کا حوالہ دیتے ہیں۔ کیلکولیٹر خاموشی سے کسی دوسرے ملک کے عنصر کو تبدیل نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"کیا میں گاڑی-کلومیٹر اور مسافر-کلومیٹر عوامل استعمال کر سکتا ہوں؟","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"ہاں، لیکن اس بنیاد کو منتخب کریں جو عنصر سے بالکل میل کھاتا ہو۔ فی مسافر عنصر کے لیے مسافر کلومیٹر اور فی گاڑی کے عنصر کے لیے گاڑی کلومیٹر درج کریں۔","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"کیا یہ مصدقہ نتائج ہیں یا کاربن آفسیٹس؟","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"No براؤزر پر مبنی یہ موازنہ کوئی آفیشل انوینٹری، سرٹیفیکیشن یا آفسیٹ خریداری نہیں ہے۔","Electricity generation country":"بجلی پیدا کرنے والا ملک","Switzerland":"سوئٹزرلینڈ","Norway":"ناروے","Factor year":"فیکٹر سال","Baseline":"بیس لائن","Action scenario":"کارروائی کا منظرنامہ","Electricity use · kWh/year":"بجلی کا استعمال · kWh/سال","Heating use · kWh/year":"حرارتی استعمال · kWh/سال","Ground transport distance · km/year":"زمینی نقل و حمل کا فاصلہ · کلومیٹر/سال","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"پرواز کا فاصلہ · مسافر-کلومیٹر/سال","Other activity · amount/year":"دیگر سرگرمی · رقم/سال","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"حرارتی عنصر · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"حرارتی عنصر کا ذریعہ، تاریخ اور حد","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"گراؤنڈ ٹرانسپورٹ فیکٹر · کلوگرام CO2e/km","Factor basis":"فیکٹر کی بنیاد","Per vehicle-km":"فی گاڑی-کلومیٹر","Per passenger-km":"فی مسافر-کلومیٹر","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"گراؤنڈ ٹرانسپورٹ فیکٹر سورس، تاریخ اور حد","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"فلائٹ فیکٹر · kg CO2e/مسافر کلومیٹر","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"فلائٹ فیکٹر سورس، تاریخ اور حد","Other factor unit name":"دیگر فیکٹر یونٹ کا نام","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"دیگر عنصر · kg CO2e/unit","Other factor source, date and boundary":"دیگر عنصر کا ماخذ، تاریخ اور حد","Compare scenarios":"منظرناموں کا موازنہ کریں۔","Load example":"لوڈ مثال","Clear values":"واضح اقدار","Download CSV":"CSV ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں۔","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"سالانہ سرگرمی درج کریں۔ بجلی کے علاوہ ہر غیر صفر زمرے کے لیے ایک مماثل عنصر اور ذریعہ شامل کریں۔","Annual estimate by sector":"سیکٹر کے لحاظ سے سالانہ تخمینہ","Baseline total":"بیس لائن کل","Action scenario total":"کارروائی کا مجموعی منظرنامہ","Change":"تبدیلی","Change from baseline":"بیس لائن سے تبدیلی","Factor source":"فیکٹر ماخذ","Activity":"سرگرمی","Factor":"فیکٹر","Baseline kg CO2e":"بیس لائن کلو CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"منظر نامہ کلو CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"تمام قدریں اس براؤزر میں رہتی ہیں۔ کچھ بھی اپ لوڈ نہیں ہے۔","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · سالانہ بجلی کا ڈیٹا · CC BY 4.0 · سوئٹزرلینڈ اور ناروے کو فلٹر کیا گیا؛ 2000–2025۔ قدریں gCO2/kWh میں جنریشن کی شدت ہیں، جو kgCO2/kWh میں تبدیل ہوتی ہیں۔ یہ کھپت یا لائف سائیکل عنصر نہیں ہے۔","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"غیر بجلی کے عوامل کے لیے، ایک ایسا ذریعہ استعمال کریں جو آپ کے ملک، سرگرمی، یونٹ اور سال سے مماثل ہو۔ اس کا حوالہ دیں تاکہ آپ بعد میں مفروضوں کا جائزہ لے سکیں۔","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"ہر سرگرمی کو ایک بار شمار کریں۔ کوئی کل شامل نہ کریں جس میں پہلے سے درج کردہ شعبوں میں سے ایک شامل ہو۔","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"سرگرمی کی مقدار، عوامل، فیکٹر یونٹس اور سورس نوٹ چیک کریں۔ مثبت غیر بجلی کی سرگرمی کے لیے ایک مثبت عنصر اور حوالہ کردہ ذریعہ کی ضرورت ہوتی ہے۔","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"{count} سرگرمی کے شعبے دکھا رہا ہے۔ دونوں منظرنامے ایک ہی عنصر کے مفروضوں کا استعمال کرتے ہیں۔","kWh":"kWh","km":"کلومیٹر","passenger-km":"مسافر کلومیٹر","user-defined unit":"صارف کی وضاحت شدہ یونٹ","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"vi":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"Máy tính kịch bản dấu chân carbon","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"Máy tính dấu chân carbon — So sánh các kịch bản phát thải","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"Ước tính CO2e hàng năm từ điện và các hệ số hoạt động có nguồn gốc để sưởi ấm, vận chuyển và bay. So sánh hai kịch bản một cách riêng tư trong trình duyệt của bạn.","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"So sánh hoạt động hàng năm về điện, sưởi ấm, vận tải mặt đất và các chuyến bay. Điện có hệ số phát điện ở Thụy Sĩ hoặc Na Uy; đối với các hoạt động khác, hãy nhập một yếu tố và trích dẫn nguồn của nó.","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"Ví dụ: so sánh kWh 3,500 và 2,800 sử dụng hệ số phát điện 2025 Ember của Thụy Sĩ. Kết quả chỉ là ước tính sản lượng điện; bổ sung các yếu tố nguồn cho các hoạt động khác.","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"Mỗi lĩnh vực được tính bằng hoạt động hàng năm nhân với hệ số của ngành đó. Thay đổi giá trị hoạt động để so sánh đường cơ sở với kịch bản hành động. Các yếu tố giống nhau áp dụng cho cả hai kịch bản, do đó sự khác biệt phản ánh những thay đổi trong hoạt động.","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"Đây là ước tính kịch bản, không phải là dấu chân cá nhân hoàn chỉnh, kiểm kê chính thức, kiểm toán hoặc chứng chỉ bù đắp. Điện sử dụng cường độ phát điện chứ không phải yếu tố dựa trên mức tiêu thụ hoặc vòng đời. Hệ thống sưởi, vận chuyển, chuyến bay và các yếu tố khác do bạn cung cấp và chỉ đáng tin cậy bằng nguồn và đơn vị phù hợp của chúng.","Example":"Ví dụ","How the estimate works":"Cách hoạt động của ước tính","Carbon estimate questions":"Câu hỏi ước tính lượng carbon","Scope and data sources":"Phạm vi và nguồn dữ liệu","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"Tính năng này có tính toán toàn bộ lượng khí thải carbon của tôi không?","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"Không. Nó chỉ tổng hợp các hoạt động bạn tham gia. Nó không bao gồm thực phẩm, mua sắm, dịch vụ công cộng, xây dựng hoặc bất kỳ hoạt động nào bị bỏ sót.","What does the electricity factor measure?":"Hệ số điện đo lường những gì?","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember báo cáo cường độ phát điện CO2 theo quốc gia và năm. Ước tính này không điều chỉnh đối với hàng nhập khẩu, tổn thất lưới điện, hợp đồng với nhà cung cấp hoặc lượng phát thải trong vòng đời thượng nguồn.","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"Các yếu tố sưởi ấm, di chuyển và chuyến bay đến từ đâu?","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"Bạn nhập các yếu tố đó và trích dẫn nguồn, ngày tháng, đơn vị, ranh giới mà nguồn đó thể hiện. Máy tính không âm thầm thay thế một hệ số từ một quốc gia khác.","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"Tôi có thể sử dụng hệ số xe-km và hành khách-km không?","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"Có, nhưng hãy chọn cơ sở khớp chính xác với hệ số. Nhập hành khách-km cho hệ số mỗi hành khách và số xe-km cho hệ số mỗi phương tiện.","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"Đây là kết quả được chứng nhận hay là sự bù đắp lượng carbon?","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"Không. So sánh dựa trên trình duyệt này không phải là hàng tồn kho, chứng nhận hoặc giao dịch mua bù chính thức.","Electricity generation country":"Quốc gia sản xuất điện","Switzerland":"Thụy Sĩ","Norway":"Na Uy","Factor year":"Năm hệ số","Baseline":"Đường cơ sở","Action scenario":"Kịch bản hành động","Electricity use · kWh/year":"Sử dụng điện · kWh/năm","Heating use · kWh/year":"Sử dụng sưởi ấm · kWh/năm","Ground transport distance · km/year":"Khoảng cách vận chuyển mặt đất · km/năm","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"Khoảng cách bay · hành khách-km/năm","Other activity · amount/year":"Hoạt động khác · số tiền/năm","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"Hệ số gia nhiệt · kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"Nguồn, ngày và ranh giới của hệ số gia nhiệt","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"Hệ số vận chuyển mặt đất · kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"Cơ sở hệ số","Per vehicle-km":"Mỗi xe-km","Per passenger-km":"Mỗi hành khách-km","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"Nguồn, ngày và ranh giới hệ số vận chuyển mặt đất","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"Hệ số chuyến bay · kg CO2e/hành khách-km","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"Nguồn, ngày và ranh giới của yếu tố chuyến bay","Other factor unit name":"Tên đơn vị yếu tố khác","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"Yếu tố khác · kg CO2e/chiếc","Other factor source, date and boundary":"Nguồn, ngày và ranh giới của yếu tố khác","Compare scenarios":"So sánh các kịch bản","Load example":"Ví dụ về tải","Clear values":"Xóa giá trị","Download CSV":"Tải xuống CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"Nhập hoạt động hàng năm. Thêm hệ số và nguồn phù hợp cho từng danh mục khác 0 ngoài điện.","Annual estimate by sector":"Ước tính hàng năm theo ngành","Baseline total":"Tổng số cơ bản","Action scenario total":"Tổng kịch bản hành động","Change":"Thay đổi","Change from baseline":"Thay đổi so với đường cơ sở","Factor source":"Nguồn nhân tố","Activity":"Hoạt động","Factor":"Hệ số","Baseline kg CO2e":"Số kg cơ bản CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"Kịch bản kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"Tất cả các giá trị vẫn còn trong trình duyệt này. Không có gì được tải lên.","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · Dữ liệu điện hàng năm · CC BY 4.0 · được lọc tới Thụy Sĩ và Na Uy; 2000–2025. Giá trị là cường độ phát điện tính bằng gCO2/kWh, được chuyển đổi thành kgCO2/kWh. Đây không phải là yếu tố tiêu dùng hay vòng đời.","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"Đối với các yếu tố không liên quan đến điện, hãy sử dụng nguồn phù hợp với quốc gia, hoạt động, đơn vị và năm của bạn. Trích dẫn nó để bạn có thể xem lại các giả định sau này.","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"Đếm từng hoạt động một lần. Không thêm tổng số đã bao gồm một trong các lĩnh vực được liệt kê.","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"Kiểm tra số lượng hoạt động, hệ số, đơn vị hệ số và ghi chú nguồn. Hoạt động phi điện tích cực cần có yếu tố tích cực và nguồn trích dẫn.","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"Hiển thị các lĩnh vực hoạt động {count}. Cả hai kịch bản đều sử dụng các giả định về yếu tố giống nhau.","kWh":"kWh","km":"km","passenger-km":"hành khách-km","user-defined unit":"đơn vị do người dùng xác định","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BỞI 4.0"},"zh":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"碳足迹情景计算器","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"碳足迹计算器 — 比较排放情景","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"根据电力和供暖、运输和航班的来源活动因素估算年度 CO2e。在浏览器中私下比较两个场景。","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"比较电力、供暖、地面交通和航班的年度活动。电力具有过时的瑞士或挪威发电因素；对于其他活动，输入一个因素并注明其来源。","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"示例：使用瑞士的 2025 Ember 发电系数比较 3,500 和 2,800 kWh。结果只是发电量估算；添加其他活动的来源因素。","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"每个部门的计算方式为年度活动乘以其系数。更改活动值以将基线与操作场景进行比较。相同的因素适用于这两种情况，因此差异反映了活动的变化。","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"这是一个情景估计，而不是完整的个人足迹、官方库存、审计或抵消证书。电力使用发电强度，而不是基于消耗或生命周期的因素。供暖、运输、航班和其他因素均由您提供，并且其可靠性取决于其来源和匹配装置。","Example":"示例","How the estimate works":"估算如何进行","Carbon estimate questions":"碳估算问题","Scope and data sources":"范围和数据源","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"这可以计算我的完整碳足迹吗？","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"编号它仅汇总您输入的活动。它不包括食品、采购、公共服务、建筑或任何省略的活动。","What does the electricity factor measure?":"电力因数衡量什么？","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember 按国家和年份报告 CO2 发电强度。该估算未针对进口、电网损失、供应商合同或上游生命周期排放进行调整。","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"加热、旅行和飞行因素从何而来？","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"您输入这些因素并引用该来源显示的来源、日期、单位和边界。计算器不会默默地替换另一个国家的系数。","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"我可以使用车辆公里和乘客公里系数吗？","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"是，但请选择与因子完全匹配的基础。输入乘客公里数作为每乘客系数，输入车辆公里数作为每车辆系数。","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"这些是经过认证的结果还是碳抵消？","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"编号这种基于浏览器的比较不是官方库存、认证或抵消购买。","Electricity generation country":"发电国","Switzerland":"瑞士","Norway":"挪威","Factor year":"出厂年份","Baseline":"基线","Action scenario":"动作场景","Electricity use · kWh/year":"用电量·千瓦时/年","Heating use · kWh/year":"供热使用·千瓦时/年","Ground transport distance · km/year":"地面运输距离·公里/年","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"飞行距离·客公里/年","Other activity · amount/year":"其他活动·金额/年","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"加热系数·kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"加热因子来源、日期和边界","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"地面运输系数·kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"因子基础","Per vehicle-km":"每车公里","Per passenger-km":"每乘客公里","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"地面运输因子来源、日期和边界","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"飞行系数·kg CO2e/乘客-公里","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"飞行因子源、日期和边界","Other factor unit name":"其他因素单位名称","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"其他因素·kg CO2e/单位","Other factor source, date and boundary":"其他因素来源、日期和边界","Compare scenarios":"比较场景","Load example":"负载示例","Clear values":"清除值","Download CSV":"下载 CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"输入年度活动。为电力以外的每个非零类别添加匹配因子和来源。","Annual estimate by sector":"按行业划分的年度估算","Baseline total":"基线总计","Action scenario total":"动作场景总计","Change":"更改","Change from baseline":"与基线相比的变化","Factor source":"因子源","Activity":"活动","Factor":"因子","Baseline kg CO2e":"基线 kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"场景 kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"所有值都保留在此浏览器中。没有上传任何内容。","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · 年度电力数据 · CC BY 4.0 · 过滤至瑞士和挪威； 2000–2025。数值为发电强度，单位为 gCO2/kWh，转换为 kgCO2/kWh。这不是消耗或生命周期因素。","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"对于非电力因素，请使用与您的国家/地区、活动、单位和年份相匹配的电源。引用它，以便您稍后可以查看假设。","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"对每个活动计数一次。请勿添加已包含所列部门之一的总数。","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"检查活动量、因子、因子单位和来源注释。积极的非电力活动需要积极的因素和引用的来源。","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"显示 {count} 活动部门。两种情景都使用相同的因素假设。","kWh":"千瓦时","km":"公里","passenger-km":"乘客公里数","user-defined unit":"用户定义单位","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"},"zh_tw":{"Carbon Footprint Scenario Calculator":"碳足跡情境計算器","Carbon Footprint Calculator — Compare Emission Scenarios":"碳足跡計算器 — 比較排放情景","Estimate annual CO2e from electricity and sourced activity factors for heating, transport and flights. Compare two scenarios privately in your browser.":"根據電力和暖氣、運輸和航班的來源活動因素估算年度 CO2e。在瀏覽器中私下比較兩個場景。","Compare annual activity in electricity, heating, ground transport and flights. Electricity has a dated Switzerland or Norway generation factor; for other activities, enter a factor and cite its source.":"比較電力、暖氣、地面交通和航班的年度活動。電力具有過時的瑞士或挪威發電因素；對於其他活動，輸入一個因素並註明其來源。","Example: compare 3,500 and 2,800 kWh using Switzerland’s 2025 Ember generation factor. The result is an electricity-generation estimate only; add sourced factors for other activities.":"範例：使用瑞士的 2025 Ember 發電係數比較 3,500 和 2,800 kWh。結果只是發電量估算；增加其他活動的來源因素。","Each sector is calculated as annual activity multiplied by its factor. Change the activity values to compare a baseline with an action scenario. The same factors apply to both scenarios, so the difference reflects activity changes.":"每個部門的計算方式為年度活動乘以其係數。更改活動值以將基線與操作場景進行比較。相同的因素適用於這兩種情況，因此差異反映了活動的變化。","This is a scenario estimate, not a complete personal footprint, official inventory, audit, or offset certificate. Electricity uses generation intensity, not a consumption-based or lifecycle factor. Heating, transport, flights and other factors are supplied by you and are only as reliable as their source and matching units.":"這是一個情境估計，而不是完整的個人足跡、官方庫存、審計或抵銷證書。電力使用發電強度，而不是基於消耗或生命週期的因素。暖氣、運輸、航班和其他因素均由您提供，且其可靠性取決於其來源和匹配裝置。","Example":"範例","How the estimate works":"估算如何進行","Carbon estimate questions":"碳估算問題","Scope and data sources":"範圍與資料來源","Does this calculate my complete carbon footprint?":"這可以計算我的完整碳足跡嗎？","No. It totals only the activities you enter. It does not include food, purchases, public services, construction, or any omitted activity.":"編號它僅匯總您輸入的活動。它不包括食品、採購、公共服務、建築或任何省略的活動。","What does the electricity factor measure?":"電力因數衡量什麼？","Ember reports CO2 intensity of electricity generation by country and year. This estimate does not adjust for imports, grid losses, supplier contracts, or upstream lifecycle emissions.":"Ember 以國家和年份報告 CO2 發電強度。此估算未針對進口、電網損失、供應商合約或上游生命週期排放進行調整。","Where do heating, travel, and flight factors come from?":"加熱、旅行和飛行因素從何而來？","You enter those factors and cite the source, date, unit, and boundary shown by that source. The calculator does not silently substitute a factor from another country.":"您輸入這些因素並引用該來源顯示的來源、日期、單位和邊界。計算器不會默默地替換另一個國家的係數。","Can I use vehicle-km and passenger-km factors?":"我可以使用車輛公里和乘客公里係數嗎？","Yes, but select the basis that exactly matches the factor. Enter passenger-km for a per-passenger factor and vehicle-km for a per-vehicle factor.":"是，但請選擇與因子完全匹配的基礎。輸入乘客公里數為每乘客係數，輸入車輛公里數為每車輛係數。","Are these certified results or carbon offsets?":"這些是經過認證的結果還是碳抵銷？","No. This browser-based comparison is not an official inventory, certification, or offset purchase.":"編號這種基於瀏覽器的比較不是官方庫存、認證或抵銷購買。","Electricity generation country":"發電國","Switzerland":"瑞士","Norway":"挪威","Factor year":"出廠年份","Baseline":"基線","Action scenario":"動作場景","Electricity use · kWh/year":"用電量·千瓦時/年","Heating use · kWh/year":"供熱使用·千瓦時/年","Ground transport distance · km/year":"地面運輸距離·公里/年","Flight distance · passenger-km/year":"飛行距離·客公里/年","Other activity · amount/year":"其他活動·金額/年","Heating factor · kg CO2e/kWh":"加熱係數·kg CO2e/kWh","Heating factor source, date and boundary":"加熱因子來源、日期和邊界","Ground transport factor · kg CO2e/km":"地面運輸係數·kg CO2e/km","Factor basis":"因子基礎","Per vehicle-km":"每車公里","Per passenger-km":"每乘客公里","Ground transport factor source, date and boundary":"地面運輸因子來源、日期和邊界","Flight factor · kg CO2e/passenger-km":"飛行係數·kg CO2e/乘客-公里","Flight factor source, date and boundary":"飛行因子來源、日期和邊界","Other factor unit name":"其他因素單位名稱","Other factor · kg CO2e/unit":"其他因素·kg CO2e/單位","Other factor source, date and boundary":"其他因素來源、日期和邊界","Compare scenarios":"比較場景","Load example":"負載範例","Clear values":"清除值","Download CSV":"下載 CSV","Enter annual activity. Add a matching factor and source for each non-zero category other than electricity.":"輸入年度活動。為電力以外的每個非零類別添加匹配因子和來源。","Annual estimate by sector":"按行業劃分的年度估算","Baseline total":"基線總計","Action scenario total":"動作場景總計","Change":"更改","Change from baseline":"與基線相比的變化","Factor source":"因子源","Activity":"活動","Factor":"因子","Baseline kg CO2e":"基線 kg CO2e","Scenario kg CO2e":"場景 kg CO2e","All values stay in this browser. Nothing is uploaded.":"所有值都保留在此瀏覽器中。沒有上傳任何內容。","Ember · Yearly Electricity Data · CC BY 4.0 · filtered to Switzerland and Norway; 2000–2025. Values are generation intensity in gCO2/kWh, converted to kgCO2/kWh. This is not a consumption or lifecycle factor.":"Ember · 年度電力資料 · CC BY 4.0 · 過濾至瑞士和挪威；2000–2025。數值為發電強度，單位為 gCO2/kWh，轉換為 kgCO2/kWh。這不是消耗或生命週期因素。","For non-electricity factors, use a source that matches your country, activity, unit and year. Cite it so you can review the assumptions later.":"對於非電力因素，請使用與您的國家/地區、活動、單位和年份相符的電源。引用它，以便您稍後可以查看假設。","Count each activity once. Do not add a total that already includes one of the listed sectors.":"每個活動數一次。請勿新增已包含所列部門之一的總數。","Check the activity amounts, factors, factor units and source notes. Positive non-electricity activity needs a positive factor and a cited source.":"檢查活動量、因子、因子單位和來源註釋。積極的非電力活動需要積極的因素和引用的來源。","Showing {count} activity sectors. Both scenarios use the same factor assumptions.":"顯示 {count} 活動部門。兩種情境都使用相同的因素假設。","kWh":"千瓦時","km":"公里","passenger-km":"乘客公里數","user-defined unit":"使用者定義單位","2000–2025":"2000–2025","CC BY 4.0":"CC BY 4.0"}});
